<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">YEREMIA Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yer</para>
  <para style="mt2">YEREMIA</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia lasiɛ kayi di alɛɛ alafa-akuɛnsĩ kayentɛkɔ ku alɛɛ alafa-akuɔ kasɔ kakyekɔ kamɛ fiɛ di Kristo kamawa nii. Di Yaa ɔlaa nɔɔ obuɛ di obe kaanale kamɛ yi, aasĩ ɔlaa aata Yaa batii di letoko nanfi le nimawa ni di kale nwu suoto, ta kafiɔ-sumu ku sikpile lɛma oso. Aasiɛ nkpa aanya ɔlaa obuɛɔtɛ wɔ aabuɛ ni lɛwa kaanya di Babel batii ɔka Nebukadnesar labiɛ ni Yerusalem. Okpoo kplɛ nwu ku Olekatakɔ nwu kawɔɔ, ku Yuda ɔka ku batii kpinwu sɛlanle kamɛ osifi di Babel batii nfũ. Aabuɛ kafɔɔ di batii nwu odie di sɛlanle kamɛ ku ɔpɛ-okple osifi ku kale nwu okple ose lelolaa.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bɛɛsɛ Yeremia Kukũ</char> nwu di akudi ya mmle nikɔwa ni kamɛ: (1) Yeremia lɛlɛɛ. (2) Ɔlaa wɔ niakye ni Yaa nfũ kuata ni Yuda kale ku baka nɔɔ di Yosia, Yehoiakim, Yehoiakin ku Sedekia sɛka olebee kamɛ. (3) Sɛlaa se niakye ni Yeremia kukũ kpanatɛ Baruk nfũ, di sɛlaa obuɛɔtɛ ku sɛsaabla finle se niakye ni Yeremia nkpa disiɛbi nkyakaa nii. (4) Sɛlaa se niakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ di bafɔɔ nnle ateate suoto. (5) Sekofolaa se nikobuɛ ni Yerusalem obiɛ, ku sɛlanle kamɛ osifi di Babel kasɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeremia lale otii wɔ di ɔlaa nnu ni kafutu wlawla, aatɛ aabɔmbɔ ni batii nɔɔ nwaa, aale ni otii wɔ nitatuna alɛ bananfi ma ni kootoko. Di sɛlaa kpinwu kamɛ yi, aakakatɛ ku ninyinyi osie kanya di dibuo le aanya ni kamɛ, ta Yaa lalɛɛ nwɔ alɛ abale ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ oso. Yaa ɔlaa nwu late fɛle ɔtɔ di otu nɔɔ kamɛ- nioso atafuo nwu osuku otĩi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛlaa sewo niɛtɛ siefĩ silenke ni di kukũ nwu kamɛ lɛkakatɛ siɛwaalɛsa Yeremia omu dibuo ɔnyabee dialaadu ni dii le di kanya ninii fɔle kamawa nii. Nka di Yaa batii kamaklee ni di otuole kuonwii dilɔbanyumasa ma nii. Diekye babakpana ni di situ lɛma kamɛ (31.31-34).</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Yeremia lɛlɛɛ (1.1—19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛlaa obuɛɔtɛ di Yosia, Yehoiakim, Yehoiakin, ku Sedekia sɛka olebee kamɛ (2.1—25.38)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛsaabla di Yeremia nkpa kamɛ (26.1—45.5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛlaa obuɛɔtɛ oyila di nnle nwu suoto (46.1—51.64)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalem obuɛ (52.1—34)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Sɛlaa se mmle nle Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi Yeremia, aale ni olebatatɛ onwii lɛma di Anatot di Benyamin kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia di lefosi lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ di Yuda ɔka Amon obisuɔtɔbi Yosia sɛka olebee kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />Diafe ni di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka ole kamɛ, dialaadu ni kɔwɛntɛ nɔɔnle di lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia obe kamɛ, di obe wɔ di Yerusalem batii lasifi ni sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lɛlɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ,<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Latofo fɔ fiɛ labla fɔ di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">ladiki fɔ lase lete fiɛ baalofo fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">ladiki fɔ fɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ lata nnle.”<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Ni labuɛ nlɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ, nin-ye mmle mankakatɛ nii; obisɔ lete nle.”<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tambuɛ falɛ, ‘Obisɔ lete nle.’ Dikpeni fɛɛkyɛ otii biala nfũ lekpee fɔ ni fɛɛlaabuɛ ɔlaa lele lɛtɔkɔ fɔ. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Tanyɛkɛ ma, diekye nsiko fɔ, kamadiki fɔ kafɔɔ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ladiki kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aakpanko kanya nii, aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Nyu, ntɔɔyɔ sɛlaa nii lekpee di kanya lɛfɔ. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Nyu, miɛ ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lese di nnle ku sɛka nlekɔ kanya, alɛ faasisifi asaa, fambɛbɛɛ nya fantɛ kaasɔ, fanwɔɔsa asaa, fantakatɛ batii di akpomii, fantofo ayo, fampɛ asaa kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: “Yeremia, obe lɛsaa fɔɔnya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Ni ladiki kanya nlɛ, “Kɔnya blɔfɔ-akotoa owosola.”<verse eid="JER 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Feelolaa fɛɛnya nwaa, diekye konyu nlɛ ɔlaa nii kawa kaanya.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lakple kuawa kuatɛɛ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa fɔɔnya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Ni ladiki kanya nlɛ, “Kɔnya kabubukii kanwii nikofuu ni kɔbɔkɛtɛ kankye katookasɔ.”<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Ɔlaa kpile kamakye katookasɔ kunwa di batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Nfɛ kamalɛɛ batii ba bamuu ninkpe ni di katookasɔ sɛka nlekɔ nwu,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">“Baka lɛma bamuu kamawa mamase akakpomii lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">di Yerusalem n-yokontũ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">babayila mankyi seyoyiɛ se simuu niɛmana nwɔ siekyi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">manyila kafɔɔ di Yuda sekpoo simuu suoto.<verse eid="JER 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Kamananfi batii nii kootoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">ta akpilesaa lɛma ɔbla, beediɛ mi bɛɛtɛ ni oso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">boofiɛ olufui manta ni bayaa bamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">boosumu ni kafɔɔ asaa ya di nnɛɛ lɛma lɛbla nii.<verse eid="JER 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />“Yeremia lolaa suoto! Taka fayila, faatɔkɔ ma ɔlaa lele lɛtɔkɔ fɔ. Tanta ma baakpee fɔ difu, nse diele nkpo kamakpee fɔ difu di anu lɛma. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Miɛ ntɔɔbla fɔ okpoo kplɛ siene, lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ lɛkpaka ku lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle oyoyiɛ alɛ faataka fanyila di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto- fanyila di Yuda baka, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ, olebatatɛ nɔɔ ku kasɔ nwu batii suoto. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Babakpɛko fɔ, kafɔɔ blɔbalenkee fɔ, diekye nsiko fɔ, kamadiki fɔ kafɔɔ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Layɔ Nwu Olè Di Israel Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ, <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Kyɛ faalaayie lɛkya di Yerusalem atoko anu alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">“ ‘Konyuma onukwale wɔ niawɛ fɔ ni di sekpeele lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">fɛ ɔkafɔɔ di mmle faabɔmbɔ mi nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">faatikankoe buafe ni di ɔfaafuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">buafe ni di kasɔ ka batakpee ni alesaa kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Israel late klekle aata SAATE nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">awosobi nɔɔ lɛtɛsɛ kasale aale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">batii ba bamuu niakpanko nwɔ ni lawɛ letokonanfi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">ni di ɔlaa kpile latũ ma nɛ,’ ” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Bawa Sikpile</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Oo Yakob leyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:4">ku aye Israel batii nfaabi nwu mmuu, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa.<verse eid="JER 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Lɛmɛnsaa lalaale di bate lee lanya di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">oso baablasa suoto baasiɛ fanfa di suoto nii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Baatikanko afiɔ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">ni baabakple batii ba ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa mma bamu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Batakaalɛ alɛ, ‘Ɔfɛ di SAATE nwu nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">nnwɔ niakpaa wo aadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">aakpaa wo kafɔɔ aafenko ni di ɔfaafuu kasɔ ka niakpi ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">aafenko wo ni di ɔfaafuu ku afuɔnkaka kasɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Kasɔ ka niakoso ni, di ditunu lawɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">kasɔ ka di otii kuonwii ninkyɛ aafe nii, di kuonwii kafɔɔ diesi nii?’ <verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Lakpaa ye lawako kasɔ ka ninlɛ ni asaa nwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">nlɛ bibale ka awosobi ku asaa biene ninya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Kafɔɔ biawa biabakpɔnɔfɔsa kasɔ nii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">ni biabla atesaa nii diyududusaa nɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Olebatatɛ ditakaalɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">‘Ɔfɛ di SAATE nwu nkpe?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Mba nimblako ni kufiofa ɔkpɛ ditatofo mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">batunletɛ lataka baayila mi di suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nwu labuɛ sɛlaa di Baal leyooto kamɛ baatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">ni batikanko afiɔ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Layɔ Ɔlaa Di Batii Nɔɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />“Nkpo oso lɛyɔ ɔlaa di suoto lee,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 2:9">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">“Kamayɔ ɔlaa di bawa lee suoto kafɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Bitaalɛ bikyɛ Kiti batii lekpo kotoko bilaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">biekpee batii bakyɛ Kedar baalaalolaa asaa kamɛ banyu nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">baanyu nse lɛsaa lewo ntodiwa fɛle nle mmle okle:<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Kale kawo ntodikyɛlɛnsa bayaa lɛma bɛɛnya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">(Kafɔɔ batale bayaa saaa.)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Kafɔɔ batii nii ntɔɔkyɛlɛnsa Lɛkpa lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">beefũ afiɔ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Aye osi, bita nle mmle dibla ye ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">bietũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ kplɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 2:12">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />“Batii nii ntɔɔbla ekpile ɛnyɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Batoosĩ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">nkpa ntu nwu kataakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">ni beekutu mma bamu atubiɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">atubiɔ ya niebibiɛ ni, di ntu dilɔbafuo ni osiɛ kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Wɔ Niawa Ni Di Israel Batii Onukwale Ɔtanle Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />Israel kpɛmblatɛ ale, ɔlanle baalofo nwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">Ni obe oso atɔɔbakple kakpɛ kamɛ asaa?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Bakyata ntookumii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">beewi beekpee nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Batɔɔta kasɔ nɔɔ nte kafukuti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">bɛɛfiɛ sekpoo nɔɔ, ni siebiɛ site nɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Memfis ku Tapanhes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekpoo kplɛ ɛnyɔ be mmle lawɛ di Egipte kasɔ</char></note> sekpoo kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">ntɔɔlalaasa disi lɛfɔ lɛkakoto.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Diele afɔ omu niɛta nle mmle lɛwa fɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">di obe wɔ biesĩ ni SAATE Yaa lee nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">di obe wɔ aaleko fɔ ni katũ di osuku ɔkyɛ kamɛ?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Ni kanunua, obe oso fankyɛ Egipte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">fanaanyi ntu di Nil okle kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Obe oso kafɔɔ fankyɛ Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">fanaanyi ntu di Okle?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwu ninle Eufrate Okle nɛ</char></note><verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Sikpile lɛfɔ ole kamananfi fɔ kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">kamaa lɛfɔ okple kamalo fɔ lɛpɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Nioso bu nwu fanyu, faatofo kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">mmle diɛbla ni dikpilesaa, dikpeni kafɔɔ olo diɛta fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">nse feesĩ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">fanan-yɛkɛ mi ni,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 2:19">SAATE nwu niebuɛ, <optbreak /> SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni nɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Lasĩ SAATE Nwu Osumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />“Di obe owo nintɔbafe ni kamɛ, faasoosa atoo lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">faabubudi sikũ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ni faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Namasumu fɔ!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Nwaako, di lekpenkpe takale biala suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ku kowoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">fanklɛ fante fɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Kafɔɔ ɔsɔ lasɔ fɔ fɛle nta lewosobi biene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">di anwaa ku n-ya beetika ni disi kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Ni lɛ nfɛ feekyi feeyila mi di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">di lewosobi kpile lalaale kamɛ?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Kuntɛ feekpe ntu ku ofotole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">feekpe kwayɛ kpinwu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">lɛpɔɔ lɛfɔ okpi kunusũ nwu nteote di anu nii,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 2:22">SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />“Lɛ fabafuo obuɛ falɛ, ‘Ninkpɔnɔfɔsa suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">ee nintikanko Baal’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Nyu nkpa be faasiɛ ni di ɔtaata nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">faatofo lɛsaa le fɛɛbla ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Fale kapupɔnkɔ sanko wɔ nimpɛ ni sɛwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">antoso anfe ni katoo ku kala,<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />lepoo kamɛ bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo di ɔfaafuu kamɛ osiɛ ntɔɔkaa nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">anfiɔni ni kɔfɛɛfɔ di ɔkɔnsɔ akleesaa nɔɔ kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">owe nimafuo nwɔ osuku otĩi di ɔkɔnsɔ akleesaa nɔɔ osie kanya nwu kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Diɛkaatɛ alɛ basuɔtɔ lele nimiɛ nwɔ ni lekpee suoto lɛma kubuɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">di kɔwɛntɛ nɔɔ ofe kamɛ yi, babawɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Tantoso diediki obe wɔ di nkpaa lɛfɔ kamate ni nfukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">di owolonwo lɛfɔ lekoso nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Kafɔɔ faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Ole nnaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Mbɔmbɔ bafɔɔ bayaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">ni dikpeni ntikanko ma.’<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Lesiɛko Alɛ Baananfi Nwɔ Kootoko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />“Fɛ mmle mankpee ni yu sinunsɔ nse beemufũ nwɔ ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">nkpo kanya beekpee Israel leyo sinunsɔ nɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">mma, baka lɛma ku banɔɔfotii lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">olebatatɛ lɛma ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Mambuɛ mantɔkɔ owoso alɛ, ‘Afɔ ninle mi kote,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">mantɔkɔ difuɔ kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Afɔ nielofo mi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Batoomunikĩisa mmãa lɛma bɛɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">kafɔɔ diele anu lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">kafɔɔ nse ɔlaa letũ ma yi, mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Wa fabadiki wo!’<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Ɔfɛ nfɛ di bayaa ba biabla biata ni suoto lee nkpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">Bita ma bawa nse babafuo ye odiki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">nse ɔlaa letũ ye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Oo Yuda, diekye bikpe bayaa kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">fɛ mmle bikpe ni sekpoo.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />“Bitɔɔtaka bieyila mi ni di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">obe oso nfɛ biɔyɔ ɔlaa di suoto nii?”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 2:29">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />“Kasakasa lananfi batii lee kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">batayɔ nwu ole di ololaa nwu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Mpamii lee ntɔɔbɛbɛɛ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">fɛle kyata wɔ di kɔka nkle nii.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />“Aye kɔna ko mmle, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">“Ntodile ɔfaafuu lɛta Israel ɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">sɛɛ kasɔ ka niawɔfɔ ni tunutunu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Obe oso di batii nii mbuɛ alɛ, ‘Bukpe osuku munkyɛ munkyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">bulɔbasinwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ diidii’?<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Okpeele kafuo anyɛnɛ nɔɔ oyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">sɛɛ ɔkafɔɔ n-yee kɔyɔ nɔɔ aklɛɛsaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Kafɔɔ batii nii ntooyee mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">di ayi ya manaafuo ni ɔka.<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Mmle faye ni kamɛ nwaa di lɛbɔmbɔ obie kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">Bia basanko kpile kafuo asaa otekete di sisuku lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Batii nnya bapiitɛ ba ninambla ni okpile ntɔ be ninkpe ni nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">di akpeele lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">nu fatamufũ ma boobiɛ kokloo mambuo nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Kafɔɔ di n-ya mmle amuu sɛmaa yi,<verse eid="JER 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />foobuɛ falɛ, ‘Ninkpi lɛpɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">annya ɔblɔ akpeeko mi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Kafɔɔ kamananfi fɔ kootoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">diekye feebuɛ falɛ, ‘Nimbla okpile.’<verse eid="JER 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Obe oso fɔɔtɛ fankyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">fɔɔkyɛlɛnsa sisuku lɛfɔ nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Egipte kamakpee fɔ sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">fɛ mmle baakpee fɔ ni di Asiria.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Fabadie kafɔɔ di lɛba nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">ku nnɛɛ lɛfɔ otika di disi lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">diekye SAATE nwu ntoosĩ mba feetika ni disi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">blɔbakyakaako fɔ.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Ditale Onukwale</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />“Nse osuɔtɔ lesĩ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">di ɔsanko nwu lediɛ nwɔ ɛɛlaayɔ osuɔtɔ bamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">ni osuɔtɔ nwu kakple ansifi ɔsanko nwu ɔkyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">Diele kasɔ nwu bɔɔtɛ bɛɛlalaasa nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Kafɔɔ fatoosiɛ nkpa fɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ ku basɔnɔ kpinwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">nunua fabapɛfankple fanwa ɔkyɛ nii?”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 3:1">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />“Takatɛsa anu faanyu abokote ya niekpi ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Lɛba lewo nkpe manaditenko fɔ ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Fansiɛ di osuku kotoko fansoko basɔnɔ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">fansiɛ fɛle otii wɔ nikokyikyii ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Fatɔɔlalaasa kasɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">ku lɛsɔnɔkpee ku sikpile ole lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Nioso kanto dilosin-wiwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">kabiene kanto kafɔɔ diinɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Kafɔɔ anu lɛfɔ nte fɛle sɔnɔkpeetɛ ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">sinunsɔ dilosinkpɛ fɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Diele kanunua nwu fɛɛlɛɛ mi falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">‘Teete nii, siɛwo nii diayɔ ni di sibisɔ nii obe kamɛ,<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />fabanya ɔblɔ obe lele?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">Fabaklee oklee ɔblɔ yakayaka lɛfɔ nwu dinaa ni kaloo?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Nkpo kanya fankakatɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">kafɔɔ fambla okpile biala faafuo nii.”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikpeni Israel Ku Yuda Lekyisa Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Di Ɔka Yosia sɛka olebee kamɛ yi, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Fatɔɔnya lɛsaa le di Israel onukwale ɔtanle lɛbla ni? Atɔɔkata ɛɛkyɛ kobokote takale biala osi ku kowoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ ɛɛlaakpee asɔnɔ ninfa. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Lanyu nlɛ n-se atɔɔbla n-ya mmle amuu eeloo sɛmaa yi, abapɛankple an-wa ɔnkyɛ nii, kafɔɔ atakple aawa. Onukwale ɔtanle obilɛma-sankobi Yuda kafɔɔ lanya ni. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Lata Israel wɔ ninaa ni onukwale kusinkũ nɔɔ, latososa nwɔ aasifi, ta lɛsɔnɔkpee nɔɔ nimuu oso. Lanya kafɔɔ nlɛ lɛyɛkɛ kuninwii diesi di onukwale ɔtanle obilɛma-sankobi Yuda kamɛ; nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aadie aakyɛ aalaakpee asɔnɔ. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Ta lɛsaa biibii di Israel lɛsɔnɔkpee lale diatɔɔ ni oso yi, aakpɔnɔfɔsa kasɔ nwu, aalaasumu afuɔ ku awoso. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Di n-ya mmle amuu sɛmaa yi, onwukwale ɔtanle obilɛma-sankobi Yuda ditapɛaakple aawa ɔkyɛ nii ku otu nɔɔ omuu, kafɔɔ okũ ko aakũ aabla nkpo,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Israel wɔ ninaa ni onukwale lɛbla tinini alenke Yuda onukwale ɔtanle. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Tɔɔkyɛ faalaayie ɔlaa wɔ mmle lɛkya di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">“‘Israel wɔ ninaa ni onukwale, pɛfakple fawa,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Namasinnya ɔblɔ di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">diekye nyaami-nyatɛ nle,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Namanya ɔblɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Fũ lɛpɔɔ lɛfɔ okpi fakpee-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">fɛɛbla otokopĩ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">feediɛ suoto lɛfɔ fɛɛta bafɔɔ bayaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">di kowoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">ni feesĩ mi kotoko ɔkyɔɔ nɛ,’”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 3:13">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />SAATE nwu lebuɛ alɛ, “Batii ba ninaa ni onukwale bipɛbikple biwa, diekye ɔsa lee nle. Kamadiki ye- onwii nkyeko okpoo, banyɔ kafɔɔ nkyeko kafaabi- ninkpaa ye n-wako Sion. <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />N-se ntɔɔta ye batunletɛ ba niekye ni otu nii omu kamɛ, mba nimaleko ye ni katũ ku lɛsaatofo ku lɛsɔnu. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, nse bitɔɔpɔ biɛkpɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ nwaa di kasɔ nwu suoto,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “batii dilɔbasimbuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu.’ Dilɔbawa di asibu lɛma kamɛ ee banyuma ni diidii; dilɔbayu ee babla lɛbamba. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Di obe nwu kamɛ babalɛɛ Yerusalem alɛ SAATE nwu Lɛkakpomii, nnle nwu mmuu kafɔɔ kamasi di Yerusalem manta SAATE nwu leyooto dibu. Blɔbasintikanko situ lɛma onunsie akpilesaa nwu. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Di ayi nwu nkpo kamɛ yi, Yuda leyo kamakyakaa di Israel leyo suoto, mansi mandie di kasɔ nwu di katookasɔ suoto mansifi kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lee fɛ atesaa suoto.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Batii Nwu Afiɔ Kasumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />“Ami omu niabuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">“‘Kamaklee fɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ kanya fɛle babisuɔtɔbi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">nta ye kafɔɔ kasɔ ka ninlɛ ni nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">atesaa ya niɛtɛ alɛ alenke ni di kale lele ale suoto.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Lanyu nlɛ fabalɛɛ mi falɛ, ‘Teete’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">alɛ flaamunikĩi fasifi fadiɛ mi otikanko.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Kafɔɔ fɛle ɔsanko wɔ ninanle ni onukwale ata ni ɔsa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">Oo Israel leyo, nkpo fananle onukwale fatɛɛ nɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 3:20">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Boonu kaku di abokote ya niekpi ni osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">Israel batii kaku owi ku lekoto otikiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">diekye batɔɔkyɛlɛnsa ni sisuku lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">beeyee ni kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lɛma.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />“Batii ba ninaa ni onukwale, bipɛbikple biwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">kamabla ye onukwale ɔtanle nwu kɔfa.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">“Nwaako, bubawa fɔ ɔkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">diekye afɔ ninle SAATE Yaa loo.<verse eid="JER 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Nwaako, afiɔ kasumu nwu di akpenkpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">ku abokote nwu suoto nle kakyɔnkyɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">nwaako, di SAATE Yaa loo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">di Israel didiki nsi.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Diayɔ ni di sibisɔ loo obe kamɛ di sinunsɔ afiɔ lalalaasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">bawa loo ɔkpɛ ɔbla lɛsaawɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:24">babɔkɛɛ sele ku banankyue lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma.<verse eid="JER 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Bita buklɛbute di sinunsɔ loo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">biɛta anunsɔsaa loo atĩi wo suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">Buɔbla okpile di SAATE Yaa loo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">akyuu loo anyɔ, awo ku bawa loo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">diayɔ ni di sibisɔ loo diɛbadu ni miɛ dii le mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">butakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa loo ɔlaa kotoko.”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛlɛɛ Diɛta Ni Kakyi Di Sikpile Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />“Oo Israel, nse fabapɛfankple yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">faapɛfakple fawa ɔkyɛ nii,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 4:1">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">“Nse feekyisa diyududusaa afiɔ lɛfɔ nwu di anu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">alɛ flaasin-yu osuku kafɔɔ,<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />ni nse di onukwale ole, nwaako ku osuku tinini kanya yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">ni ka ntam falɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">ni abawii nnle nwu lɛtɔtrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">di nnwɔɔ kamɛ kafɔɔ babawɛ lɛkpa.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kɔtɔkɔ ni Yuda ku Yerusalem batii alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Bikpɛ afe di aputu lee kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">kafɔɔ batankpee asaa di siwuu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Bibla suoto ɔkyɛlɛnsa lee bita SAATE nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">biɛkyɛlɛnsa situ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">aye Yuda ku Yerusalem batii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">nse diele nkpo ni ɔblɔ nii kamataka fɛle ɔtɔ wɔ ninkofiɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ta akpilesaa ya biɛbla ni oso-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">kubafiɛ di kuonwii nnaa abaniisa nwu nii.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lafunaa Yuda Alɛ Katookasɔ Batii Kamadieko Ma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />“Biyie lɛkya di Yuda, biebuɛ di Yerusalem bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Bifɛ dikyukyoo di kasɔ nwu kamuu bifenko!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Bifaa osie kanya biebuɛ bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Bisi dikudi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Biɛta butoso busifi sekpoo kplɛ siene nwu kamɛ!’<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Bitakatɛ flankaa nwu katoo bikyɔɔ Sion!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">Bitoso biefũ nkpa lee, bitankyɛkyɛlɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Diekye kokyeko ɔlaa kpile katookasɔ nwako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">bia kawɔɔ siene.”<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Kyata ntoodie eekye lepoo nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">nnle nwu asaa-wɔɔsatɛ ntoodie kayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Atoodie di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">alɛ ɔɔbata kasɔ lɛfɔ nte kafukuti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Abata sekpoo lɛfɔ kamabiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">di batii dilɔbasiɛ sĩ ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Nioso biklee aboko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">biewi sɛnyaami biwi kaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">diekye SAATE nwu ɔblɔ yakayaka nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">kanya diiyɔɔ di suoto loo.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Di dii nwu suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">“Ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ otu kamakpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:9">difu kamapɛ olebatatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">nimbla kafɔɔ ɔlaababuɛtɛ ɔkpɛ.”<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Ninfɛ labuɛ nlɛ, Ao, SAATE Kplɛ, nyu mmle fɛɛtɛ fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ ni batii ba mmle ku Yerusalem feebuɛ ni falɛ, ‘Bibasiɛ ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ,’ di obe wɔ di kapamii ntika ni di sewolonwo loo.”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, babatɔkɔ batii ba mmle ku Yerusalem alɛ, “Kɔfɛɛfɔ kpankpa lekye abokote ya niekpi ni osi di ɔfaafuu kamɛ kɔfɛ kunfe batii nii ɔkyɛ, kafɔɔ diele nko nin-fɛ ni sɛsɔ ee kundiki ni akù; <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />kɔfɛɛfɔ ko ninkye ni ɔkyɛ nii ntɛ kun-wɛ osie kulenke nii. N-se ami ntoobuɛ akanko nii di suoto lɛma.”<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balo Lɛmana Yuda Beekyi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Nyu lo! Ɔɔwa fɛle alokonkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kɔwa fɛle kakitikɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ nkpe sɛwa balenke baklikpo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Buyɔɔsa! Butɔɔwɔɔ!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Oo Yerusalem, foto akpilesaa nwu di otu lɛfɔ, faawɛ didiki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Ɔmɛmbe fabaklee disibu kpile nwu faanaase?<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Sɛlɔ sinwii kodie sinkye Dan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">sioyie lɛkyɛ di ɔlaa kpile wɔ niekye ni Efraim abokote osi suoto.<verse eid="JER 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />“Bibuɛ nwu bitɔkɔ nnle nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">biyie nwu lɛkya bita Yerusalem bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">‘Bakpɛtɛ lekye kasɔ fanfa suoto bɔɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">bɔɔsa kakpɛ sinu di Yuda okpoo kplɛ suoto.<verse eid="JER 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Bɛɛmana okpoo kplɛ nwu beekyi fɛle batii ba nikonyu ni afe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">diekye batii nwu lɛtaka beeyila mi di suoto,’”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 4:17">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />“Afɔ omu ablasaa ku kɔkpaa dikibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">niɛta nle mmle lɛwa di suoto lɛfɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Nle mmle ninle letoko nanfi lɛfɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Nyu mmle dikpeni olo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Mmle diotofo ninkyɛ ni otu kamɛ!”<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Sɛnyaami Owi Ɔta Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Ao, otu nii, otu nii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Konu dibuo lo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ao, otu nii kɔkpa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Otu nii kɔpɛ di kamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">namafuo kanya ɔmaasa osiɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Diekye ntoonu dikyukyoo nwu sɛlɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">ntoonu kakpɛ nwu kudù.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Ɔlaa kpile ntikanko ɔlaa kpile bamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">kasɔ nwu kamuu ntɔɔlalaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Di nfanwu bɛɛwɔɔsa akpanta nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">dibula le nietĩi mi ni di obe kakuu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Ku omɛmbe kamanya kakpɛ flankaa nwu nnaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">kamanu kafɔɔ dikyukyoo nwu sɛlɔ?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />“Batii nii diebe anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">baaye mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Babi ba ninan-ye ni lɛsaa bale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">banaa lɛsɔnu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Baye akpilesaa ɔbla kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">baaye mmle mambla ni dibiene.”<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lanya Kawɔɔ Ka Nikɔwa Ni Di Odiki Otuo Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Lanyu kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">katawɛ letembi, kaate kafukuti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">lanyu osi kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">lɛkpa lɛma kafɔɔ ditawɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Lanyu abokote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">aatootũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">akpenkpe amuu latɔɔkpankpa.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Lanyu, batii kafɔɔ ditawɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">kansiɛ biala di kolo ntɔɔflɛlɛtɛ eesifi.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Lanyu, kasɔ ka ninlɛ ni asaa kafɔɔ labla ɔfaafuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">sekpoo nisĩ simuu labiɛ siate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">di SAATE nwu anu, di ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ anu.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:27">“Kasɔ kamuu kamalalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">nu ninamawɔɔsa ka fɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Nkpo oso kasɔ kamawi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">osi kaatoo kafɔɔ kamabla ditunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">diekye ntɔɔkakatɛ, namakplesa kanya kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">ntɔɔtɛ ɔbla, namasinkple sɛmaa.”<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Ta bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ ku akplɔ bayuntɛ kudu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">okpoo biala batii latoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Bawo labuo di apookuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">bawo lakata di afuɔnkpaa suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Sekpoo nwu simuu labiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">kuonwii diesinsi sĩ kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Ao, afɔ wɔ bɛɛwɔɔsa ni, obe fɔɔbla?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Obe oso fakle dibula sɛɛle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">feekpee kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle asaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Obe oso fɛɛkyankya anu lɛfɔ ku kɔfa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Kasakasa feelolaa suoto lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Basɔnɔ lɛfɔ ntoosĩ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">boomiɛ alɛ balo fɔ.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Konu kudu fɛ ɔsanko nikɔkpɛ kolofo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">atuuni fɛ ɔsanko wɔ nikolofo ni obi nɔɔ kasale-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Sion obisankobi di ninwuna diloowo ni lɛfaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">oowii ni nnɛɛ nɔɔ ambuɛ ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Ao! Kokpi lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">bɛɛyɔ nkpa nii beekpee di batii balotɛ nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Sikpile</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />“Biyie, biesoo di Yerusalem akpaka bife,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">binyu bifenko biɛnya asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">biewolaa di sebombo nɔɔ bifenko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Nse bibanya bia otii onwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">ninte ni tinini, antikanko ni onukwale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">ni kamayɔ sikpile nkyɛ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Kuntɛ mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa’ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">sɛlaa ku afunu ntam lete bɔɔka.”<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Oo SAATE, diele onukwale di anu lɛfɔ komiɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Fɛɛpɛ ma, kafɔɔ baanu dibuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">fɛɛwɔɔsa ma, kafɔɔ beesĩ lelolaa nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Bɛɛta anu lɛma nkpe osie alenke difuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">beesĩ kafɔɔ okyi di situ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Lanyu nlɛ, “Mba mmle bapiitɛ lete bale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">banaa disi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">diekye baaye SAATE nwu osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">Yaa lɛma afiofa nwu.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Nioso kamakyɛ batunletɛ nwu nfũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">ninaakakatɛ nta ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">nwaako mma baye SAATE nwu osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">Yaa lɛma nwu afiofa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Kafɔɔ bɛɛbla kanya kanwii, mma kafɔɔ beetekete atoo nwu bɛɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">ni bɛɛblasa suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Nkpo oso kyata di lepoo kamɛ kamadieko ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">ɔkplɛle niekye ni ɔfaafuu kamawɔɔsa ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">nɛɛfɔtɛ kamate ansoko ma di sekpoo-lɔɔkɔ lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">alɛ ababɛbɛɛ otii lele niɛnwaanii eedie kayi kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">diekye otokopĩ lɛma nkpe osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">kamaa-okple lɛma kafɔɔ mpɔ.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />“Obe oso kayɔ nkyɛ ye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Babi lee ntoosĩ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">bɛɛka ntam kafɔɔ di bayaa ba ninanle ni bayaa nfũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Lɛta ma asaa finle lɛma amuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">kafɔɔ beekpee asɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">mandie diikudi mankyɛ basɔnɔkpeetɛ ayo.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Bate fɛle bapɔnkɔsuɔtɔ ba di basanko nkle ni ɔkɔnsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">di suoto kɔfiɛtũ ni obiala di owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Ntaananfi ma kootoko ta nle mmle oso?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">“Ntaambla lakyisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">di kale ka ninte fɛ nka mmle suoto?<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />“Bifenfe di awosobi afe nɔɔ kamɛ biɛwɔɔsa ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">kafɔɔ bitanwɔɔsa ma fɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Bibɛbɛlɛ sɛla nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">diekye batii ba mmle diele SAATE nwu bale.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Israel leyo ku Yuda leyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">ditale onukwale omuu baatɛɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 5:11">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lasĩ Israel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Bɛɛlaa sɛlaa ku afunu di SAATE nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">beebuɛ alɛ, “Ɔlɔbabla lɛsalɛsaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Okpile kuonwii dilɔbawa wo di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">bulɔbanya kakpɛ ee kɔkà dilɔbakpɛ diidii.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Kɔfɛɛfɔ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">ɔlaa nwu kafɔɔ diesi ma kaamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">nioso bita bayɔ nle boobuɛ ni babla ma.”<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">“Ta batii nwu lɛkakatɛ ni sɛlaa se mmle oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">kamata sɛlaa nii di kanya lɛfɔ mbla ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">batii ba mmle kafɔɔ kamale ntɔɔni kubafiɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Ao Israel leyo,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">“Kɔwako kale kanwii di kakyonkɔ di suoto lɛfɔ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">saa kale ku kale ka ninkpe ni osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">batii ba sele minan-ye nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">batii ba lɛkakatɛ minoonu ni kasɔ.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Akpakyaa lɛma nte fɛle ɔkya wɔ nietikiti kute nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">bamuu lɛma nle bakpɛtɛ siene.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Babale kofe asaa ya biɛwɛ ni ku alesaa lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">mambɛbɛɛ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">babawee bafoso ku banankyue lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">manwɔɔsa owosobi afe ku abue awoso lee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Ku kapamii babawɔɔsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">sekpoo kplɛ siene se bietika ni disi.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ bia di ayi nwu nkpo kamɛ yi, namawɔɔsa ye fɛɛ. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Ni nse batii nwu lɛkaalɛ alɛ, ‘Obe oso di SAATE Yaa loo nwu lɛbla wo asaa ya mmle nwu amuu?’ yi, biɛtɔkɔ ma bilɛ, ‘Fɛ mmle biesĩ mi nii, biɛkyɛ biosumu ni bafɔɔ bayaa di kasɔ lee kamu suoto yi, nioso di kanunua bibasumu bafɔɔ di kasɔ ka ninanle ye ni kale kamu suoto nɛ.’<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />“Yie lɛkya di ɔlaa wɔ mmle fata Yakob leyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">faabuɛ nwu kafɔɔ di Yuda falɛ;<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />Binu ɔlaa wɔ mmle, aye ba ninaa ni disi ku batii ba ninan-ye ni lɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">bikpe ni anu kafɔɔ bilɔɔnya ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">bikpe ni atoko kafɔɔ biloonu ni:<verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Bilɔbayɛkɛ mi?” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">“Bilɔbatũtũkũ di anu nii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Lɛyɔ ɔtɛnsĩa lɛbla kɔmɛ lɛta lekpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">kule ni kɔmɛ ko ninaa ni kaloo di lekpo dilɔbafuo ni ɔwaalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Dibafuo ɔpɛ omunu, kafɔɔ dilɔbafuo kɔmɛ nwu ɔtaalɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">dibafuo kudu oyiisa, kafɔɔ dilaafuo ɔtɛnsĩa nwu ɔwaalɛ ofe.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Kafɔɔ batii ba mmle nkpe otokopĩ ku onunsie situ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">batoomunikĩi bɛɛkyɛ beesifi.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Blɔɔtɔkɔ suoto lɛma alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">‘Bita buyɛkɛ SAATE Yaa loo nwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">nnwɔ ninta ni kabiene ku kɔkyɛɛ kanto di obe kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">anta wo ni alesaa obe lele di ayi akuɛnsĩ biala kamɛ.’<verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lee nintɔɔta nle mmle lɛkyɛ diokyo nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">sikpile lee nintɔɔta dibiene leyu ye nɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />“Amumu batii nsi di batii nii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">bate kala fɛle mmle di batii nkyɔɔ ni bakansiɛ dikyĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">bate ni kafɔɔ fɛle mba ninkyɔɔ ni batii sikũ mammfũ ma nii.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Fɛle lɛkansiɛyo le di bakansiɛ leyii ni pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">ayo lɛma leyii ku kakyɔnkyɔ asaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">batɔbakple asaa-bawɛntɛ ku basientɛ<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />ni batɔɔwɛ lɛla beemuɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Akpilesaa lɛma ablasaa nnaa kase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">mammbuɛ ɔlaa onukwale kanya baata bakuɛbi lale lɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">mannkpɛ kakpɛ baata bapiitɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Ntaananfi ma kootoko ta nle mmle oso?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">“Ntaambla lakyisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">di kale ka ninte ni fɛ nka mmle suoto?<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />“Lɛyɛkɛsaa ku ɔfɔɔasifisaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">ntɔɔwa di kasɔ nwu suoto:<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />Ɔlaabubuɛtɛtɛ kobuɛ sɛlaa ku afunu mantɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">olebatatɛ kole sɛka di mma bamu osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">batii nii kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ ni, di osuku wɔ mmle suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Kafɔɔ obe bibabla di kayɛntɛkɔ?<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Balo Lamana Yerusalem Baakyi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />“Benyamin batii, bitoso biefũ suoto lee nkpa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Bitoso bidie di Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Bifɛ dikyukyoo di Tekoa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Bise flankaa di Bet Hakerem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Diekye ɔlaa kpile kodie di katookasɔ kunwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">kubale bia kawɔɔ siene.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Kamawɔɔsa Sion obisankobi nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">niatɛ aalɛ ni sekpeele baakpee ni sibi.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Bafosobakpatɛ ku bafoso lɛma kamataka nwɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">babase akpanta lɛma mankyisa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">obiala lɛma kamawee sɛfa di lɛba nɔɔ nimu.”<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />“Bilolaa suoto biɛtaka kakpɛ di suoto nɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">Bitaka, biɛta budieko nwɔ ku kakũ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Kafɔɔ, buyɔɔsa, kayi nfɛ kɔwakasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">kale kamaloo nunua.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Nioso bitaka, biɛta budieko nwɔ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">buobibiɛ lɛkayo nɔɔ!”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Bibudi awoso nwu bɛtɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">biete kala di Yerusalem suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Dikpeni bɛɛnanfi okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">batii onyinka leyii nwu kamɛ pɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Fɛ mmle di ditubiɔ ntɔɔta ni ntu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">nkpo di nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ antɔɔbla amumu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Kudú okpee ku kasaalalaasa nkpe di Yerusalem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">sifiɛ nɔɔ ku nkɔ nɔɔ nte di anu nii obe lele.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Oo Yerusalem, lolaa fanyu nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">nse diele nkpo kamakyɛ ndiɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">ninta kasɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nte kafukuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">di otii kuonwii dilaafuo ni osie ninka suoto.”<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Batokopĩtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Nnya Ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Ta ma basiisa batii ba niebu ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">fɛ nta lewosobi nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">kple fanyinka kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ di sɛla nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">fɛle mmle di otii nsiisa ni awosobi.”<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Owe kafuo ɔkakatɛ ɔta, nsĩ ɔlaa nta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Owe nimakyɔɔ mi atoko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Atoko lɛma letĩi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">nioso blɔbafuo onu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">SAATE nwu ɔlaa nle dikpilesaa kuɔta ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">suoto ninn-yɔɔ ma ninwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Nioso SAATE nwu ɔblɔ leyii mi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">namasinfuo otu okpee.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Soosa ɔblɔ nwu di babisɔ ba di lɛkpaka suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ku bakosopo ba niesi ni dikudi suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">kubadieko ɔsa ku ɔsɔfɔ, akyuu nwu anyɔ ninwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ku banɔɔfo ba nintoobe bɛɛkyɛ ni sitũ di alɛɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Babayɔ ayo lɛma manta batii bamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">di afe lɛma ku basɔfɔ lɛma nkyakaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">nse lɛnanfi kɔnɛɛ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">di mba ninsi ni di kasɔ nwu suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 6:12">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />“Diɛyɔ ni di obisɔ diɛlaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">bamuu lɛsɛɛsa anu di lɛsaawɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku olebatatɛ nkyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">bamuu nlaa sɛlaa ku afunu.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Mankaasa batii nii nkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">fɛ ninu diɛsɛɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Atoko ɔkyɛ ole, atoko ɔkyɛ ole,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">di obe wɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole nnaa nii.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Sinunsɔ kɔkpɛ ma di ayududusa ya bɛɛbla ni oso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Oowo, sinunsɔ dilɔkpɛ ma saa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">baaye bia mmle manunsɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Nioso babanɔɔ di banɔɔtɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">babawakosa ma kasɔ nse lɛnanfi ma kootoko,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 6:15">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Lasĩ SAATE Nwu Osuku</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Biyila di esuku nkyakakɔ bienyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">bikaalɛ saa bakofo nkpaa sisuku nwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">bikaalɛ nfũ di osuku biene nkpe ni, biɛkyɛ ninwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">ni bibawɛ ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ minta sɛkla lee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Kafɔɔ biabuɛ bilɛ, ‘Bulɔbakyɛ ninwu suoto.’<verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Ladiki banyuntɛ di suoto lee labuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Bikyɔɔ dikyukyoo nwu sɛlɔ atoko!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">kafɔɔ biabuɛ bilɛ, ‘Bulɔbakyɔɔ atoko.’<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Oo nnle, nkpo oso binu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">Oo kamaabayilatɛ, bitofo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">lɛsaa le nimawa ni di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Oo kasɔ, kyɔɔ atoko faanu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">kɔwako ɔlaa kpile di batii ba mmle suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">di abi kamatika ni di ɔsaabla lɛma nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">diekye batakyɔɔ sɛlaa nii atoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">baasĩ kafɔɔ kufiofa nii.<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Obe kamɛ dikpe mi di olufui wɔ niekye ni Saba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">ee akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa ya niekye ni kasɔ kyonle suoto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Ninnfũ ofiɛ asaaɔta lee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">seleɔta lee kafɔɔ nimbuo mi anu.”<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Kamatɛ osuku atĩisaa di batii ba mmle anu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">Babibate ku babi bamuu kamatuula ninya suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">basiɛwo ku mba ninsi bakaako ma ni kamakpi.”<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Ladie Kaakye Katookasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">“Nyu lo, bakpɛtɛ lekye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">katookasɔ kale bɔɔwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">kale kplɛ kanwii kɔtaka kankye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Bakle kɔtaa ku akplɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">bakpe amumu manannya ni otii nyaami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Kudú lɛma kodie fɛle lekpo le nikɔkpɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">nse basi di bapɔnkɔ lɛma suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">man-wa fɛle batii ba nielolaa suoto bɛɛta ni kakpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">alɛ bɔɔbadieko fɔ ni, afɔ Sion Obisankobi.”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Butoonu ma suoto sɛlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">nnɛɛ lefee wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Lɛyɛkɛ lɛpɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">buonu dibuo fɛle ɔsanko wɔ nikɔkpɛ ni kolofo.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Bitandie biakyɛ afe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">ee biakyɛ di sisuku suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">diekye lo nwu nkle kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">difu kafɔɔ nkpe di ɔfankyi biala.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Ao batii nii, biklee aboko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">biɛpɛ bimunu di ntɔ̀ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">biewi kaku osie kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">fɛ otii wɔ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ onwii nwu lete niekpi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">diekye asaa-wɔɔsatɛ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">kamawa amafua wo.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />“Yeremia, ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lɛbla otii wɔ ninsɔ abɔɔsaa an-nyu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">batii nii kafɔɔ ninle lekpetefuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">alɛ faanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">fansɔ kafɔɔ sisuku lɛma fan-nyu.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Kudú bakpeetɛ banunsientɛ di bamuu lɛma nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">bookyi manlalaasa ni batii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Abɔɔsaa sɛɛle ku abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ bale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">bamuu lɛma ndiki kalalaa kɔkpaa.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Man-fɛ ɔtɔ osie kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">alɛ oofiɛ lɛbɔɔsaa nutũle ku ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">kafɔɔ ɔnyanakĩisa nwu mbla kasakasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">bakplitɛ nin-ndie di kamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JER 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Man-lɛɛ ma alɛ koto fututu ko beesĩ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:30">diekye SAATE nwu lesĩ ma.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Labuɛ Yaa Ɔlaa Di Olekatakɔ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ kuata ni Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“Yila di SAATE nwu leyo kayoko faayie lɛkya di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto ninfa falɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 7:2">“ ‘Binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa, aye Yuda batii ba bamuu ninfe ni di n-yoko be mmle kamɛ minwa mimasumu ni SAATE nwu: <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bilolaa sisuku lee ku ablasaa lee, ni kamata ye minsiɛ di lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Bitantika disi di sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa suoto biabuɛ bilɛ, “Nnya SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, SAATE nwu olekatakɔ!” <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Nse nwaako biɛkyɛlɛnsa sisuku lee ku ablasaa lee biɛka kafɔɔ lɛka biene di bawo lee kamɛ, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />nse bieenyinka bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ee bakpisɔfɔ minanwii kafɔɔ batii ba ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ ntɔ kaasɔ di lɛba le mmle nwu, nse biɛlaatikanko kafɔɔ bayaa bamba alɛ diale dikpilesaa ninta aye bamu yi, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />ni kamata ye minsiɛ di lɛba le mmle, di kasɔ ka layɔ lata ni bawa le dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="JER 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Kafɔɔ nyu lo, biotika disi di kayɔnkyɔ sɛlaa se ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa suoto.<verse eid="JER 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />“ ‘Bibatooyu, mintoolo kafɔɔ batii, mintookpee asɔnɔ mintɔɔka kafɔɔ ntam kasakasa, mintoofiɛ olufui mintɔɔta Baal, mintikanko kafɔɔ bayaa ba bitatofo ni, <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />minwa mimmayila di anu nii di leyo le mmle kamɛ, leyo le di Leyooto nii ntika ni, mimbuɛ bilɛ, “Bunaa ole”-bunaa ole alɛ buabala ayududusaa ya mmle nwu? <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Leyo le mmle nwu, di Leyooto nii ntika ni ntookple bayu kawofakɔ diɛta ye? Kafɔɔ ami yi, ntoonyu ye! SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />“ ‘Kanunua yi, bitɔɔkyɛ lɛba nwu di Silo, di lɛbale lakasa ni kasiɛkɔ ɔbla ɔta ni Leyooto nii, biɛlaanyu lɛsaa le labla ni leyo nwu ta batii nii Israel akpilesaa ɔbla oso. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, di obe wɔ biatɔɔbla ni asaa ya mmle amuu yi, lanwini lakakatɛ lata ye, kafɔɔ bitakyɔɔ atoko; lalɛɛ ye kafɔɔ bitatuna. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Nkpo oso, lɛsaa le labla ni Silo yi, nfɛ kamayɔ ni mbla leyo le di Leyooto nii ntika nii, olekatakɔ ka biatika ni disi, lɛbale layɔ lata ye ni ku bate lee. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Kamatukusa ye nkyisa di anu nii, fɛ mmle okle labla ni babilee-suɔtɔbi bamuu, Efraim batii nwu.’<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Atoko Ɔtankyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />“Nkpo oso tampɛ ɔlaa di batii ba mmle disi ee faatikiti lekoto ee faabuɛ ɔlaa fata ma; tantikiti mi lekoto, diekye nɔmakyɔɔ fɔ atoko. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Flɔɔnya lɛsaa le bɔɔbla ni di Yuda sekpoo nwu kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka amuu kamɛ? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Babi mbudi ntɔɔni, babibate nkutaa ɔtɔ, basanko kafɔɔ nnwɔtɔ nnaafũ mampɛ bloblo akudi manta Osi Ɔkasanko. Mankpete nta kasɔ manta bayaa bamba man-yɔ mankpee mi ɔblɔ. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Kafɔɔ, ami bookpee ɔblɔ? SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Diele suoto lɛma bɔɔbla, mankpee mma bamu sinunsɔ?<verse eid="JER 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ nii ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii nkpete di lɛba le mmle suoto, di batii ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ, awoso ya di afe ku alesaa di kasɔ suoto, kubafiɛ kunɔbanii ni kafɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Binwini, biɛyɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta lee nwu bikyakaa di seleɔta lee bamba nwu biewee sina nwu aye bamu! <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Diekye obe wɔ lakpaa bawa lee ladieko ni di Egipte lakakatɛ lata ma ni yi, ntata ma afiofa di ofiɛ asaaɔta ku seleɔta lete suoto. <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />Kafɔɔ lata ma kufiofa ko mmle nlɛ: Bikyɔɔ mi atoko, ni kamale Yaa lee aye kafɔɔ bibale batii nii. Bikyɛ di sisuku se simuu lɛtɔkɔ ye ni, alɛ dialɛ ninta ye. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Kafɔɔ batanu ee bakyɔɔ atoko; kafɔɔ yi, baatikanko situ lɛma onunsie asaakpile nwu. Baakyɛ sɛmaasɛmaa batafe sitũ. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ di bawa lee ladie ni di Egipte diɛbadu ni nunua, nkyesee nkple nkyesee ye bakpɛmblatɛ nii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dii biala. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Kafɔɔ batanu ee bakyɔɔ mi atoko. Baawɛ otokopĩ ni baale sikpile baalenkee bawa lɛma baakyakaa nɛ.’<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />“Nse fɛɛtɔkɔ ma sɛlaa se mmle simuu yi, blɔbakyɔɔ fɔ atoko; nse fɛɛlɛɛ ma, blɔbatuna. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Nkpo oso tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya kale ka nitakyɔɔ ni SAATE Yaa nɔɔ atoko ee bafũ lelolaa nɔɔ bakpee ni. Onukwale ntɔwɔɔ; kutɔɔyɛ di anyasibi lɛma.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpilesaa Sɛsaabla Di Hinom Ɔtaata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />Binwiɛ sinwini lee biɛfuki sĩ biwii; bisa okunu di akpenkpe nwu fukiti osi, diekye SAATE nwu ntosĩ kɔna ko mmle ninsi ni di lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nɔɔ le mmle kalɔ.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpilesaa Sɛsaabla Di Hinom Ɔtaata Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />“ ‘Yuda batii nwu ntɔɔbla dikpilesaa di anu nii, SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ. Bɛɛyɔ aafiɔtii ayududusaa lɛma nwu bɛɛtɛ di leyo le di Leyooto nii ntika ni kamɛ, ni bɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa ni nɛ. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Baapɛ Tofet oleɔta akyikye di Ben-Hinom Ɔtaata kamɛ alɛ baafiɛ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma di ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ- lɛsaa le nitabuɛ nii, ee diwa mi ni diisi. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Nioso bilolaabinyu, ayi nwu nfɛ kɔwa, di batii dilɔbasinlɛɛ nwu ni Tofet ee Ben-Hinom Ɔtaata. Kafɔɔ babalɛɛ nwu Batii Olo Ɔtaata, diekye babakookaa bakpi di Tofet ninaadu obe wɔ di lɛba kuninwii nsinaa nii, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />N-se batii ba mmle bakpi ntookple alesaa ɛɛta bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku babɔkɛɛ di lepoo kamɛ di kasɔ suoto, di otii kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbawɛ abayɛkɛsa ma antososa nii. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Kamata kase n-wa di suoto lɛyɔɔ ɔnya ku lɛpɔ̀ kudu suoto, di ɔkafɔɔ ku ɔkafɔɔsa sɛlɔ kanya di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka, diekye kasɔ nwu kamate kafukiti.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />“ ‘Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, babadiki baka ku Yuda banɔɔfotii akufi, olebatatɛ ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ akufi, ku Yerusalem batii akufi di sɛkya lɛma kamɛ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Babadiki nya manlakasa di kufĩ ku kɔwɛntɛ ku osi awɛntrɛbi amuu kalɔ. Asaa ya baabɔmbɔ baale nya ni bakpɛmblatɛ ku nnya, baatikanko nya baakaalɛ ni asaa baakyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛma, ni baasumu nya kafɔɔ nɛ. Blɔbasiisa ma ee bakookaa ma, kafɔɔ abate fɛle aku ya ninte ni kaasɔ. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Kakɔlele letososa ma lekpee yi, batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa di kale kpile ka mmle kamɛ kamamiɛ kukpi manlenkee nkpa, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ.’<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okpile Ku Letokonanfi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />“Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“ ‘Nse batii lɛnɔɔ, mansintaka baayila?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">Nse otii lemunikĩi eesifi, ansimpɛakple aawa?<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Ni obe oso di batii ba mmle ntomunikĩi beesifi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Obe oso di Yerusalem mmunikĩi ansifi obe lele?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Beenu-baka di kakyɔnkyɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Beesĩ alɛ blɔpɛbakple.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Ntɔɔkyɔɔ atoko nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">kafɔɔ mammbuɛ ɔlaa wɔ ninlɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Otii kuonwii ninkyi di akpilesaa nɔɔ ɔbla suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">ankaalɛ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa ninle nle lɛbla ni?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Obiala lɛyɔ osuku nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">fɛle pɔnkɔ wɔ di ninu lɛsɛɛ oofe ni kakpɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Bia kakyɛnyi di kolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">n-ye obe nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">lɛlaapɔɔ, yaakɔɔkɔ ku ntĩtĩi kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">ntofo obe wɔ mandie mansifi ni lɛba bamba lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Kafɔɔ batii nii dieye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">SAATE nwu abiesaa.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />“ ‘Lɛ kanya oso biobuɛ bilɛ, “Buobe anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">diekye bukpe SAATE nwu kufiofa,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">obe wɔ di nwaako asaabatuotɛ kakpanawesee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">lemunikĩisa nwu kuɔbla ni sɛlaa ku afunu?<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Sinunsɔ kamakpɛ banumbentɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">nnɛɛ kamafee ma mambuo nnɛɛ kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Di obe wɔ batoosĩ ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">lɛmɛ-ninumbe okle bakpe?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Nkpo oso yi, kamayɔ basɔfɔ lɛma nta basuɔtɔ bamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">n-yɔ kafɔɔ afe lɛma nta basaate fɔle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Diɛyɔ ni di obisɔ diɛlaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">bamuu kɔsɛɛsa anu manta asaa ɔwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku olebatatɛ nkyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">bamuu nkpe kakyɔnkyɔ.<verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Mankaasa batii nii nkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">fɛ ninu diɛsɛɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Mambuɛ alɛ “Atoko ɔkyɛ ole, atoko ɔkyɛ ole,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">di obe wɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole nnaa nii.<verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Sinunsɔ kɔkpɛ ma di ayududusaa lɛma nwu ɔbla suoto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Oowo, sinunsɔ dilɔkpɛ ma saa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">baaye bia mmle manunsɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Nioso babanɔɔ di banɔɔtɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">babawakosa ma kasɔ nse bɛɛnanfi ma kootoko,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 8:12">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />“ ‘Kamafũ alesaa lɛma ya manwako ni nsifiko,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 8:13">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Awosobi dilɔbatika di nta awoso suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Abue abi dilɔbatika di kowoso suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">afata ninya kafɔɔ kamayɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Babaklee lɛsaa le lata ma ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">manfũ ma ninɛɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />“Obe oso busi ninfũ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Bibasi dikudi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Biɛta butoso busifi sekpoo kplɛ siene nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">buɔlaawɔɔ ninfa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Diekye SAATE Yaa loo nwu ntoodiki wo ɛɛta kawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">ni ɛɛta wo kafɔɔ kɔfa kpile ntu alɛ bunyi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">diekye buɔɔbla okpile di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Buonyu osuku munta atoko ɔkyɛ ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">kafɔɔ dibiene kuninwii diiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">diɛta ni ofiɛ ɔyɔɔsabee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">kafɔɔ difu lete ninkpe.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Balo bapɔnkɔ nwu ninwuna hɛɛhɛɛ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">kodie ninkye Dan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">bapɔnkɔ-suɔtɔ lɛma diwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">kotũkunsa kasɔ kamuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Batɔɔwa alɛ bɔɔbalalaasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">kasɔ nwu ku lɛsaa biala ninka suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">okpoo kplɛ nwu ku batii ba bamuu ninsi ni ninfa.”<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />“Nyu lo, kamadiki asaanwu kpile nkpee ye kaamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">ku awɛɛfɛɛ ya di ɔfakũ dilɔbafuo ni omufũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">amanu ye,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 8:17">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Sɛnyaami Owi Ɔta Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Oo Kɔnɛɛ kaafutu kpeetɛ nii di sɛnyaami kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">otu nii kɔkpa kaamɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Kyɔɔ batii nii kaku atoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">fakyeko kasɔ ka niekyo ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“SAATE nwu nnaa di Sion?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Ɔka nɔɔ nsinaa ninfa?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Obe oso beekpee mi ɔblɔ ku atembi lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">ku bafɔɔ afiɔ lɛma nwu ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa?”<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />“Ofiɛlɛbee ntoofe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">kabienle kanya ntoose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ni munadiwɛ didiki kafɔɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Di obe wɔ batɔɔwɔsa ni batii nii yi, amii kafɔɔ ntɔɔwɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">lasiɛ kaku, ni di difu lapɛ mi nɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Kɔfa fifiale kukunwii nnaa di Gilead?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Fablatɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Ni obe oso di kɔfa ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">nnaa diɛta batii nii nkɔ?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Oo, dilaale alɛ disi nii kale ntu kataakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">di anumbi nii kafɔɔ ale ntu nnumɛɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Ntabawi kaku kakũ ku kakyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">nta batii nii ba beelo nii.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Oo, dilaale alɛ nkpe lɛba di ɔfaafuu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">katenkɔ diɛta ni osuku bakyɛntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">alɛ kadie ndiɛ batii nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">nsifi ndiɛ ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">diekye basɔnɔkpeetɛ bale bamuu lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">onukwale ɔtanle batii dikudi bale.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />“Beelolaa sɛkplalomii lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">fɛle kɔtaa, alɛ babataa sɛlaa ku afunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">diele di onukwale kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">man-wɛ lelenkee di kasɔ nwu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Mandie di okpile onwii kamɛ mambuo di ɔbamba kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">baaye mi,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 9:3">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />“Bilolaa binyu di basiɛwo lee suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">bitantika babilee-suɔtɔbi disi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Diekye kyɔnkyɔtɛ di obilee-suɔtɔbi biala nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">siɛwo biala kafɔɔ nle batii kanya buditɛ<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Siɛwo nkyɔnkyɔ siɛwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">otii kuonwii kafɔɔ nimbuɛ onukwale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Batootuo sɛkplalomi lɛma sɛlaa ku afunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">mankpee suoto lɛma kubuɛ ku sikpile ɔbla.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Kakyɔnkyɔ obo kamɛ fasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">beesĩ mi otofo di kakyɔnkyɔ lɛma kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 9:6">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">“Nyu lo, kamanyanakĩisa ma ninsɔ ma nnyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">diekye obe lɛsaa kamakple nfuo ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">ta batii nii sikpile oso?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Ɔkplalomii lɛma nle kɔtaa kpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">kakyɔnkyɔ kunkakatɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Obiala n-yɔ kanya nɔɔ ankakatɛko owo nɔɔ sibilɛma kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">kafɔɔ ankyɔɔ nwɔ okũ di otu nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Ntaananfi ma kootoko ta nle mmle oso?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">“Ntaambla lakyisa lata suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">di kale fɛ nka mmle nwu suoto?”<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Kamawi kaku ku kudu nta abokote nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">ninsa kafɔɔ okunu di ɔfaafuu nwu sɛfa nweekɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Bate ofukuti, batii kafɔɔ dilosinfe ninfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">mansinnu kafɔɔ banankyue diwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ntootoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">babɔkɛɛ kafɔɔ ntoosifi.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />“Kamabla Yerusalem ayokuu ya niɛwɔɔ ate nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">dibale ni lepoo kamɛ bawewee nsiɛkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">kamata kafɔɔ Yuda sekpoo nwu nlalaa sinte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">di mmle di otii kuonwii dilaafuo ni osiɛ ninfa.”<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Ɔmɛ otii niɛtɛ eebe anu alɛ aanu nle mmle kasɔ? Owe di SAATE nwu lediki kanya alɛ aafuo kasɔ odiki? Obe oso di kasɔ nwu lɛwɔɔ kɛlalaa kate kafɔɔ fɛle ɔfaafuu wɔ di otii kuonwii dilaafuo ni ɔwaalɛ ofe?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Diekye batoosĩ kufiofa nii, nko layɔ latɛ ni di anu lɛma; baakyɔɔ mi atoko ee batikanko kufiofa nii. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Kafɔɔ, beetikanko situ lɛma nwu onunsie; beetikanko Baal, fɛ mmle di bate lɛma latuo ma nii.” <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Nyu lo, kamata bati ba mmle nle alesaa ya ninkpe ni olo, man-nyi kafɔɔ ntu be di kɔfa kpile nsi nii. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Kamasamiisa ma nkpete di nnle be di mma ee bate lɛma ditatofo ni kamɛ, kamakusa ntikanko ma ku kapamii ninnaase di obe wɔ kamawɔɔsa ma nii.”<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Batii Lafaa Baakaalɛ Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Bibu nwu binyu nunua! Bilɛɛ basanko nwu nikowi ni osie kanya biwako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">bikpee baalɛɛ mba niɛtɛ baye ni owi kamɛ nwaa bawako.<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Bita ma bawa wala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">baabawi osie kanya di suoto loo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">dilaase di obe wɔ di anumbi loo kamawi ni nnumɛɛ blɔblɔblɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">di ntu kafɔɔ kamasoo ninkye ni sinumpoo loo.<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Boonu kaku kudu nwu kanya mankyeko Sion alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">‘Nkpo butɔɔwɔɔ nɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Nkpo di sinunsɔ loo lemuɔ nɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Dikpeni buodie di kasɔ loo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">diekye ayo loo ntoobibiɛ ate kaasɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Oo basanko, kanunua yi, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">bitikiti atoko lee bita kanya nɔɔ kamɛ sɛlaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Bituo babisankobi lee mmle manwi ni osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">bietuo kafɔɔ bawo lee okunu.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Kukpi ntɔɔkata kuofe di basafle loo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">ni kutoobuo kuɔwa di akayo loo kamɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">kutoolo babisɔ loo eediki di akpaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">eelo kafɔɔ bakosopo eediki di okpoo bawo nlɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Buɛ falɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“ ‘Batii nwu bakpi kamate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">fɛle aku di afe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">fɛle sɛmɔɔbuu di fiɛlɛtɛ sɛmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">di kuonwii nnaa aasiisa sĩ nii.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">“Numbentɛ atankanta di ninumbe nɔɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">ee sientɛ akanta di osie nɔɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">ee asaawɛntɛ akanta di lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ suoto,<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />kafɔɔ otii wɔ ninkanta ni, akanta di nle mmle suoto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">alɛ aanu kasɔ antofo mi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu, nnwɔ nimbla ni sifutulɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ninka ni lɛka biene, ambla ni ɔsaabla tinini kaasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">diekye n-ya mmle ninta suoto n-yɔɔ mi nɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 9:24">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Nyu lo, obe kɔwa, kamananfi ni batii ba bamuu niɛkyɛlɛnsa ni suoto di suoto sina lete kamɛ kootoko- <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Egipte, Yuda, Moab ku mba bamuu ninsi ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ di aba ya niekyo nii. Diekye nwaako nnle be mmle nwu mmuu diɛkyɛnlɛsa suoto, bia Israel batii bamuu diɛkyɛlɛnsa suoto di situ lɛma kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Afiɔ Ɔtɔ Ku Onukwale Kasumu Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Oo Israel batii, binu ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ye ni. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Bitantekete nnle nwu sɛsaabla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">ee lɛyɛkɛ dipɛ ye di atuosaa di kolo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">kuntɛ difu ninya mpɛ nnle nwu.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Diekye batii nwu amanle sɛsaabla diele lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">mambudi kowoso mankyeko lepoo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">asaawolatɛ kafɔɔ n-wola kũ andiki ku lɛfɛbi nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Man-yɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle manklɛɛ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">man-yɔ ɔmankyi mampɛ sibuɛ ninmufũ ni ninklee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">mmle ninaatũkũ nii.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Afiɔ lɛma nwu nte fɛle asaa ya nintososa ni bakansiɛ di afe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ananfuo ni ɔkakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ɔkɛnkɛ dikpeni bɛɛkɛnkɛ nya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">diekye anfuo ɔkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Bitanyɛkɛ nya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">blɔbafuo ye okpile kuninwii ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ee babla dibiene kuninwii.”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Oo SAATE, kuonwii diete fɛle afɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">feemuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">leyooto lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nkpe onutũ di osie kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Oo nnle nwu Ɔka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Owe ninamayɛkɛ fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Nle mmle ninle lele fɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Di nnle nwu banumbentɛ bamuu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">ku sɛkanlekɔ lɛma nwu mmuu kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">kuonwii nnaa fɛle afɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Bamuu lɛma banaa disibu, baaye kafɔɔ lɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">afiɔ awosoku ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa nintuo ma asaa.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Mankyeko koto fututu ko bɛɛbɛntɛ ni Tarsis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">ku koto sɛɛle di Ufas manwako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Nse batoololaa asaa ya di asaawolatɛ ku koto sɛɛle asaatukatɛ lɛyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">dibula bluu ku nle niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ bɛɛbla nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">bakpɛntɛ ba ninkpe ni kusi-ɛ niabla nya amuu.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ninle onukwale Yaa nwu nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa ale, Ɔka wɔ ninaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Nse ɔblɔ lɛfiɛ nwɔ yi, kasɔ ntũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">nnle nwu dilɔbafuo oyila di lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nɔɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />“Tɔkɔ ma ɔlaa wɔ mmle falɛ: ‘Bayaa ba mmle, ninambla ni osi ku kasɔ, kamawɔɔ mandie kaasɔ suoto di osi kalɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu Kuɔta Ni Yaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Kafɔɔ Yaa labla kasɔ di osie nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">ninumbe nɔɔ aayɔ aabla kayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">ni aablɛfɛsa osi di lɛsɔnu nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Nse eekpududuu yi, ntu nwu di osi nkpanko suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">anta alokonkyɛ ntaka di kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Anta ɔtɔ mmunaa ku kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">andieko afɛɛfɔ kafɔɔ ankyeko asaa nɔɔ ntɛkɔ anwako.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Otii biala dieye lɛsaa, banaa kafɔɔ lɛsaatofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">sinunsɔ kɔkpɛ koto sɛɛle asaatukatɛ biala di afiɔ nɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Atembi nɔɔ nwu nle kakyɔnkyɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">ninwuna diesi ma kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Baadie lɛsalɛsaa, amansaa di asaa nwu nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">nse lɛkanko lɛma lɛwa yi, babawɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Otii wɔ ninle ni Yakob kalekɔ diete fɛle n-ya mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">diekye nnwɔɔ ninle asaa amuu Blatɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">dikyakaa ni di Israel, atesaa nɔɔ nwu kɔna-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">leyooto nɔɔ ninle SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni nɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛlanle Kamɛ Osifi Wɔ Nikɔwa Nii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Aye ba ninsi ni di ɔmana okyi nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">bisiisa asaa lee biedie di kasɔ nwu bisifi.<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Kamadiki batii ba ninsi ni di kasɔ ka mmle suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">nfuki n-yu di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">kamayɔ nimiina n-wako ma di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">alɛ baafuo ma omufũ.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />N-yɔɔsa ta nkɔ be lefũ ni oso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">Kakɔ nii ninkpi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Kafɔɔ latɔkɔ suoto nii nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">Ofiɛ nii ninle nnwɔ mmle nɛ, dikpeni lekpee otu lefe nwu kaamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Batɔɔlalaasa akpanta nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">batoobubudi sikũ nini simuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Babi nii kafɔɔ ntoodie di ɔkyɛ nii beesifi, basinnaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">kuonwii nsinnaa kanunua aapɛ ni akpanta nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">ee abatakatɛ lɛkpaayo nii anse nii.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Babɔkɛɛ bakpatɛ nwu dieye lɛsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">mannwolaa kafɔɔ asaa kamɛ baakyeko SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">nkpo oso asaa ninlɛ ata ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">babɔkɛɛ lɛma bamuu kafɔɔ ntɔɔsamii.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Bikyɔɔ atoko bienu! Sɛlaa nwu nfɛ kɔwa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">kakpɔtɔkpɔtɔ kplɛ ka niekye ni katookasɔ kɔwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Dibata Yuda sekpoo nwu nte sifukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">simmabla lepoo kamɛ baweewee kasiɛkɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ɔlaa ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Oo SAATE, n-ye nlɛ otii nkpa diele nle nwɔ mmu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">diɛlɛ dita otii alɛ aatofo nkpaa nɔɔ kasekɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Oo SAATE, lolaa mi, kafɔɔ di onukwale kanya lete-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">diele di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">nse diele nkpo fabawakosɛɛ kasɔ ninamadie ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Nyɛɛnɛ lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka lɛfɔ fakpete di nnle be</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">ninanta fɔ ni dibu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">faakpete kafɔɔ di batii ba ninanansumu fɔ ni suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Diekye batɔɔbɛbɛɛ Yakob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">batɔɔbɛbɛɛ nwɔ fɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">bɛɛwɔɔsa kafɔɔ okpoo nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ku Kanya Ninii Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye ni SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ kuata ni Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Kyɔɔ atoko faanu sɛlaa se ninsi ni di kanya ninii le mmle kamɛ, faabuɛ sĩ fatɔkɔ Yuda batii ku batii ba nisi ni di Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ ninaambla ni di kanya ninii le mmle kanya- <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />Afiofa ya lakpee ni bawa lee di obe wɔ lakpaa ma lakyeko ni Egipte, ladieko ni di abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ kanyinakĩisakɔ.’ Latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, ‘bikyɔɔ mi atoko, biɛbla kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le lɛtɔkɔ ye ni, ni bibale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lee. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Ni amii kamabla di ntam be laka lata ni bawa lee suoto, nlɛ kamayɔ kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe ni nta ma nii’- kasɔ ka bikle ni miɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Ni latuna nlɛ, “SAATE, diwa kaanya.”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Yie lɛkya di sɛlaa se mmle simuu suoto di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka falɛ: Bikyɔɔ atoko di kanya ninii sɛlaa se mmle suoto, bietikanko sĩ. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ lakpaa bawa lee ladieko ni di Egipte diɛbase ni di miɛ, latoosĩ ɔlaa latɔɔta ma obelele, latoobuɛ nlɛ, “Bikyɔɔ mi atoko.” <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Kafɔɔ batakyɔɔ atoko ee banu ɔlaa; kafɔɔ, baatikanko situ kpile lɛma atokopĩsaa nwu. Nioso layɔ kanya ninii nwu akpaani ya amuu lakpee ma ni kufiofa nlɛ batikanko ni lawako ma di suoto, diekye batale nya.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Kanwumbe okũ nsi di Yuda batii ku mba ninsi ni di Yerusalem kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Batɔpɛbeekple beesifi bawa lɛma sikpile nwu, mba niasĩ ni sɛlaa nii atoko ɔkyɔɔ. Baatikanko bayaa bamba baalaasumu ma. Israel batii ku Yuda batii akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ ntɔɔlalaasa kanya ninii le labla ni ku bawa lɛma. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamayɔ ɔlaa kpile wɔ manamafuo ni otoso odie ni n-wako ma di suoto. Kuntɛ beewi bɛɛlɛɛ mi yi, namakyɔɔ ma atoko. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Yuda sekpoo nwu ku Yerusalem batii kamasifi maanaawi mankpee bayaa ba manfiɛ olufui manta nii, kafɔɔ blɔbata ma lɛkyakaako saa nse ɔlaa kpile otũ nwu lɛwa. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Oo Yuda, bikpe bayaa kpinwu fɛ mmle bikpe ni sekpoo; seleɔta akyikye ya kafɔɔ biɛpɛ biese minfiɛ ni olufui minta ni anunsɔsaablatɛ Baal yaa nwu mpɔ fɛ mmle di Yerusalem akpaka mpɔ nii.’<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />“Yeremia, tampɛ ɔlaa faata batii ba mmle ee faatikiti lekoto di disi lɛma ee faabuɛ ɔlaa faata ma, diekye namakyɔɔ atoko nse bɛɛlɛɛ mi di nimiina lɛma obe kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />“Obe di bɔmbɔtɛ nii kɔbla di olekatakɔ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">di obe wɔ akle ni kanwumbe okũ nɔɔ kpile nwu ɔɔblako ni ɔkpɛ ku batii kpinwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">Sina se beekleklesa ni kamafuo letokonanfi lɛfɔ osuku otĩi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Di obe wɔ fɔɔbla ni asiensiesaa lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">fan-nya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ.”<verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />SAATE nwu nlɛɛ fɔ alɛ nnɔnyi kowoso ko niefukuti ni nwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">kuntika ni abi biene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Kafɔɔ di afɛɛfɔ siene ɔfɛ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">abakpee kũ ɔtɔ kunfiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">sɛla nikũ nfefee.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, nnwɔ niese fɔ ni, ntɔɔtɛ ɔlaa kpile otũ ɛɛta fɔ. Diekye Israel batii ku Yuda batii ntɔɔbla okpile beekpee mi kafɔɔ ɔblɔ di olufui wɔ bɔɔfiɛ manta ni Baal suoto.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanwumbe Okũ Di Yeremia Nkpa Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Ta di SAATE nwu ladiki ni kanwumbe okũ lɛma nwu aatuo mi ni oso yi, latofo nwu ole, diekye aatuo mi lɛsaa le baatɔɔbla ni di obe nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Late fɛle lefosobi buɛɛ le bɔɔkpaa manfenko ni kalokɔ; ntatofo nlɛ beekũ kanwumbe di suoto nii, mambuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Bita buwɔɔsa kowoso nwu ku abi nikũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">bita bulo nwɔ budiki di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">alɛ balaasinyuma leyooto nɔɔ diidii.”<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Oo SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, kafɔɔ yi, afɔ wɔ ninka ni lɛka di ditinini kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">fansɔ ni otu ku disibu fannyu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">tɛɛ nnya ɔbla okyisa lɛfɔ di suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">diekye afɔ lɛyɔ ɔlaa nii lɛta.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />“Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Anatot batii ba nikomiɛ alɛ boolo fɔ ni suoto boobuɛ ni kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Tambuɛ ɔlaa faatɛ ni di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ, nse diele nkpo fabakpi ni di nnɛɛ loo.’ <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamananfi ma kootoko. Bakosopo lɛma kamakpi di kapamii kanya, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma kafɔɔ kamakpi di kɔka kanya. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Bia otii kuonwii dilɔbabu asiɛ nkpa ata ma, diekye kamayɔ ɔlaa kpile otũ n-wako di Anatot batii suoto di letokonanfi lɛlɛɛ lɛma kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lakaalɛ SAATE Nwu Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Oo SAATE, fate tinini obe lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">nse lɛyɔ ɔlaa lɛtɛ di anu lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Kafɔɔ kamakakatɛko fɔ di ditinini lɛfɔ suoto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Obe oso di siensietɛ nwu sisuku n-lɛ ɔkyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Obe oso di asaa n-lɛ ɔkyɛ anta amumu bablatɛ?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Afɔ niasɔ ma, ni batoose sidu nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">mammuɔ mantika abi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Obe lele fatika di anyasibi lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">kafɔɔ eekyo di situ lɛma.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Oo SAATE, kafɔɔ faye mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">fan-nyɛɛ, fansɔ kafɔɔ disibu nii fan-nyu nse ditika di suoto lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Wududusa ma fasifiko fɛle bafoso ba bɔɔwa ni ɔbalo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">Diki ma fase lete fata dii le babalo ma ni!<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Ɔmɛmbe di kasɔ kamakoso kaanaase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">di sɛfa biala di kofe kamɛ kafɔɔ n-yɔɔ sinnaase?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Ta batii ba ninsi ka ni di suoto amumu oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">babɔkɛɛ ku bakansiɛ ntɔɔwɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Diɛkyakaa nii yi, batii kobuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Ɔlɔbanya lɛsaa le nimawa wo ni di suoto.”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Kanya Odiki</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />“Nse faatoso ku batii ninkpaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">bɛɛta dibuo lebuo fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ni lɛ fabafuo otoso ku bapɔnkɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Nse feetuula di kasɔ ka ninaa ni ole kuonwii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ni lɛ fababla di Yordan apookuu kamɛ?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Babilee-suɔtɔbi, afɔ omu leyo kamɛ batii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">ntoodiki fɔ bɛɛta bia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">batɔɔyɔ ɔlaa di suoto lɛfɔ osie kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Kuntɛ mankakatɛ sɛlaa biene di suoto lɛfɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">tanfũ ma faanu.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lawi Sɛnyaami Ta Batii Nɔɔ Oso</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />“Kamasĩ leyo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">nindiɛ atesaa nii ntɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">kamayɔ otii wɔ nimbɔmbɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">nkpee di balo nɔɔ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Atesaa nii ntɔbabla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">fɛle kyata wɔ ninsi ni di lepoo kamɛ ɛɛtɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Ankumii ankpee mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">nkpo oso lekyidi nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Diele ote nfɛ di atesaa nii nte atɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">fɛle lelente le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">di bakansiɛ bamba mmana mankyi mandieko ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Tɔɔkyɛ falaasiisa lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">faakpaa ma fawako bababɛbɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Bafoso bakpatɛ kpinwu kamalalaasa awosobi nii kofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">mannanafu kafɔɔ kofe nii kamɛ asaa mantɛ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">babamunikĩisa kofe nii nwu nikɔlɛ ni onyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">mambla kũ kasɔ ka niɛlalaa kate nii.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Bababla ka kasɔ ka niɛlalaa kate nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">kabakoso kanlalaa kante di anu nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">kasɔ nwu kamuu kamalalaa kante</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">diekye kuonwii nnaa ɛɛyɔ nwu ni ole.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Di abokote nwu fukuti nsintɛɛ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">asaa balalaasatɛ kamawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">diekye SAATE nwu kapamii kamawɔɔsa asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ nwu kayɛntɛleko kanwii diesifi ni kabamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">kuonwii dilɔbadie kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Babakpee kamɔɔ, kafɔɔ siwuu babafiɛlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">babakpee suoto lɛma dibuo kafɔɔ blɔbawɛ lɛsalɛsaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Nioso yi, ta asaa lɛfɔ ofee sinunsɔ sitika fɔ di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">ta SAATE nwu lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nwu oso.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Labuɛ Alɛ Abakyakaako Batii Ba Ninsi Bakaako ni Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Amumu bablatɛ ba bamuu ninsi bakaako mi ni baaklee atesaa ya lata ni batii nii Israel baafũ ni yi, kamasifi ma ndiki di nsɔ lɛma suoto, ninsifi kafɔɔ Yuda batii ndiki ma kaamɛ. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Kafɔɔ nse lɛsifi ma lediki leloo yi, kamakplesa obiala lɛma n-wako nnwɔɔ omu atesaa ku nnwɔɔ omu kasɔ nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Ni nse beetekete asaa di batii nii sisuku suoto nwaa, bɛɛka kafɔɔ nta di leyooto nii kamɛ, beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE lɛnya akpe ni nkpa’- batoodituo ni bia batii nii alɛ baaka ni ntam di Baal leyooto kamɛ yi- ni babata ma mansiɛ di batii nii kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Kafɔɔ nse kale kawo diɛkyɔɔ mi atoko yi, kamasifi ka ndiki klekle ninwɔɔsa ka kafɔɔ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Laya Dibula Fɛnɛnɛ Ofiamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ: “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaaya dibula fɛnɛnɛ ofiamɛ faayɔ nwu fatika di ɔtɔ̀ lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ tanta ntu lakaa nwu di suoto.” <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Nioso laya ofiamɛ latika di ɔtɔ̀ nii fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="JER 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ lɛnyɔɔfa alɛ: <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Yɔ ofiamɛ wɔ faaya ni feetika ni di ɔtɔ̀ lɛfɔ faasifi Perat falaakokaa nwu ninfa, di afuɔnkpaa kɔkà kamɛ.” <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Nioso lakyɛ lalaakookaa nwu di Perat, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi nii.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Ni di ayi kpinwu sɛmaa, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ Perat nfɛ falaayɔ ofiamɛ wɔ latɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ laakookaa ni ninfa.” <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Nioso lakyɛ Perat lalaakutu ofiamɛ nwu ladiki, ni layɔ nwu di lɛba le lakookaa nwu ni nɛ, kafɔɔ ofiamɛ nwu latɔ̀, kutasinlɛ kafɔɔ kuata ni lɛsalɛsaa ɔblako.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nkpo okle kafɔɔ kamawɔɔsa Yuda lɛkanta nwu ku Yerusalem lɛkanta kplɛ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Batii kpile ba mmle niesĩ ni ɔlaa nii atoko ɔkyɔɔ, batikanko ni situ lɛma atokopĩsaa, bɛɛkyɛ batikanko ni bayaa bamba, bɔɔbla ni sɛkpɛ lɛma, mantɔ ma ni kamate fɛle ofiamɛ wɔ mmle- blɔbadie lɛsalɛsaa saa! <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Diekye fɛ mmle man-nii ofiamɛ mankyisa ni di otii ɔtɔ̀ yi, nkpo lenii Israel leyo nimuu ku Yerusalem leyo nimuu lɛkaasa di suoto nɛ, alɛ baale batii nii manta leyooto nii ku katansa nii ku dibu nii. Kafɔɔ baakyɔɔ atoko.’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nta Dikuuku Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />“Tɔkɔ ma falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bakpete nta bayiisa dikuuku biala.’ Nse bɛɛkaalɛ fɔ kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Buoye bulɛ baakpete nta man-yiisa dikuuku biala kamɛ?’ yi, <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />ni faatɔtɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamata lɛtansiɛ n-yii batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di kasɔ ka mmle suoto, di baka ba ninsi ni di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto, olebatatɛ, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Yerusalem nkyaakaa nii. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Kamasansa ma onwii, onwii di owo suoto, babi ku bate kyɛkyɛ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Nɔmata nyaami ɔnya ee sifutule ole ee kafutu onu ditĩi mi osuku di ɔwɔɔsa lɛma suoto.’ ”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Di Lɛkanta Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Binu, biɛkyɔɔ atoko nwaa kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">bitantakatɛ suoto katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">diekye SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />Biyɔ dibu bita SAATE Yaa lee nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">fiɛ aayɔ ditunu awako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">fiɛ di nkpaa lee dituula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">di akpenkpe tununtunu nwu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Bionyu osuku minta lɛkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">kafɔɔ abamunikĩisa ni ambla ditunu le nikpe ni opĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ammunikĩisa ni kafɔɔ ambla ditunu tununtunu.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Kafɔɔ nse biɛkyɔɔ atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">kamawi kaku di lewofa kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ta lɛkanta lee oso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">anumbi nii kamawi kaku osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ansoo ku nnumɛɛ blɔblɔblɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">diekye babakpaa SAATE nwu bafoso mansifiko sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Tɔkɔ ɔka ku ɔkasanko falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">“Bisoo di akakpomii lee suoto biwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">diekye dibu akakoto lee nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">kamakpa di asi lee suoto.”<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Babasɛɛ sekpoo kplɛ lee nwu di Kalakasɔ manse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">di otii kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbawɛ abasɛkɛtɛ sĩ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Babakpaa Yuda batii bamuu mansifiko sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">babakpaa ma fɛɛ mansifiko.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />Takatɛ anu lɛfɔ faanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">batii ba niekye katookasɔ bɔɔwa ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Ɔfɛ di bafoso ba beekpee fɔ ni ninnɛɛ nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">bafoso ba suoto faakanta ni?<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Obe fababuɛ nse SAATE nwu lɛyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">batii ba faanyu ni fɛ basiɛwo lɛfɔ nwaa eese kanyabayilatɛ lɛfɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Flɔbanu dibuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">fɛle ɔsanko wɔ di lɛmɛ konu ni?<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Nse fɛɛkaalɛ suoto lɛfɔ falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">“Obe oso di nle mmle lɛwa mi di suoto?”-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">ta sikpile lɛfɔ kpinwu oso di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">akpeele wua lɛfɔ ntɔɔbɛbɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">ni fɛɛbla kafɔɔ suoto lɛfɔ amumu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Etiopia otii kamafuo suoto nɔɔ kukũ ɔkyɛlɛnsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">ee nɛɛfɔɔtɛ nkyɛlɛnsa apa nɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Nkpo di batii ba nimbla ni okpile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">dilɔbafuo dibiene ɔbla nɛ.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />“Kamasamiisa ye fɛle sɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">se di ɔfaafuu afɛɛfɔ nfɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Nle mmle ninle lele fɔ di atrebi owii kamɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">kalekɔ ka lɛtɛ lɛta fɔ ni nɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 13:25">SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“Ta fatoyee mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">feetika ni disi di sɛlaa ku afunu bayaa suoto oso.<verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Kamananfi akpeele wua lɛfɔ ntĩi fɔ anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">alɛ baanya sinunsɔ lɛfɔ-<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />asɔnɔ lɛfɔ okpee ku lɛkɔnsɔklee kpile nwu fɛle pɔnkɔ lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">sinunsɔ lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Ntɔɔnya ayududusaa lɛfɔ sɛsaabla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">di akpenkpe suoto ku afe kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Oo Yerusalem, yɔɔsa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Ɔmɛmbe fabakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto fanaase?”<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Koleele Kpile Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Yeremia di koleele nwu suoto alɛ:<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Yuda nsi kaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">sekpoo kplɛ nɔɔ kowi sikududu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">boowi kaku osie kanya manta kasɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">lɛfaa kafɔɔ kodie ninkye Yerusalem.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Banɔɔfotii nkpee bakpɛmblatɛ lɛma alɛ balaadu ntu bawako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">mankyɛ ntu adubiɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">kafɔɔ man-wɛ ntu kunwii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Mankplesa akuuku lɛma fukuti manwako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">nnɛɛ nfee ma mankpɔkpɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">mantĩi asi lɛma.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Kasɔ nwu ntoomumuɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">ta kanto dilɔnɔɔ akpete ni di kasɔ nwu suoto oso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">nnɛɛ ntoofee afe bakpɛntɛ, ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">beetĩi asi lɛma kafɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Bia kakpĩni di lepoo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">ntoso andiɛ dibi nɔɔ le eelofo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">ta di sɛfa nnaa ni oso.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo n-yila di abokote fukuti suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">manwuna hɛɛhɛɛ fɛle lepoo kamɛ bawewee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">anumbi lɛma ninnya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">ta alesaa kaweekɔ ka ninnaa ma ni oso.”<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Kuntɛ sikpile loo nle kamaa oyila ɔlaa di suoto loo yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">Oo SAATE, bla lɛsaa ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Diekye nkpaamaa okple loo mpɔ osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">butɔɔbla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Oo Israel Osuku Onyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">Dikitɛ nɔɔ di nimiina obe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">obe oso fate fɛle ɔfɔɔ di kasɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">fɛle osuku kyɛntɛ wɔ ninsiɛ ni kakyɛ kanwii lete?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Obe oso fate fɛle osuɔtɔ wɔ niɛkpɔkpɔtɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">fɛle kpɛtɛ wɔ ninaa ni osie alɛ aafũ ni batii nkpa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Oo SAATE, fasi di kamɛ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">leyooto lɛfɔ kafɔɔ manlɛɛ wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">tansĩ wo!<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni di batii ba mmle suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Mambɔmbɔ ɔkyɛ ɔlalaa okyi nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">mannkunkudusa nkpaa lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Nkpo oso SAATE nwu ninnfũ ma aakpee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">nfɛ abanyuma amumu lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">annanfi ma kootoko ta sikpile lɛma oso.”<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tampɛ ɔlaa faata batii ba mmle sitũ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Kuntɛ man-nii kanya yi, nɔmanu kaku lɛma owi; kuntɛ manta ofiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta yi, nɔmafũ nya. Kafɔɔ kamawɔɔsa ma ku kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile.”<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Kafɔɔ labuɛ nlɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu kɔtɔkɔ ma ɔtɔkɔ, ‘Bilɔbanya kapamii nwu ee kɔka kukpɛ ye. Nwaako kamata ye atoko ɔkyɛ ole wɔ ninaa ni kaloo di lɛba le mmle.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu kobuɛ kakyɔnkyɔ sɛlaa mantɛ di leyooto nii kamɛ. Ninkpee ma ee ndiki ma ee nkakatɛ nta ma. Sɛlaa ku afunu asaaɔnya, sɛbɔ ɔpɛ, afiɔ ɔtɔ ku mma bamu asibu kpile lɛma sɛlaa boobuɛ mantɛ manta ye. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nikobuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ ni di leyooto nii kamɛ alɛ: Ninkpee ma, kafɔɔ boobuɛ alɛ, ‘Kapamii ee kɔka-ɔkpɛ kukunwii dilɔbawa di kasɔ ka mmle suoto.’ Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu kamawɔɔ di kapamii ku kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Babafuki batii ba kafɔɔ boobuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ manta ni man-yu di Yerusalem akpaka suoto ta kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku kapamii nwu oso. Otii kuonwii dilɔbawɛ abakookaa ma nii ee basɔfɔ lɛma, babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ee babisankobi lɛma. Kamanyɛɛnɛ sɛlaa kpile otũ se niesiɛko ma ni nkpete ma di suoto.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />“Tɔkɔ ma sɛlaa se mmle falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">“ ‘Ta anumbi nii ayii ku nnumɛɛ blɔblɔblɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">kakũ ku kakyɛ obe lele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">diekye kakpeelebitɛ nii- batii nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">ntoofũ kakɔ osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">kakɔ dibinte.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Nse lɛkyɛ kasɔ nwu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">nnya batii ba beelo ni ku kapamii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">nse lɛkyɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">nnya batii ba nikokpi ni di kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ku oletatɛ akyuu nwu anyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">ntoosifi kasɔ ka manan-ye ni suoto.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Nwu Latikiti SAATE Nwu Lekoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Faasin-yɔ nwu ole di Yuda suoto saa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Fatookyidi Sion?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Obe oso fatoopila wo nkpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">alɛ blaafuo wo ofiɛ ɔyɔɔsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Buonyu osuku munta atoko ɔkyɛ ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">kafɔɔ dibiene kuninwii diiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">diɛta ni ofiɛ ɔyɔɔsabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">kafɔɔ difu lete ninkpe.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Oo SAATE, butootofo amumu loo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ku bate loo lɛpɔɔ okpi nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">nwaako butɔɔbla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Ta leyooto lɛfɔ nwu oso yi, tansĩ wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">tantekete dibu di lɛkakpomii klekle lɛfɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Nyuma kanya ninii lɛfɔ le faabla ni ku awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">tanlalaasa ni.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Nnle nwu afiɔ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa kawo nta kanto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Kolo di nkũ kumu nta kanto n-wiwii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Oo SAATE Yaa loo, oowo, afɔ ninta wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Nkpo oso osuku loo onyu nsi di kamɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">diekye afɔ ninle nnwɔ nimbla ni n-ya mmle amuu.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kawɔɔ Di Yuda Batii Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Nse bia Mose ku Samuel nin-yɛ di anu nii yi, otu nii dilɔbakyi kuwa di batii ba mmle suoto. Tososa ma di anu nii! Faata ma basifi! <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Nse bɛɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, ‘Ɔfɛ nfɛ buofe?’ Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“ ‘Batii ba bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni kukpi yi, kukpi bɛɛta ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mba bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni kapamii yi, kapamii bɛɛta ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mba bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni kɔka olo yi, kɔka bɛɛta ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mba beeyɔ bɛɛta ni sɛlanle yi, sɛlanle bɛɛta ma.’<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />“Kamakyesee asaabawɔɔsatɛ akyuu ana ateate di suoto lɛma,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kapamii kamalo ma, bawewee nnwududusa ma mansifiko, bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ kafɔɔ mbɛbɛɛ, manwɔɔsa ma. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Kamabla ma lɛyɛkɛsaa nta kasɔ sɛkanlekɔ mmuu, ta lɛsaa le di Yuda ɔka Manase wɔ niale ni Hesekia obisuɔtɔbi labla ni di Yerusalem oso.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />“Oo Yerusalem, owe nimanya fɔ nyaami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Owe nimawi anta fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Owe nimayila ankaalɛ alɛ lɛ fate?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Fatoosĩ mi,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">“Foonwini fankple nkpaamaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Nioso kamadiki nnɛɛ di suoto lɛfɔ ninwɔɔsa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">nɔmasinfuo fɔ nyaami ɔnya.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Kamafɛɛlɛ ma ku kɔfɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">di kasɔ nwu okpoo kplɛ n-yoko kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Kamayɔ kukpi ku kawɔɔ n-wako di batii nii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">diekye badikyi di sisuku lɛma nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Kamata bakpisɔfɔ lɛma mpɔ kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">manlenkee lekpo ɔtɛnsia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Kamayɔ asaawɔɔsatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">n-wako di bakosopo lɛma baya suoto di kakũ kplamatãa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">kamayɔ ninyinyi ku difu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">nfuasa ma.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Babi bakuɛnsĩ ɔya kamaloo ɔnyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">annwuna ninwuna nɔɔ yɛntɛle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Kufĩ nɔɔ kamamɛɛ di obe wɔ di kale diiloo nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">babakpee nwɔ sinunsɔ man-yoolee nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">kamalo batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa ku kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">di balo lɛma anu,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 15:9">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Layɔ Ɔlaa Aatɛ Di SAATE Nwu Anu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Yaami, yɔɔsa kɔta suoto nii alɛ feelofo mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">otii wɔ di kasɔ kamuu lɛtaka kayɛ ni di suoto bɔɔnwaaniko nwɔ nii!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Ninnfɛnsa lɛsaa di otii nfũ ee nfɛnsa lɛsaa nta otii kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">kafɔɔ otii biala kɔkpaani mi.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">“Nwaako kamadiki fɔ nta disitikasaa biene lewo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">nwaako kamata balo lɛfɔ ntikiti fɔ lekoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">di ɔlaa kpile otũbee ku nimiina obe kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />“Otii kamafuo lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ ofee-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:12">lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ- ee lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle le niekye ni katookasɔ?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Kamayɔ lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ ku asaa lɛfɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">nta fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa, ninanle ni di kɔya kanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">ta sikpile lɛfɔ simuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">di kasɔ lɛfɔ kamuu suoto oso.<verse eid="JER 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Kamabla fɔ ɔlanle nta balo lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">di kasɔ ka fanan-ye ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">diekye ɔblɔ nii kamakɛsɛɛsa ɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">wɔ nimafiɛ ni di suoto lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Oo SAATE, faye lɛsaa biala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">nyuma mi faayɔ nwu ole di suoto nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">Bla ɔbla okyisa fatɛɛ di batii ba nikomiɛ mi ni dikpile suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Tan-wɛ otu faata ma- alɛ kafe n-wɛ kukpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">bu nwu fanyu mmle lafe ni di sinunsɔ kamɛ ta afɔ oso.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Di obe wɔ faakakatɛ sɛlaa lɛfɔ faatɛɛ nii, lafũ sĩ lale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">suoto lɛyɔɔ nii ku otu nii lɛbɔmbɔsaa siale siatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">diekye leyooto lɛfɔ man-lɛɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">Oo SAATE, Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Diidii ninwa kasɔ nsiɛ di batii ba ninnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ dikudi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">diidii nin-le nwee ku mma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">lete nii niasiɛ diekye kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ latika mi di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">ni faata ɔblɔ layii mi kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Obe oso di dibuo nii nnaa kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">di ɔkpɛ ko di kakɔ nii kɔkpɛ kankyakaa konookpi kafɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Fabate fɛle kaklenyii ka ninkyɔnkyɔ ni batii fantɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">fante fɛle ntu be ninsɔɔ ni wla?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">“Nse feekyisa nkpa yi, kamase fɔ lese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">alɛ faasumu mi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">nse feebuɛ sɛlaa nwaa, ninanle sɛlaakuu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">ni fabale otii wɔ ninkakatɛ ni di disi nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Ta batii ba mmle bamunikĩi bawa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">kafɔɔ afɔ tanmunikĩi faakyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Kamayɔ fɔ mbla kasiɛkɔ siene di batii ba mmle suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">fɛle oyoyiɛ wɔ nikpe ni osie fɛ lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">babakpɛko fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">kafɔɔ blɔbalenkee fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">diekye nsiko fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">alɛ kadiki fɔ ninfũ fɔ nkpa,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 15:20">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />“Kamadiki fɔ nkyeko amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">nindiki fɔ kafɔɔ nkyeko basiensietɛ sɛnɛɛfɔɔ kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Dibiesaa Diɛta Ni Yeremia Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“Tandiki ɔsanko faayɔ di lɛba le mmle, faalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi.” <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ba beelofo ni di kasɔ ka mmle nwu suoto ku basanko ba ninle ni baya lɛma ku basuɔtɔ ba ninle ni bate lɛma suoto alɛ: <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />“Okpi-fiɛ nimalo ma. Blɔbawi ma ee bakookaa ma, kafɔɔ babate fɛle aku ya ninte ni kaasɔ. Babawɔɔ di kapamii ku kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya, bakpi lɛma kafɔɔ kamale alesaa anta bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ di kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Tambuo leyo le di nkufanyo n-yɛ nii; tankyɛ faalaawi ee faata yɔɔsa, diekye ntootekete lɛtɔtrɔ nii, lɛbɔmbɔ nii ku nyaami nii ɔnya di batii ba mmle suoto,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />“Batii kplɛ ku batii biibii, akyuu nwu anyɔ kamakpi di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Blɔbakookaa ma ee bawi ma, kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbakyakya suoto nɔɔ ee akpaasu disi nɔɔ ata ma. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Kuonwii dilɔbawako alesaa alɛ ɔbakpee kakufa batii kɔnɛɛ kaafutu- blɔbawako bia ote ee ɔya- ee otii kuonwii nta alɛ bɔɔta ma yɔɔsa.<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />“Tambuo leyo le kafɔɔ di ole ku owee ku nta onyi nkpe ni falaasiɛ, faale, faanyi. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni, kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamata ɔkafɔɔ ku ɔkafɔɔsa suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ̀ kudu kanya n-wa kaloo di anu lɛfɔ ku obe lɛfɔ kamɛ di lɛba le mmle.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Nse fɛɛtɔkɔ batii ba mmle sɛlaa se mmle simuu, bɛɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, ‘Obe oso di SAATE nwu lebuɛ ɔlaa kpile wɔ mmle kplɛ di suoto loo? Lɛmɛnsaa kpile buɔbla? Obe okpile buɔbla di SAATE Yaa loo nwu suoto?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Ni tɔkɔ ma falɛ, SAATE nwu alɛ, ‘Ta bate lee lasĩ mi, baalaatikanko ni bayaa bamba, baabla ma sɛkpɛ, baatɔ ma ni kafɔɔ oso. Baasĩ mi, ni batale kafɔɔ kufiofa nii nɛ. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Kafɔɔ aye bitɔɔbla asiensiesaa bilenke bate lee. Binyu mmle di obiala lee ntikanko ni otu kpile nɔɔ otokopĩ di obe wɔ dikaatɛ alɛ biɛkyɔɔ mi ni atoko. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Nioso kamatososa ye ndiki di kasɔ ka mmle suoto nkpee di kasɔ ka di aye ee bate lee dieye ni suoto. Nfa bibasumu bayaa bamba kakũ ku kakyɛ, diekye nɔmale ye sibualɛ kusinwii.’<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛlanle Kamɛ Okye Okple Ɔwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ, obe kɔwa di batii dilɔbasimbuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niakpaa Israel batii aadieko ni di Egipte,’ <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />kafɔɔ bababuɛ alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niakpaa Israel batii aadieko ni di katookasɔ, aadieko ni kafɔɔ di nsɔ nwu mmuu di lɛba le aatososa ma aakpee nii.’ Diekye kamakplesa ma n-wako kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lɛma suoto.”<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Letokonanfi Le Nikɔwa Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ kanunua yi, kamakyesee kɔkpaku badikitɛ kpinwu mamamufũ ma. Nni sɛmaa kamakyesee bakpantɛ kpinwu, manaakpà ma di kobokote ku lekpenkpe biala suoto ku afuɔnkpaa sebo kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Anumbi nii kɔnya sisuku lɛma simuu; batawofasa suoto di mi, ee sikpile lɛma siwofa di anumbi nii. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Kamase ma koto ɔta sɛnyɔ di amumu lɛma ku sikpile lɛma disi, diekye batɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa kasɔ nii ku atembi kpɔnɔfɔɔ lɛma ya di nkpa diesi nii. Baayɔ kafɔɔ afiɔ lɛma nwu nikɔkpɛ ni oyududu baayiisa ni atesaa nii kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Disi Otika Di SAATE Nwu Suoto Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Oo SAATE, osie nii ku kawofakɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">katanikokɔ nii di nimiina obe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ di nnle nwu kamawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">babakye kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ manwa mamabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Bate loo ditawɛ lɛsalɛsaa diediki balaatɛ bayaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">afiɔ ya nintadie ni lɛsalɛsaa batabla ni dibiene kuninwii baata ma nii.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Batii mbla mma bamu bayaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Yii, kafɔɔ baale bayaa!”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />“Nkpo oso kamatuo ma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">obe wɔ mmle kamɛ kamatuo ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">osie nii ku nimuɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Ni babatofo alɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">leyooto nii ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Okpile Ku Letokonanfi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />“Lɛbɔɔsaa-wɛɛfɛɛ lɛkpɛnsaa bɛɛyɔ bɛɛkpana Yuda sikpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">lɛklɛklɛfuɔ le kanya niepiɔmpiɔ ni bɛɛyɔ bɛɛkpana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">beetika di afuɔ nkyɛ di situ lɛma suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">ku seleɔta akyikye akya lɛma suoto.<verse eid="JER 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Bia babi lɛma nnyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">seleɔta akyikye ku Asera sewoso lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">di awoso ya niefukuti ni sɛlɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">ku akpenkpe takale suoto.<verse eid="JER 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Kobokote nii di kasɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ku lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ ku asaa lɛfɔ ya amuu niefũ fɔ ni kɔya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">kamayɔ nta fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">diɛkyakaa ni di ntakalekɔ lɛfɔ aba nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ta sikpile simuu di kasɔ nwu suoto oso.<verse eid="JER 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Diefe ni di afɔ omu ɔtanlolaa ɔbla oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">atesaa ya lata fɔ ni kamayu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Kamayɔ fɔ mbla ɔlanle nta balo lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">di kasɔ ka fanan-ye ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">diekye fatookpee mi ɔblɔ osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">kubafiɛ kafɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nintika ni otii disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">nnwɔ nintika ni disi di suoto sina suoto anta ni osie nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">ku otii wɔ otu nimunikĩi kunkyɛ ni di SAATE nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Abate fɛle kowoso di kasɔ ka niɛkoso ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">ɔlɔbanya lɛlɛ̀ nse diɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Abasiɛ di ɔfaafuu aba ya niekoso ate nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">di mmba kasɔ suoto di nfũ di otii kuonwii diesi nii.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />“Kafɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ bɛɛta otii wɔ nintika ni SAATE nwu disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">nnwɔ nintika ni anu di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Abate fɛle kowoso ko bɛɛsɔ ni di okle kotoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">nintaa ni sidu nikũ di kaklenyii kotoko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Kunnyɛkɛ nse difila lɛwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">afata nikũ nte bokoboko obe lele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Kunnkpee suoto kubuɛ di lɛlɛɛ le di koleele lɛkpɛ ni ku osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">di diidii kafɔɔ kunnsĩ ni abi otika.”<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Otu nkpe kakyɔnkyɔ kulenke asaa amuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">anaa ni kafɔɔ difiɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">Owe nimafuo ni kasɔ onu?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />“Ami SAATE nwu ninwolaa otu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">nsɔ kafɔɔ otii disibu nnyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">alɛ kata otii letota di nkpa nɔɔ disiɛbi kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">di mmle di sɛsaabla nɔɔ lesiɛko ni kanya.”<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Otii wɔ ninfe ni di osuku kpile suoto an-wɛ ni lɛlɛ̀</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">nte fɛle kakyinkyikpakala ka nimbiɛ ni afuɔ ya ananfa nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Nse nkpa nɔɔ osiɛ ntɔɔsɛ di nintɛɛ yi, asaa nwu kamasĩ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">abadiki antuo di kayɛntɛkɔ nɔɔ alɛ ditakpa nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Kakleklekɔ loo lɛba nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">ninle dibu lɛkakpomii le bɛɛtakatɛ ni katoo diɛyɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Oo SAATE, Israel disitikasaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">babakpee batii ba bamuu niasĩ fɔ ni sinunsɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Babakpana batii ba niakple fɔ ni di nkpaamaa ayooto di kɔtɛ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">ta batoosĩ ni SAATE nwu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">nkpa ntu nwu kataakɔ.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Oo SAATE, yɔɔsa mi ofiɛ, ni dibayɔɔ mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">diki mi, ni kamawɛ didiki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">diekye afɔ ninle nnwɔ nintansa nii.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Nyu lo, boobuɛ mantɔkɔ mi alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">“Ɔfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa nkpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Ta nwu kuwa kaanya nfɛ!”<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Ninsĩ nlɛ nosinle bafosokpatɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">faye falɛ diele mi dibiesaa alɛ nnɛɛ lefeeyi nwu kawa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">Sɛlaa se nindie ni di anyasibi nii nte temple di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Tanle difu faatɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">afɔ ninle mi katanikokɔ di ayi kpile kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Ta sinunsɔ sikpɛ mba nikomiɛ mi ni dikpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">kafɔɔ tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">ta difu dipɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">kafɔɔ tanta difu lapɛ mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Yɔ sɛlaa kpile ayi fawako di suoto lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">wɔɔsa ma faakple fawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi Nwu Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ: “Tɔɔkyɛ faalayila di batii nwu kayoko, nka di Yuda baka nfe mambuo, mandie ni; faayila kafɔɔ di Yerusalem n-yoko bamba mmuu kanya. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Oo Yuda baka ku Yuda batii bamuu ku otii biala ninsi ni di Yerusalem manfe ni di n-yoko be mmle, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bilolaa binyu bilɛ bietuka letoo kuninwii di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto ee bafenko ni di Yerusalem n-yoko nwu. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Bitandieko letoo kuninwii di ayo lee ee biabla ɔkpɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto, kafɔɔ bibla Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu klekle, fɛ mmle lakpee ni bawa lee kufiofa. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Kafɔɔ batanu ee bakyɔɔ atoko; baawɛ otokopĩ ni batanu ee bafũ lɛnanfi nɛ. <verse eid="JER 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ‘Nse bielolaa bienyu, biɛkyɔɔ mi atoko, minan-yɔ letoo kuninwii bifenko di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle n-yoko di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto, kafɔɔ biɛbla Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu klekle minambla ɔkpɛ kuonwii niini suoto yi, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />ni baka ba ninsi ni di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ kamafe di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle n-yoko mambuo. Mma ku banɔɔfotii lɛma kamasiɛ di bakeke ku bapɔnkɔ suoto man-wa, Yuda basuɔtɔ ku batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem kamakyakaa ma di suoto man-wa, ni batii kamasiɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Batii kamakye Yuda sekpoo ku sekpoenyii se niɛmana ni Yerusalem siekyi ni man-wa, babakye Benyamin amɛ suoto ku kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa, akpenkpe kasɔ ku kalakasɔ man-wa. Babawako ofiɛ asaaɔta, seleɔta, alesaa asaaɔta, olufui ku sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta di SAATE nwu leyo. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Kafɔɔ nse biesĩ mi atoko ɔkyɔɔ, alɛ biabla Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu klekle, bietuka letoo lele di obe wɔ biɔwa ni ɔbafe di Yerusalem n-yoko nwu kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu suoto yi, ni kamayiensa ɔtɔ wɔ mɔnamafuo ni oniisa di Yerusalem n-yoko kunfiɛ ntanikokɔ nɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lakyɛ Dibukiiblatɛ Leyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuawa ni Yeremia ɔkyɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Soo fakyɛ abukiiblatɛ leyo, ninaatɔkɔ fɔ ɔlaa nii ninfa.” <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Nioso lasoo lakyɛ abukiiblatɛ nwu leyo, ni lanyɔɔ ɔɔbla ɔkpɛ di kataata ka suoto mambla ni abukii nɛ. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Kafɔɔ dibukii le aayɔ kɔtɛ aatɔɔbla ni lalalaa di nnɛɛ nɔɔ; nioso abukiiblatɛ nwu layɔ kɔtɛ nwu aabla dibukii bamba, aamunumunusa ni fɛ mmle diakyɛkyɛ diatɔɔ ni kanya.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Oo Israel batii, naafuo ye ɔyɔ ɔbla fɛ mmle di abukiiblatɛ wɔ mmle mbla ni?” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Oo Israel batii, fɛle mmle di kɔtɛ nte ni di abukiiblatɛ kɔnɛɛ kamɛ yi, nkpo bite di nnɛɛ nii nɛ. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Nse obe lele lebuɛ nlɛ baasifi kale ee sɛkakalekɔ kawo, baabiɛ ka batɛ kaasɔ, baawɔɔsa ka kafɔɔ yi, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />ni nse kale nwu lasĩ ɔlaa lata ni lekyi di okpile nɔɔ suoto yi, ni kamadiɛ, nɔmasin-yɔ ɔlaa kpile wɔ nlɛ kamayɔ n-wako ni di suoto ninwu n-wako. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Ni nse di obe bamba owo kamɛ kafɔɔ lebuɛ nlɛ kamabla kale ee sɛkakalekɔ kawo nin-se ka kafɔɔ yi, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />ni nse kale nwu lɛbla okpile di anu nii anankyɔɔ mi atoko, ni nɔmasimbla dibiene le latɛ nlɛ kamabla nta ka ni ɔbla.<verse eid="JER 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />“Nkpo oso kanunua tɔkɔ Yuda batii ku mba ninsi ni di Yerusalem falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Binyu lo, komiɛ ɔlaa kpile otũ ku kanwumbe okũ nlɛ diwa di suoto lee. Nioso bikyi di sisuku kpile lee nwu suoto, obiala lee, bielolaa sisuku lee ku sɛsaabla lee.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Kafɔɔ babadiki kanya bilɛ, ‘Diefĩ. Bubanwini mumbla di lɛsaa le di awo bamu buɛtɛ ni kanya; obiala loo kamatikanko otu kpile nɔɔ otokopĩ sɛsaabla.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Nwu Lasĩ SAATE nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Biwolaa kamɛ bikyeko nnle nwu kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">Owe nitoodinu ɔlaa fɛ nnwɔ mmle okle?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Lɛsaa kpile nimunimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">di Israel Kakpeelebitɛ ntɔɔbla nɛ.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Lebanon atubakani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">ntoodiyɛ di afuɔnkpaa kyɛlɛlɛ ninya suoto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Ntu nyɛnɛnɛɛ nimi be niekye ni nkyekɔ fanfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">ntoodidiɛ obiɛ ofe?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Kafɔɔ batii nii ntooyee mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">manfiɛ olufui manta afiɔ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">ninta ma mantuula di sisuku lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ku saa nfenkɔ lɛma suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Manta ma mankyɛ di sisukuyĩi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ku sisuku se ninanle ni sisuku kplɛ suoto.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Kasɔ lɛma kamalalaa kante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">kanle lɛmansaa ninte ni obe lele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">dibabla batii ba bamuu ninwaalɛ manfe ni ninfa ɔkpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">mantũkunsa kafɔɔ asi lɛma.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Kamasamiisa ma di balo lɛma anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">fɛle kɔfɛɛfɔ ko niekye ni kufĩkatunkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">di ɔlaa kpile otũbee kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">kamaa nii kamakyisa nta ma diele anu nii.”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanwumbe Okũ Di Yeremia Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Biwa, biɛta bukũ kanwumbe di Yeremia suoto; di mmle di kufiofa ko di oletatɛ ntuo ni dilɔbayu ni, ee numbentɛ kɔkà kuyu, ee ɔlaa wɔ niekye ni ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ɔkyɛ kuyu. Nioso biwa, biɛta budieko nwɔ ku sɛkplalomii loo alɛ bulakyɔɔ ɔlaa wɔ oobuɛ ni kuonwii atoko.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Oo SAATE, kyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">faanu ɔlaa wɔ di kanya babuditɛ nii kobuɛ ni!<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Man-yɔ dikpile manta dibiene koto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Kafɔɔ batookutu dibiɔ bɛɛtɛ mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Nyuma falɛ layila di anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">lakakatɛ di disi lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">alɛ faakyisa ɔblɔ yakayaka lɛfɔ di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Nioso ta kɔka kukpɛ babi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">faayɔ ma fakpee di kapamii osie nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Ta basɔfɔ lɛma babla balɛ̀ma ku bakpisɔfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">ta balo basuɔtɔ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">bakosopo lɛma bakpi di kapamii kanya di kakpɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Ta banu kudu kanya bakyeko ayo lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">nse fɛɛkpaa asaa balalaasatɛ fɛɛwako di suoto lɛma di difua kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">diekye batookutu dibiɔ bɛɛtɛ alɛ nkpa mbuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">ni bɛɛkyɔɔ dikyi kafɔɔ bɛɛta nkpaa nii nɛ.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Oo SAATE, kafɔɔ afɔ faye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">kanwumbe lɛma nwu kamuu alɛ boolo mi nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Tan-yɔ akpilesaa lɛma ɔbla faakyɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">ee faakpaa sinumpoo faatĩi sikpile lɛma nwu di anu lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Ta batakatɛsa ma bayu di anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">blako suoto lɛma ɔkpɛ di lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ obe kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s1">Dibukii Biɛle Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaaya kɔtɛ dibukii di dibukiiblatɛ ɔkyɛ. Kpaa batii nwu banɔɔfo bawo ku olebatatɛ bawo fakyakaa di suoto, <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />faadie fatɔɔkyɛ Ben Hinom Ɔtaata, ninkaako ni Dibukii-kakyɛɛ Kayoko kanya. Yie lɛkya di sɛlaa se lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni ninfa, <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Oo Yuda baka ku Yerusalem batii, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bikyɔɔ atoko! Kamata ɔlaa kpile n-wa di lɛba le mmle suoto ninta alɛ ɔfɔɔ nsifi obiala kotoko ko nimanu nwu nii. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Diekye batoosĩ mi ni batɔɔyɔ lɛba le mmle bɛɛbla bafɔɔ bayaa kasiɛkɔ nɛ; batoofiɛ seleɔta ninwu kamɛ bɛɛta bayaa ba di mma ee bate lɛma ee Yuda baka ditatofo ni diidii, ni bɛɛyɔ batii ba ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ ntɔ beeyiisa lɛba le mmle nɛ. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Beetofo aba takale bɛɛta Baal alɛ baafiɛ babi lɛma di ɔtɔ kamɛ fɛ asaaɔta manta Baal- lɛsaa le nintata ni osuku ee mbuɛ nii, ee dibuo ni di disi nii kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Nioso bilolaa binyu, obe nfɛ kɔwa, di batii dilɔbasinlɛɛ ni lɛba le mmle alɛ Tofet ee Ben Hinom Ɔtaata, kafɔɔ batii Kalokɔ Ɔtaata, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />“ ‘Di lɛba le mmle kamata Yuda ku Yerusalem disibu nlalaa nɛ. Kamata ma man-nɔɔ di kapamii kanya di balo lɛma anu, di batii ba ninkomiɛ ni nkpa lɛma dikpile nnɛɛ, kamayɔ bakpi lɛma nta bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku babɔkɛɛ di lepoo kamɛ di kasɔ suoto fɛ alesaa. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Kamakpɔkpɔtɔsa okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle, mbla nwu kafɔɔ lɛmansaa; dibabla mba bamuu ninwaalɛ manfe ni ninfa ɔkpɛ, mantũkunsa asi, ta nkɔ ninwu mmuu oso. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Kamata ma man-wee babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ku babisankobi lɛma sina, babawee kafɔɔ bawo lɛma sina, ta nimiina le di balo lɛma ba ninkomiɛ ni nkpa lɛma dikpile kamatika ma ni di suoto oso.’<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />“Ni biɛ dibukii nwu di obe wɔ di minko mba niɛkyɛ ni ku afɔ konyu ni, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamabiɛ kale ka mmle ku okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle fɛ mmle di dibukiiblatɛ wɔ mmle dibukii lebiɛ nii, ninɔmasinlɛ ni kafɔɔ ololaa. Babakookaa bakpi di Tofet ninanse di obe wɔ di lɛba kuninwii dilɔbasinte nii. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Nle mmle ninle lɛsaa le kamabla ni lɛba le mmle ku mba ninsi ni di lɛba le mmle nɛ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Kamabla okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle fɛle Tofet. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Babakpɔnɔfɔsa ayo ya nin-yɛ ni di Yerusalem ku Yuda baka ale fɛle lɛba le mmle, Tofet- ayo ya amuu di nfũ manfiɛ ni olufui di akyà osi manta ni osi asaa amuu mankpete ni kafɔɔ nta asaaɔta kaasɔ manta ni bayaa bamba.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia lakple di Tofet, di lɛba le di SAATE nwu lakpee nwɔ alɛ alaabuɛ ɔlaa atɛ ni nɛ. Ni aayila di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ aabuɛ aatɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ, <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Bikyɔɔ atoko! Kɔwa ɔlaa kpile otũ biala labuɛ ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ku sekpoenyii se niɛmana nwu siekyi ni suoto ɔyɔ ɔwako ma di suoto, diekye baabla otokopĩ, batanu ni kafɔɔ ɔlaa nii.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Kalɔ Ku Oletatɛ Pasur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Obe wɔ di Imer obisuɔtɔbi oletatɛ Pasur, wɔ niale ni ɔnɔɔfotii-nɔɔfo di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, lanu alɛ Yeremia kobuɛ sɛlaa se mmle antɛ ni yi, <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />ni aata baamufũ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia baapɛ, baapɛ nwɔ lekpo, ni baayɔ nwɔ baakpee di Benyamin Katoo lɛkyɛ Kayoko leyo kamɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Di kale lasɛ nii, di Pasur lafukuti nwɔ ni di lekpo yi, ni di Yeremia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Leyooto le di SAATE nwu lɛta fɔ ni diele Pasur, kafɔɔ Magor-Misabib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, difu nkpe di ɔfankyi biala</char></note> aatika fɔ. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamabla fɔ fanle lɛyɛkɛsaa fanta suoto lɛfɔ ku basiɛwo lɛfɔ bamuu; ku anu lɛfɔ amu fabanya ma mankpi di balo lɛma kapamii kanya. Kamayɔ Yuda omuu nkpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ, nnwɔɔ nimakpaa ma ansifiko Babel ee anlo ma ku kapamii nɛ. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Kamayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle lɛsaawɛ nimuu nkpee di balo lɛma nnɛɛ- asaa ninya amuu, asaa finle ninya amuu ku Yuda baka asaa ya niefũ ni kɔya amuu. Babayɔ nya fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa mantuka nya mansifiko Babel. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Ni afɔ, Pasur, ku mba bamuu ninsi ni di leyo lɛfɔ kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel kasɔ suoto. Nfa bibakpi mankokaa ye nɛ, afɔ ku basiɛwo lɛfɔ ba bamuu niabuɛ kakyɔnkyɔ sɛlaa biatɛ nii.’ ”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Layɔ Ɔlaa Aatɛ Di SAATE Nwu Anu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Oo SAATE, faakyɔnkyɔ mi, ni baakyɔnkyɔ mi nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">osie lɛfɔ lalenkee mi, ni faalenkee nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">ntookple lɛmansaa dii kufĩ kumuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">otii biala kɔma mi.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Obe lele kɔkakatɛ, nfafaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">n-yie lɛkya di kudu okpee ku kawɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Nioso SAATE nwu ɔlaa ntɔɔta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">atufa ku sinunsɔ lɛwa di suoto nii dii kufĩ kumuu.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Kafɔɔ nse lebuɛ nlɛ, “Nɔmalɛɛ nwɔ leyooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ee nkple nkakatɛ di leyooto nɔɔ kamɛ yi,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">ɔlaa nɔɔ nsi di otu nii kamɛ fɛle ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ɔtɔ wɔ bɛɛsɛɛ beekpee ni di akufi nii kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Oklee ninwu ntootuudi mi di kamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">nwaako, nɔmafuo.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Nnu batii kpinwu kobuɛ sɛwɛwɛɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">“Difu nkpe di ɔfankyi biala!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">Diki nwɔ kalɔ! Bita budiki nwɔ kalɔ!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Basiɛwo nii bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">nsoko mi alɛ nfɛntɛ, mambuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Loobia babakyɔnkyɔ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">n-se butɔɔwɛ osie di suoto nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">mumbla ɔbla okyisa loo di suoto nɔɔ.”<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu nsiko mi fɛle kpɛtɛ kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">nioso mba ninkomiɛ ni dikpile nii kamatuula, blɔbalenkee kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Babapɛ kaasɔ, manfũ sinunsɔ osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">blɔbayee sinunsɔ lɛma nwu diidii.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Oo SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, afɔ wɔ ninsɔ tininitɛ fannyu ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">fanwolaa ni otu ku disibu nɔɔ kamɛ fannyu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">tɛɛ nnya ɔbla okyisa lɛfɔ di suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">diekye afɔ lɛyɔ ɔlaa nii lɛta.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Bisa onu bita SAATE nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">Biyɔ katansa bita SAATE nwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Diekye nnwɔɔ ninfũ batii ba diefĩ ni nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">ankyeko basiensiɛtɛ nnɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Lɛkpaani dile dita dii le baalofo mi nii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">Batan-wii dii le di yaami lalofo mi ni lɛtɔtrɔ!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Lɛkpaani dile dita otii wɔ niayɔ kanya aakyɛnko ni teemi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">aatɔɔ aanya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ, aabuɛ ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">“Beelofo obisuɔtɔbi bɛɛta fɔ nii!”<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Otii nwu ate fɛle sekpoo se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ni, atanya sĩ ni nyaami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Tɔɔ anu mmuntũ di olesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">kakpɛ kudu di kakũ.<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />Diekye atalo mi di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">ku yaami fɛ ɔkya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">alɛ lɛmɛ nɔɔ kate, dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Obe lɛsaa oso latɛ ladie di olofofɔtɔ nwu kamɛ lawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">alɛ kanya dibuo ku sɛnyaami owi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">alɛ ayi nii kaloo di sinunsɔ kamɛ?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Labuɛ Aatɛ Alɛ Babel Batii Kamalenkee Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia di obe wɔ di Ɔka Sedekia lakpee ni Malkiya obisuɔtɔbi Pasur ku Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi oletatɛ Sefania di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. Baabuɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Wolaa asaa kamɛ fakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ fata wo, diekye Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar kodieko wo. Loobia SAATE nwu kamabla asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ anta wo fɛ mmle aabla ni di obe owo nitɔbafe ni kamɛ, alɛ aadiɛ wo odieko.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Kafɔɔ Yeremia ladiki kanya, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Tɔkɔ Sedekia falɛ, <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔmamunikĩisa kakpɛ akpɛsaa ya ninsi ye ni ninnɛɛ di suoto lee, n-ya bikle biɔkpɛko ni Babel ɔka ku Babel batii ba ninkpe ni di oyoyiɛ sɛmaa bɛɛmana ye beekyi nii. Kamasiisa ma kafɔɔ nkpee di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Ami omu nii kamakpɛko ye ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi ku kɔnɛɛ siene nii, di ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ ku ɔblɔ kplɛ yakayaka kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Kamalo batii ba ninsi ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ- batii ku babɔkɛɛ akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ- mankpi kafɔɔ di ofiɛ kpile kanya. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nni kamaa, kamayɔ Yuda ɔka Sedekia, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku batii ba ninsi ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ ninankpi ni di ofiɛ kpile nwu, kapamii ku kɔka ɔkpɛ kanya nkpee di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ku balo lɛma ba nikomiɛ ni nkpa lɛma dikpile nnɛɛ. Abalo ma ku kapamii; ɔlɔbale ma sibualɛ ee anya ma nyaami ee ɔlaa lɛma kunu nwɔ kafutu.’<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />“Diɛkyakaa ni yi, tɔkɔ batii nwu falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nyu lo, kɔyɔ nkpa osuku ku kukpi osuku ntɛ ye di anu. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Otii lele niesiɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ kamakpi di kapamii, kɔka ee ofiɛ kpile kanya. Kafɔɔ otii lele niedie ɛɛkyɛ ɛɛlaayɔ suoto nɔɔ ɛɛta Babel batii ba niɛmana beekyi ye ni kamasiɛ nkpa; abatosoko nkpa nɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Ntɔɔtɛ nlɛ kamabla okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle dikpile, ninanle ni dibiene, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Babayɔ nwu mankpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ, anwɔɔsa nwu ku ɔtɔ.’<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛkanko Di Yuda Lɛkayo Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />“Diɛkyakaa ni yi, tɔkɔ Yuda lɛkayo falɛ, ‘Binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa; <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />Oo Dawid leyo kamɛ batii, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">“ ‘Bika lɛka tinini olesɛ biala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">bifũ otii nkpa di banyinkatɛ nɔɔ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">otii wɔ beeyu nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">nse diele nkpo ni ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kamakɛsɛɛ kunfiɛ fɛle ɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">ta akpilesaa ya bitɔɔbla ni oso-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">kubafiɛ di otii kuonwii dilɔbafuo nwu ni oniisa.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Yerusalem, lɛtaka n-yɛ di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di ɔtaata wɔ mmle nsintɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">di difuɔnkpaa nwu kobokote nsintɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 21:13">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Afɔ wɔ nimbuɛ ni falɛ, “Owe nimafuo ɔtaka wo di suoto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Owe nimafuo katanikokɔ loo obuo?”<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Kamananfi ye kootoko fɛ mmle diesiɛko ni ablasaa lee,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 21:14">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Kamakɛsɛɛsa ɔtɔ di apoo lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">kunfiɛ lɛsaa biala le niɛmana fɔ diekyi nii.’ ”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ka Di Yeremia Lata Ni Yuda Lɛkayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Soo fakyɛ Yuda ɔka lɛkayo faalaayie ɔlaa wɔ mmle lɛkya ninfa falɛ: <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />‘Oo Yuda ɔka, afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto- afɔ, banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ ba ninfe ni di kayoko ka mmle, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bibla lɛsaa le niesiko ni ku nle ninlɛ ni. Bifũ otii wɔ beeyu ni bikyeko nyinkatɛ nɔɔ nnɛɛ. Bitambla ɔfɔɔ dikpile ee amumu, kuɛbi ee kpisɔfɔ, bitan-wii otii wɔ ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ ntɔ kaasɔ di lɛba le mmle kafɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Diekye nse bielolaa bienyu biɛbla di afiofa ya mmle kanya yi, ni baka ba ninsiɛ ni di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto kamafe di lɛba le mmle n-yoko man-wa, babasiɛ di bakeke ku bapɔnkɔ suoto, diɛkyakaa ni di banɔɔfotii lɛma ku batii lɛma. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, kafɔɔ nse bieele afiofa ya mmle yi, lɛka di suoto nii nlɛ lɛkayo le mmle kamawɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Yuda ɔka lɛkayo suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Kuntɛ fate fɛle Gilead fatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">fɛle Lebanon kobokote nsintɛɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">nwaako kamabla fɔ fante fɛle ɔfaafuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">fɛle sekpoo se di batii diesi nii.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Kamakpee asaabalalaasatɛ di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">otii biala kamaklee akpɛsaa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">bababudi seda awoso biene lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">manfuki mankpee di ɔtɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />“Batii kamakye nnle kpinwu kamɛ mamafe di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ɔlɔɔkɔ mankaalɛ bawo alɛ, ‘Obe oso di SAATE nwu lɛbla okpoo kplɛ-kplɛ wɔ mmle lɛsaa le mmle okle?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Kanya didikibi nimale alɛ: ‘Ta baasĩ ni SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu kanya ninii, bɛɛlaasumu, bɛɛbla ni kafɔɔ bayaa bamba sɛkpɛ oso.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Kanya Ɔlaa Di Yoahas Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Bitan-wi biata ɔka wɔ niekpi nii ee bisiɛ kaku bita lɛsaa le nieyu nwɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">kafɔɔ, biwi kaku osie kanya bita otii wɔ ninsi ni di sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">diekye ɔlɔbapɛakple awa diidii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">ee akple anya katefa nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Salum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwɔɔ mankple manlɛɛ Yehoahas nɛ</char></note> suoto, nnwɔ niale ni sɛka di ote kakpimaa fɛ Yuda ɔka, kafɔɔ atoodie ninfũ eesifi: “Ɔlɔbapɛakple awa diidii. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Abakpi di lɛba le baamufũ nwɔ baasifiko nii; ɔlɔbasinkple anya kasɔ ka mmle.”<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Kanya Ɔlaa Di Yehoiakim Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />“Yɔɔsa bɔɔta otii wɔ nintofo ni lɛkayo nɔɔ ninanle ni di ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">osi nɔɔ ayo di onukwale ɔtanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">anta ni okpoo nɔɔ batii mbla ni ɔkpɛ kasakasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">ananta ma ni kɔkpɛnto lɛma.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Ambuɛ alɛ, ‘Kamatofo lɛkayo kplɛ nta suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">ku osi ayo ya niemuɔ nii.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Nioso andiki basɛfle kplɛ niini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">ankpee ni seda akloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">anlolaa ni ku kɔfa sɛɛle.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />“Ninta fɔ fanle ɔka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">alɛ faawɛ seda awoso ampɔ ankple ampɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Diele teefɔ ninkpe alesaa ku nta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">Aabla lɛsaa le nialɛ ni ku nle niasiɛko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">nioso asaa amuu lalɛ ɔkyɛ aatɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Aakpɛ aata bapiitɛ ku mba diafĩ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">nioso asaa amuu lalɛ ɔkyɛ ɔtɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Diele nni ninle lɛsaa le niatuo alɛ baatofo mi nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />“Kafɔɔ anumbi lɛfɔ ku otu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">ntika di onukwale ɔtanle lɛsaawɛ lete suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">di batii ba ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ ntɔ owii kaasɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">ku batii onyinka ku asaa ofũ osie kanya di batii nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim, Yuda ɔka nwu suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Blɔbawi batɔɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Ao, obiloo-suɔtɔbi! Ao, obiloo-sankobi!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Blɔbawi batɔɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Ao, saate nii! Ao, dibu ɔka!’<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo lekookaa babakookaa nwɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">babawududusɔɔ mansifiko manafuki nwɔ man-yu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">di Yerusalem n-yoko nwu sɛmaa.”<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lakakatɛ Aakyeko Yerusalem Dii Kaamaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />“Kata fakyɛ Lebanon faalaafaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">faata banu fɔ sɛlɔ di Basan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">faa osie kanya fakyeko Moab abokote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnya nwu manlɛɛ Abarim nɛ</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">diekye batɔɔwɔɔsa basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nwu bamuu.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Lasĩ ɔlaa lata fɔ di obe wɔ faanyu falɛ fanaa ni olè,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">kafɔɔ faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nɔmakyɔɔ fɔ atoko!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Nkpo fate diɛyɔ ni di sekpeele lɛfɔ obe nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">fankyɔɔ mi ɔlaa atoko.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Kɔfɛɛfɔ kamatuka bafoso bakpatɛ lɛfɔ bamuu ansifiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Ni babakpee fɔ sinunsɔ, sinunsɔ kafɔɔ nkpɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">ta asiensiesaa lɛfɔ amuu oso.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di ‘Lebanon,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">fasi ni di sedar awoso ayo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">fabatũni nse ninyinyi lɛwa fɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">dibuo fɛle lɛmɛlakatɛ wɔ nikɔkpɛ ni kolofo!<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Di Konia Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, nse bia afɔ Yehoiakim obisuɔtɔbi Konia, Yuda ɔka, fale nsũ ɔtɛ lɛkɔnii di koletanɛɛ nii yi, kamananfi fɔ ndiki. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Kamayɔ fɔ nkpee di batii ba nikomiɛ alɛ balo fɔ ni nnɛɛ, mba fanyɛkɛ nii-Babel ɔka Nebukanesar ku Babel batii. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Kamayɔ afɔ ku yaafɔ wɔ nialofo fɔ ni nfuki n-yu di kasɔ bamba suoto, nfũ mananlofo ni kuonwii lee, nfa kafɔɔ di akyuu lee anyɔ nwu kamakpi nɛ. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Bilɔbasinkple biwa kasɔ ka biomiɛ bilɛ biɔpɛminkple minwa ni suoto diidii.”<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Dibukii le niebiɛ ni di osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle Konia n-le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">lɛsaa le di otii kuonwii dilomiɛ ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Obe oso baafuki nnwɔɔ ku babi nɔɔ man-yu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">manfuki ma mantɛ di kasɔ ka manan-ye ni suoto?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Ao kasɔ, kasɔ, kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">nu SAATE nwu ɔlaa!<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Bitɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle nsũ fɛ otii wɔ ninaa ni obi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">osuɔtɔ wɔ di lɛlɛ dilɔbalɛ ni di nkpa nɔɔ osiɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">diekye dilɔbalɛ dita kafutu nɔɔ obi kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">kuonwii lɛma dilɔbasiɛ di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">ee akple ale sɛka di Yuda kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Osuku Onyu Nkpe Kuɔta Dii Kaamaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Yɔɔsa bɔɔta bafoso bakpatɛ ba nikɔwɔɔsa, mansamiisa ni bafoso di sɛfa kaweekɔ nii!”. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni bafoso bakpatɛ ba nikonyu ni batii nii alɛ: “Ta bitɔɔsamiisa ni babɔkɛɛ nii, bietososa ma biesifiko, minanyu ma ni kafɔɔ oso yi, kamayɔ lɛkanko n-wako ye di suoto ta lɛsaa kpile le biɛbla ni oso,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />“Ami omu nii kamasiisa bafoso nii ba niebu ni ndiki di nsɔ be mmuu di nfũ latososa ma lakpee nii, ninkplesa ma kafɔɔ n-wako sɛfa lɛma kaweekɔ, nfũ babalofo, mankpɛ mankyakaa ni di lɛpɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Kamayɔ bafoso bakpatɛ n-se ma kaanya. Mma nimakpa ma, di mmle mɔnɔmasinyɛkɛ ee difu dipɛ ma, ee kuonwii ayu nii,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">“Obe kɔwa, kamatakatɛ Owosola tinini katoo nta ni Dawid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">Ɔka wɔ nimale ni sɛka di ninumbe kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">ambla ni lɛsaa le niesiɛko ni ku nle ninlɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Di obe nɔɔ kamɛ yi, Yuda kamawɛ didiki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">Israel kafɔɔ kamasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Nnya leyooto le babalɛɛ nwɔ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">SAATE Ɔsaabla Tinini Loo.<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Nioso, obe kɔwa di batii dilɔbasimbuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niakpaa Israel batii adieko ni di Egipte,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />kafɔɔ bababuɛ alɛ, ‘Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niakpaa Israel batii aadieko ni di katookasɔ ku nsɔ be mmuu, di nfũ aatososa ma aakpee nii.’ Ni babasiɛ di mma bamu kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Kanya Ɔlaa Kuɔta Ni Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Ɔlaa di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Otu nii ntoobiɛ kaamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">akufi nii amuu kotũtũkũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Nte fɛle tasiɛntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">fɛle otii wɔ di nta ntoolenkee ni okle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">ta SAATE nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">ku sɛlaa nɔɔ klekle oso.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Kasɔ nwu leyii ku basɔnɔkpeetɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">ta lɛkpaani nwu oso yi, kasɔ ntooklee keekoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">sɛfa nweekɔ nwu kafɔɔ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ ntookpi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ntikanko osuku kpile nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">mambla ko ni osie lɛma ɔkpɛ di onukwale ɔtanle kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />“Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ku oletatɛ akyuu nwu anyɔ nnaa dibu bɛɛta Yaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">bia n-nya asiensiesaa lɛma nwu di olekatakɔ nii kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 23:11">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />“Nkpo oso osuku lɛma kamabla kplɔkplɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">babatososa ma makpee di ditunu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">nfa kafɔɔ babanɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Kamayɔ ɔlaa kpile n-wako ma di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">di lɛlɛɛ le babananfi ma ni kootoko,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 23:12">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />“Di Samaria ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">lanya lɛsaa lalaale le mmle:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Baabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ di Baal leyooto kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">ni baaleko batii nii Israel katũ baayu osuku nɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Di Yerusalem ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ kafɔɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">ntɔɔnya lɛsaa yɛkɛle ninwii:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Baakpee asɔnɔ, ni baalaa sɛlaa ku afunu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Baakpee bakpileblatɛ nnɛɛ osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">di mmle di kuonwii dilaakyi ni di asiensiesaa nɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Bamuu lɛma bate fɛle Sodom bɛɛtɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Yerusalem batii nte fɛle Gomora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Kamata ma manle alesaa ya ninkpe ni olo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">mannyi kafɔɔ kɔfa kpile ntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">ta ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba niekye ni Yerusalem oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">Yaa ɔtambu ntoobiɛ diebuo di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninleke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Bitankyɔɔ ɔlaa wɔ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu kobuɛ mantɛ manta ye nii atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">boobuɛ man-yiisa ye atoko ku kakyɔnkyɔ sisuku onyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Mambuɛ asaaɔnya sɛlaa mankyeko mma bamu asibu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">sinankye ni SAATE nwu kanya kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Mantoobuɛ mantɔtɔkɔ mba ninnyu mi ni nyakatãa alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">‘SAATE nwu kobuɛ alɛ: Bibawɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">Mba bamuu kafɔɔ nintikanko ni situ lɛma atokopĩsaa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Okpile kuonwii dilɔbawa ye di suoto.’<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Kafɔɔ owe lɛma nitodiyila di SAATE nwu bawokalɛɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">alɛ ɔɔnya ee oonu ɔlaa nɔɔ?<verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Binyu lo, SAATE nwu afɛɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">kamakpɛ di ɔblɔ yakayaka kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">kakitikɔ kamakpɛ kansoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">di basiensietɛ nwu asi suoto.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />SAATE nwu ɔblɔ dilɔbapɛkukple kusifi sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">dilaase di obe wɔ eeloo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">otu nɔɔ disitikasaa nimuu ɔbla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Bibanu ni kasɔ klekle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">di ayi ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Ntakpee ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">kafɔɔ batookusako ɔlaa lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">ntakakatɛ lata ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">kafɔɔ baabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Kafɔɔ nse manyila di bawo kalɛɛkɔ nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">n-se batabayie sɛlaa nii lɛkya manta batii nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">mamunkĩisa ma kafɔɔ di sisuku kpile lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">ku akpilesaa sɛsaabla lɛma nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />“Lete nii ninle Yaa wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni lete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">ni diele Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni kaakyonkɔ nle?”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 23:23">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Otii owo kamafuo owofa di n-wofakɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">alɛ namafuo nwɔ ɔnya?”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 23:24">SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">“Diele ami nieyii osi ku kasɔ?”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 23:24">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />“Ntoonu ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nimbuɛ kakyɔnkyɔ sɛlaa ku ofunu sɛlaa mantɛ ni di leyooto nii kamɛ. Mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Lasɛ kɔlaafɔ! Lasɛ kɔlaafɔ!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Ɔmɛmbe di nle mmle kamadiɛ sĩtũ ɔkyɛ di balaatɛ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba mmle situ kamɛ, mba nimbuɛ ni mma bamu asibu kamɛ sɛlaa mantɛ ni? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Beenyu alɛ alaafɔ ya manka ni bawo kamata batii nii n-yee leyooto nii, fɛ mmle okle di bate lɛma layee ni leyooto nii diafe ni di Baal osumu kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Bita ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ ninsɛ ni kɔlaafɔ aka kɔlaafɔ nɔɔ, kafɔɔ bita nnwɔ ninkle ni ɔlaa nii abuɛ nwu di onukwale ole kamɛ. Diekye obe di sɛmɔɔbuu nkpe ɔbla ku kamɔɔ?” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Diele ote di ɔlaa nii nte fɛle ɔtɔ, kute ni kafɔɔ fɛle ɔmankyĩ wɔ nimbibiɛ ni afuɔnkpaa wɛkyɛwɛkyɛ?<verse eid="JER 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Nkpo oso lɛtaka n-yɛ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nin-yu sɛlaa mankyeko ni bawo sɛkyɛ, mambuɛ alɛ ɔkyɛ nii siekye nii. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Nyu lo,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Lɛtaka n-yɛ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nin-yɔ mma bamu sɛkplalomii mambuɛ ni alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu niebuɛ ni suoto.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Nwaako, lɛtaka n-yɛ di mba nimbuɛ sɛlaa ku afunu alaafɔ mantɛ ni suoto,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. “Mantɔkɔ batii nii, manleko ma katũ man-yusa osuku ku lɛkanta fukuti lɛma sɛlaa ku afunu, kafɔɔ ninkpee ma ee ndiki ma. Batii ba mmle nin-wɛ lɛsalɛsaa di suoto lɛma di lɛsaa kuninwii kamɛ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />Nse batii ba mmle, ee ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ee oletatɛ owo, lɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, ‘Obe lɛsaa ninle SAATE nwu ɔlaa?’ kaalɛ ma falɛ, ‘Ɔmɛnlaa? Kamasĩ fɔ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Nse ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ee oletatɛ ee otii owo lebuɛ alɛ, ‘Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa,’ Kamananfi otii nwu ku leyo nɔɔ kamɛ batii kootoko. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di obiala lee ntoobuɛ antɔɔtɔkɔ ni siɛwo ee ɔnantii nɔɔ alɛ: ‘Obe ninle SAATE nwu kanya didikibi?’ ee ‘Obe di SAATE nwu lebuɛ?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ alɛ fɛɛlɛɛ ‘SAATE nwu ɔlaa’ diɛkyakaa nii, ta di otii biala ɔlaa omu ntookple nwɔ ni ɔlaa oso yi, beemunikĩisa Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Yaa loo wɔ Ninleke ni ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ fantɔɔkaalɛ ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ falɛ: ‘Obe ninle SAATE nwu kanya didiki le ɛɛta fɔ ni?’ ee ‘Obe di SAATE nwu lebuɛ?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Kuntɛ mimbuɛ bilɛ, ‘Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa yi,’ nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu lebuɛ ni alɛ: Mimblako sɛlaa nwu ɔkpɛ bilɛ, ‘Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa,’ nu latɔkɔ ye nlɛ bitambuɛ bilɛ, ‘Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa.’ <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />Nkpo oso, nwaako kamayee ye, nintososa ye kafɔɔ di anu nii diɛkyakaa ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ lata ye ni ku bate lee. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Kamayɔ anunsɔsaa ya ninaa ni kaloo- sinunsɔ se ninaa ni kaloo, manabayee ni diidii n-wako di suoto lee.”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Abue Nkyikyɛ Nnyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Di obe wɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lakpaa ni Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim obisuɔtɔbi Yekonia ku banɔɔfotii, asaabawolatɛ ku Yuda batii ba nin-ye ni kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ aadieko ni di Yerusalem aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel sɛmaa yi, ni di SAATE nwu latuo mi abue nkyikyɛ nnyɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Abue ya nialɛ ni nwaa lasiɛ di kakyikyɛ kanwii kamɛ, fɛle n-ya nialekatũ aasɛɛ nii; n-ya niasiɛ ni di kakyikyɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ lale abuɛ ya nintalɛ ni saa, aatɛ aalalaa alɛ alaalɛ ole.<verse eid="JER 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Yeremia, Obe lɛsaa fɔɔnya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Ni ladiki kanya nlɛ, “Abue. N-ya ninlɛ ni lɛtɛ alɛ nwaa, kafɔɔ n-ya ninanlɛ ni lɛtɛ ɛɛlalaa alɛ alaalɛ ole.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Fɛ mmle okle di abue ya mmle nlɛ ni yi, nkpo lɛnya Yuda batii ba niekye ni sɛlanle kamɛ, mba latososa ni di lɛba le mmle lasifiko ni Babel batii kasɔ suoto nlɛ balɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Anu nii kamanyu ma ninta dibiene lɛma. Kamakplesa ma kafɔɔ n-wako kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Kamatakatɛ ma nse, namata ma bapɛ kaasɔ; kamasɔ ma, diele osifi kamasifi ma. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Kamata ma otu alɛ baatofo mi, alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. Babale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lɛma, diekye babapɛmankple man-wa ɔkyɛ nii ku otu lɛma omuu.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “ ‘Kafɔɔ fɛle abue ya ninanlɛ nii, n-ya niɛtɛ ɛɛlalaa ni alɛ alaalɛ ni ole yi, nkpo kamablako Yuda ɔka Sedekia, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku mba niekye ni Yerusalem beebu basi ni nkpa ɔkpɛ nɛ. Kuntɛ bɛɛka di kasɔ ka mmle suoto ee basi di Egipte. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Kamabla ma diyududusaa ku dikpilesaa nta kasɔ sɛkanlekɔ mmuu, ninunsɔsaa ku okyonsanu, lɛmansaa ku lɛkpaani di lɛba lele letososa ma lekpee. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Kamata kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile n-wa di suoto lɛma ninaase di obe wɔ bɛɛwɔɔ beedie ni di kasɔ ka layɔ lata ma ni ku bate lɛma.’ ”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Lo Wɔ Niakye Ni Katookasɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Ɔlaa nwu lawa kuata Yeremia kuakyeko ni Yuda batii bamuu suoto di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ, diale ni Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Nioso ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia latɔkɔ Yuda batii bamuu ku mba bamuu ninsi ni di Yerusalem alɛ: <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-atiɛ amu nɛ- diayɔ ni di Yuda ɔka Amon obisuɔtɔbi Yosia lefosi lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ diɛbadu ni miɛ dii le mmle yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa ntɔɔwa kuɔtɛɛ, ntoobuɛ nwu, lekple lebuɛ nwu kafɔɔ lɛtɔkɔ ye, kafɔɔ biɛkyɔɔ atoko.<verse eid="JER 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Nu di SAATE nwu kafɔɔ lakpee ye bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu, aakple aakpee ma yi, bitanu ee bikyɔɔ atoko kuanwii. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Baabuɛ alɛ, “Obiala lee akyisa nkpa, di sikpile sisuku lee ku akpilesaa sɛsaabla lee suoto, ni bibafuo osiɛ di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu lata ye ni ku bate lee dinaa ni kaloo diidii. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Bitantikanko bayaa bamba alɛ biabla ma sɛkpɛ minsumu ma kafɔɔ; bitankpee mi ɔblɔ ku asaa ya biɛyɔ nnɛɛ lee biɛbla nii. Ni namabla ye dikpile.”<verse eid="JER 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ bitakyɔɔ mi atoko, ni biakpee mi ɔblɔ ku asaa ya di nnɛɛ lee lɛbla nii, ni biɛyɔ dikpile biɛwako di aye bamu suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Nkpo oso SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ alɛ: “Ta minankyɔɔ ni sɛlaa nii atoko oso yi, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />kamalɛɛ katookasɔ batii bamuu ku kpɛmblatɛ nii Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. “Kamayɔ ma n-wako di kasɔ ka mmle ku batii ba ninsi ka ni di suoto ku nnle be mmuu niɛmana ye diekyi ni suoto. Kamawɔɔsa ma klekle, nimbla ma kafɔɔ lɛyɛkɛsaa, lɛmansaa, ku kawɔɔ ka ninaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Kamanĩisa lɛpɔ̀ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kudù lɛma nwu kanya, ɔkafɔɔ ku ɔkafɔɔsa sɛlɔ, kukùɔ sɛlɔ ku kandiɛ ɔtɔ ndiki di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Kasɔ ka mmle kamuu kamakple kasɔ ka niekpi ni, kate ni kafukuti, nnle be mmle kafɔɔ kamabla ɔkpɛ ninta Babel ɔka Nebukanesar alɛɛ afosi-akuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="JER 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ nse alɛɛ afosi-akuɛnsĩ nwu ntɔɔwa eeloo yi, kamananfi Babel ɔka ku kale nɔɔ, Babel batii kasɔ nwu kootoko, ta lɛpɔɔ lɛma okpi oso. Kamata ka kafɔɔ kankpi kante dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Kamayɔ asaa ya amuu suoto lakakatɛ ni n-wako ninnwu suoto. Asaa ya amuu bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ, di Yeremia labuɛ ɔlaa aatɛ ni di nnle nwu mmuu suoto. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Mma bamu babale nnle kpinwu ku baka kplɛ balanle; kamase ma koto lɛta di mma bamu sɛsaabla ku nnɛɛ lɛma ɔkpɛ kanya.”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Nnle Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ: “Fũ opũ wɔ mmle nieyii ni ku ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nta di kɔnɛɛ nii, faata nnle be mmuu ɔkyɛ lekpee fɔ ni banyi. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Nse beenyi nwu yi, babasiɛ́, mankpankpa, mambuo afĩi ta kapamii ka kamakyesee ni di kamɛ lɛma oso.”<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Nioso lafũ opũ nwu di SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ, ni lata nnle be mmuu ɔkyɛ aakpee mi ni lanyi ɔblɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Yerusalem ku Yuda sekpoo, baka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ, nimbla ma kawɔɔ, lɛyɛkɛsaa, lɛmansaa ku lɛkpaani, fɛ mmle bate ni miɛ; <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Farao Kplɛ, bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku batii nɔɔ bamuu, <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />ku bafɔɔ bamuu ninfa; Us kasɔ baka bamuu; Filisti baka bamuu (mba niekye ni Askelon, Gasa, Ekron, ku batii ba niabu ni di Asdod); <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />Edom, Moab ku Amon; <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />Tiro ku Sidon baka bamuu; lekpo kotoko nsɔ baka ba ninkpe ni di lekpo sɛmaa; <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Dedan, Tema, Bus kasɔ ku mba bamuu nikpe ni di aba ya niekyo nii; <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />Arabia baka bamuu ku bafɔɔ baka bamuu ba ninsi ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ; <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />Simri baka bamuu, Elam ku Media; <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />ku katookasɔ baka bamuu, mba niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni ku mba nikpe ni fanfa, onwii, onwii- sɛkanlekɔ be mmuu di kasɔ suoto. Di bamuu lɛma sɛmaa kafɔɔ yi, Sesak ɔka kafɔɔ kamanyi nwu.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />“Ni faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Binyi, biesiɛ, biɛlaa kafɔɔ, biɛnɔɔ alɛ bilasintaka diidii ta kapamii ka kamakyesee ni di kamɛ lee oso.’ <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Kafɔɔ nse beesĩ alɛ bloofũ opũ nwu di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ banyi yi, ni faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Dikpeni bienyi ɔblɔ nwu! <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Nyu lo, nfɛ kokye kasɔ n-yɔ ɔlaa kpile n-wako di okpoo kplɛ wɔ nikole ni Leyooto ni suoto. Ni nwaako bibatoso letokonanfi nwu? Bilɔbatoso letokonanfi nwu, diekye kosoosa kapamii di mba bamuu ninsi ni di kasɔ suoto, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ.’<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />“Nunua yi, buɛ sɛlaa se mmle simuu di suoto lɛma fatɛ, faatɔkɔ ma falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">“ ‘SAATE nwu kamakumii ankyeko osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">abakpududuu ankyeko kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ klekle nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">ankumii osie kanya anyila di kasɔ nɔɔ ablasaa suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Abayiisa kudu fɛle balɔɔfiɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">babayiisa kudu di batii ba bamuu ninsi ni kaasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Kudú oyiisa kamadie osie kanya di nsɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">diekye SAATE nwu kamayɔ sɛlaa di nnle nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">abayɔ lɛkanko anwako di batii bamuu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">anlo siensiɛtɛ kafɔɔ ku kapamii,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 25:31">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">Binyu lo! Ɔlaa kpile kɔkpɛ̀</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">kunkye kale kunsifi kale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">kɔfɛɛfɔ siene kɔtaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">kunkye kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ.”<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Di obe nwu kamɛ batii ba di SAATE nwu lelo ni kamakyaka kakɔ biala- diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ kayɛntɛlekɔ kanwii diesifi ni kabamba. Blɔbawi ma ee basiisa ma ee bakookaa ma, kafɔɔ babate fɛle aku ya ninte ni kaasɔ.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Aye bafosobakpatɛ, biwi kaku biɛpɛ mmuntũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">aye babɔkɛɛ kanyabayilatɛ, bipɛbimunu di kudù kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Diekye obe wɔ babalo ye ni ntoowo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">bibanɔɔ mimpupuu fɛle dibukii biene.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Bafosobakpatɛ dilɔbawɛ kakɔkaakɔ batoso bafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">babɔkɛɛ kanyabayilatɛ dilɔbawɛ lɛba kuninwii batoso basifi.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Nu bafosobakpatɛ kaku owi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">babɔkɛɛ kanyabayilatɛ mmuntũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">diekye SAATE nwu nfɛ kɔwɔɔsa sɛfa kaweekɔ lɛma.<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Babalalaasa batii ba ninsi ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ mantɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">ta SAATE nwu lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nwu oso.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Abadiɛ kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ antɛ fɛle kyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">kasɔ lɛma kafɔɔ kamakpi kante</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">ta nyinkatɛ kapamii nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">ku SAATE nwu lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka oso.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Baakpaa Yeremia Baakyɛnko Kakankɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka ole kasɔkakyekɔ kamɛ yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle lakye SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ kuawa alɛ: <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Yila di SAATE nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ, faakakatɛ fata Yuda sekpoo batii ba bamuu nin-wa mamasumu ni di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ. Tɔkɔ ma ɔlaa biala latɔkɔ fɔ ni; tandiki ɔlaa kuninwii kaamɛ. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Loobia babakyɔɔ atoko, obiala lɛma kafɔɔ nkyi di osuku kpile nɔɔ suoto. Ni kamadiɛ, namasinta ɔlaa kpile wɔ latɛ nlɛ kɔyɔ n-wako ni di suoto lɛma, ta okpile wɔ batɔɔbla ni kuwa di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nse biɛɛkyɔɔ mi atoko bitikanko kafɔɔ kufiofa nii ko lɛtɛ ni di anu lee, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />nse biɛɛkyɔɔ kafɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ sɛlaa atoko, mba lakpee ni, lakple lakpee ni kɔtɔ di ɔkyɛ lee (nu bitakyɔɔ ma atoko), <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />nioso kamabla leyo le mmle fɛle Silo, nimbla kafɔɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle lɛkpaani di kasɔ suoto nnle mmuu kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Olebatatɛ, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku batii nwu bamuu lanu di Yeremia lakakatɛ ni sɛlaa se mmle di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Kafɔɔ nfanwu di Yeremia laloo ni sɛlaa se simuu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ atɔkɔ ni batii nwu bamuu yi, ni di olebatatɛ, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku batii nwu bamuu lamufũ nwɔ babuɛ alɛ, “Dikpeni feekpi! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Obe oso foobuɛ ɔlaa fantɛ di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ falɛ leyo le mmle kamate fɛle Silo, di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kafɔɔ kamate ofukuti, batii ndie nwu kaamɛ?” Ninfɛ di batii nwu bamuu lasi di Yeremia suoto di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Di Yuda banɔɔfotii lanu ni sɛlaa se mmle yi, baadie di lɛkayo baasifi SAATE nwu leyo, ni baalaasiɛ di nsiɛkɔ lɛma di SAATE nwu leyo Kayoko Fɔlɛ kayokontũ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu latɔkɔ banɔɔfotii nwu ku batii nwu bamuu alɛ, “Dikaatɛ alɛ beelo osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle, diekye eebuɛ ɔlaa ɛɛtɛ eeyila ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle suoto. Bitoonu nwu ku aye bamu atoko!”<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Ni di Yeremia latɔkɔ banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu ku batii nwu bamuu alɛ: “SAATE nwu niekpee mi alɛ mbuɛ ɔlaa ntɛ di leyo le mmle ku okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle suoto di sɛlaa se simuu bitoonu ni suoto. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Nunua yi, bikyi di sisuku lee ku sɛsaabla lee suoto, biɛkyɔɔ kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee atoko. Ni SAATE nwu kamadiɛ, ɔlɔbasinta ɔlaa kpile wɔ aabuɛ ni kuwa di suoto lee. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Kafɔɔ ami yi, nsi ye ninnɛɛ; bibla mi lɛsaa lele bienyu bilɛ dilɛ, diesiɛko ni. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Kafɔɔ bitofo bilɛ, nse bielo mi yi, bibayɔ ntɔ be ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa lɛpɔɔ okpi minwako di suoto lee ku okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ku batii ba ninsi ni ninwu kamɛ suoto. Diekye di onukwale kamɛ yi, SAATE nwu lakpee mi ɔkyɛ lee alɛ mbuɛ sɛlaa se mmle simuu nkpee di atoko lee kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Ninfɛ di banɔɔfotii nwu ku batii nwu bamuu latɔkɔ olebatatɛ ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu alɛ, “Diɛkaatɛ alɛ beelo osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle! Ɛɛkakatɛ ɛɛta wo di SAATE Yaa loo nwu leyooto kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Ni di kasɔ nwu banɔɔfo bawo ladie baawa sitũ baabatɔkɔ kasikɔ nwu kamuu alɛ, <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Mika wɔ niakye ni Moreset labuɛ ɔlaa aatɛ di Yuda ɔka Hesekia obe kamɛ. Aatɔkɔ Yuda batii bamuu alɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“ ‘Babafúu Sion fɛle kofe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Yerusalem kamakple atɛnkudi ya besiisa bɛɛtɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">olekatakɔ nwu lekpenkpe kafɔɔ kamakple ditii nin-yii nimbla kafɔɔ lepoo.’<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />“Yuda ɔka Hesekia ee otii bamba owo di Yuda lalo nwɔ? Diele ɔyɛkɛ di Hesekia layɛkɛ SAATE nwu aakaalɛ sifutulɛ nɔɔ ole? Ni SAATE nwu kafɔɔ ditadiɛ, alɛ atasinta ɔlaa kpile wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ abɔyɔ anwako ma ni di suoto? Nfɛ buɔwa ɔlaa kpile siene owo ɔyɔ ɔwako di suoto loo!”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />(Semaia obisuɔtɔbi Uria wɔ niakye ni Kiriat-Yearim lale osuɔtɔ bamba wɔ niatoobuɛ sɛlaa aatɔɔtɛ ni di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ; aabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle okle aatɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ku kasɔ ka mmle suoto fɛ nse di Yeremia labuɛ nii. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Di Ɔka Yehoiakim ku kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ nɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lanu ni sɛlaa nɔɔ nwu yi, ɔka nwu latɛ alɛ abalo nwɔ. Kafɔɔ Uria lanu nwu ole ni aayɛkɛ aatoso aasifi Egipte nɛ. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Yehoiakim, lakpee Akbor obisuɔtɔbi Elnatan, diakyakaa ni ku basuɔtɔ bawo di Egipte nɛ. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Baalakpaa Uria baadieko di Egipte ni baayɔ nwɔ baakyɛnko Ɔka Yehoiakim wɔ niata baalo nwɔ ni ku kapamii, ni baafuki kpi nɔɔ baatɛ di batii ba ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa kakookaakɔ nɛ.)<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Diɛkyɛkaa ni yi, Safan obisuɔtɔbi Ahikam layila Yeremia kamaa, nioso batayɔ nwɔ bakpee di batii nwu nnɛɛ alɛ balo nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lakpee Simu Owoso Di Simu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia sɛka ole kasɔkakyekɔ yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle lakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ: “Bla simu owoso fakyeko sikũ ku sewoso, faayɔ nwu fakpee di simu lɛfɔ. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Faata Edom, Moab, Amon, Tiro ku Sidon baka kanya diefe ni di batii ba niɛwa ni Yuda ɔka Sedekia ɔkyɛ di Yerusalem suoto. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Ta ma kanya bakyɛnko basaate lɛma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Bitɔkɔ basaate lee ɔlaa wɔ mmle bilɛ: <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />Ku osie nii kplɛ ku kɔnɛɛ nii lɛnanfi layɔ labla kasɔ ku batii ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninsi ka ni di suoto, ni nin-yɔ ka nta otii lele niebuo mi anu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Nunua yi, kamayɔ nsɔ lɛfɔ mmuu nta kpɛmblatɛ nii Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar; kamata bia lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ nsiɛ nwɔ kaalɔ. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Nnle mmuu kamasumu nnwɔɔ ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku ɔwa-suɔtɔbi nɔɔ ninaase di obe wɔ di kasɔ nɔɔ obe kamawo ni; nse nnle kpinwu ku baka kplɛ ntɔɔbla nwɔ lampo lɛma.<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />“ ‘ “Kafɔɔ nse, kale kawo ee sɛkakalekɔ kawo lesĩ Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar osumu ee bawakosa suoto kasɔ di simu owoso nɔɔ nwu kalɔ yi, ni kamayɔ kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile nnanfi kale nwu kootoko, ninanse di obe wɔ kamawɔɔsa nwu ni ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Nioso bitankyɔɔ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lee, babɔmpɛtɛ lee, alaafɔ kasɔ badikitɛ lee, bakpi bakpatɛ lee ee asaabakaalɛtɛ lee ba nintɔkɔ ye ni alɛ, ‘Bilɔbasumu Babel ɔka nwu. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Sɛlaa ku afunu mambuɛ mantɛ manta ye, n-se nimatososa ye ni fanfa di nsɔ lee suoto; kamatososa ye minwɔɔ kafɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Kafɔɔ nse kale kawo kamakosa suoto nɔɔ kasɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar simu owoso kalɔ, ansumu nwɔ yi, ni kamata kale nwu nsiɛ di kasɔ nɔɔ kamu suoto, ankpɛ afe, ansiɛ nkpa kafɔɔ ninfa, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.” ’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Layɔ kanya nwu okle lata Yuda ɔka Sedekia. Ni labuɛ nlɛ, “Biwakosa suoto kasɔ biesiɛ di Babel ɔka simu owoso kalɔ; biesumu nwɔ ku batii nɔɔ, ni bibasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Obe oso di afɔ ku batii lɛfɔ biakpi di kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile kanya, ku asaa ya di SAATE nwu lafunaa ni kale lele ninamasumu ni Babel ɔka? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Bitankyɔɔ atoko di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nimbuɛ mantɔkɔ ye ni alɛ, ‘Bilɔbasumu ni Babel ɔka,’ diekye sɛlaa ku afunu boobuɛ mantɛ manta ye. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ. ‘Ninkpee ma.’ Boobuɛ sɛlaa ku afunu mantɛ di leyooto nii kamɛ. Nkpo oso, kamatososa ye minwɔɔ kafɔɔ, aye ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ, akyuu lee nwu anyɔ ba nimbuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ manta ye nii.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Ninfɛ latɔkɔ olebatatɛ ku batii ba mmle bamuu nlɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitankyɔɔ atoko di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nimbuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Dilɔbaklɛ babakplesa asaa ya baayɔ ni di SAATE nwu leyo mankyeko Babel manwako nii.’ Sɛlaa ku afunu boobuɛ mantɛ manta ye. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Bitankyɔɔ ma atoko. Bisumu Babel ɔka, ni bibasiɛ nkpa. Obe oso di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kaawɔɔ kunte? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Nse ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bale bakpe kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaa yi, ni ta ma batikiti SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni lekoto alɛ balaayɔ asaa ya niebu ate ni di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ ku Yuda ɔka lɛkayo kamɛ ku Yeruslem basifiko Babel. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ankyeko ni akpaka nwu, Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu, atikasaa ya mankyisa ni ku asaa bamba ya niebu ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />n-ya di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ditayɔ asifiko ni di obe wɔ aakpaa ni Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim obisuɔtɔbi Konia aadieko ni di Yerusalem aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel, diɛkyakaa ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem batii finle bamuu. <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />Nwaako, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ankyeko ni asaa ya niebu ate ni di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ ku Yuda ɔka lɛkayo kamɛ ku Yerusalem: <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />‘Babakpaa ma mansifiko Babel, nfa kafɔɔ babawɛ ninaase di dii le kamawa mmakpaa ma ni nɛ,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ. ‘Nse ntookplesa ma lɛwako lɛbasiɛsa di lɛba le mmle.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ku Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nɔnle kamɛ di lɛlɛɛ nwu nkpo kamɛ, di Yuda ɔka Sedekia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naafa kasɔkakyekɔ yi, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Asur obisuɔtɔbi Hanania wɔ niakye ni Gibeon, labuɛ aatɔkɔ mi di SAATE nwu leyo kamɛ di olebatatɛ ku batii nwu bamuu anu alɛ: <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamafee Babel ɔka simu owoso nwu. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Di alɛɛ anyɔ kamɛ yi, kamakplesa SAATE nwu leyo asaa ya amuu di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ladieko ni ninfũ aayɔ aasifiko ni Babel n-wako lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Kamakplesa kafɔɔ Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim obisuɔtɔbi Konia ku balanle bamba ba niakye ni Yuda, mba niasifi ni Babel n-wako lɛba le mmle, diekye kamafee Babel ɔka simu owoso nwu.’ ” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia ladiki ɔlaa wɔ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania labuɛ ni kanya di olebatatɛ ku batii ba bamuu niayila ni di SAATE nwu leyo anu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Diwa kaanya! SAATE nwu abla nkpo! SAATE nwu ata ɔlaa wɔ fatoobuɛ fɛɛtɛ ni diwa kaanya alɛ aakplesa SAATE nwu leyo asaa ku balanle nwu bamuu ankyeko Babel anwako lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Kafɔɔ yi, kyɔɔ atoko faanu ɔlaa wɔ kamabuɛ nkpee fɔ ni di atoko kamɛ ku batii nwu bamuu atoko kamɛ: <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nintoole ni afɔ ku ami katũ bɛɛbafe ni labuɛ kakpɛ ɔkpɛ, ɔlaa kpile otũ ku ofiɛ kpile sɛlaa baatɛ di nsɔ kpinwu ku sɛkanlekɔ kplɛ suoto. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Kafɔɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ nimbuɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole ɔlaa antɛ ni yi, babanyɔɔ fɛ nwaako otii wɔ di SAATE nwu lekpee nii, nse ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ nɔɔ nwu lɛwa kaanya.”<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Ninfɛ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania ladiki simu owoso nwu di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia simu aafefee nɛ, <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />ni aabuɛ di batii nwu bamuu anu alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nkpo okle kamafee Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar simu owoso nwu ndiki di nnle nwu mmuu simu di alɛɛ anyɔ kamɛ nɛ.’ ” Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia layefe osuku nɔɔ aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Di obe kakuu sɛmaa di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania lafee ni simu owoso nwu aadiki ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia simu yi, ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Tɔɔkyɛ faalaatɔkɔ Hanania falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Owoso simu owoso fatoofee, kafɔɔ lɛbɔɔsaa simu owoso fabawɛ di nwu nkpo kanya. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamayɔ lɛbɔɔsaa simu owoso nkpee di nnle be mmle mmuu simu, ninta ma mansumu Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar, babasumu nwɔ kafɔɔ. Kamatɔɔ osie bia di lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ suoto.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia latɔkɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania alɛ, “Hanania, kyɔɔ atoko! SAATE nwu diekpee fɔ, kafɔɔ fatɔɔkyɔnkyɔ kale ka mmle falɛ batika disi di sɛlaa ku afunu suoto. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nfɛ kɔwa fɔ ɔbadiki di kasɔ suoto. Fabakpi di lɛlɛɛ le mmle kamɛ, diekye feebuɛ ɔtaka oyila ɔlaa di SAATE nwu suoto.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hanania lakpi di lɛlɛɛ nwu kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Kukũ Ko Di Yeremia Lakpana Aakyesee Ni Yuda Batii Di Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Nnya sɛlaa se ninsi ni di kukũ ko di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia lakpana aakyeko ni Yerusalem akyesee ni banɔɔfo ba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa di balanle ku olebatatɛ, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku batii bule kamɛ. Mba bamuu di Nebukadnesar lakpaa aadieko ni di Yerusalem aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />(Aakpana kũ di obe wɔ di Ɔka Konia ku ɔkasanko, lɛkayo banɔɔfotii, Yuda ku Yerusalem batunletɛ, asaabowolatɛ ku nnɛɛ kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ ladie ni di Yerusalem baasifi ni sɛlanle kamɛ.) <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Aakyesee kukũ nwu aafenko di Safan obisuɔtɔbi Elasa ku Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi Gemaria suoto, mma di Yuda ɔka Sedekia lakpee Babel Ɔka Nebukadnesar nfũ nɛ. Kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa niale alɛ:<verse eid="JER 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni mba bamuu lakpaa lakyeko ni Yerusalem lasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel alɛ: <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />“Bitofo ayo biesiɛ nya kaamɛ; bibla kɔba biele alesaa ya biekpee ni. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Biyɔ basɔfɔ bielofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi; biyɔ basɔfɔ bita babisuɔtɔbi lee, biɛyɔ kafɔɔ babisankobi lee bita bayɔ, alɛ mma kafɔɔ baalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi. Bilɛɛsa di lɛpɔ kamɛ ninfa; bitanklɔklɔɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Diɛkyakaa ni yi, bimiɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku lɛlɛ bita okpoo kplɛ wɔ latuka ye lasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ. Bipɛ ɔlaa bita SAATE nwu bita okpoo nwu, diekye nse diɛlɛ diɛta nwu yi, aye kafɔɔ dibalɛ ninta ye.” <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Nwaako, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Bitanta ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku babɔmpɛtɛ ba ninsi ye ni kaamɛ lakyɔnkyɔ ye. Bitankyɔɔ atoko di alaafɔ ya minta ma mansɛ ni suoto. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Boobuɛ sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa mantɛ manta ye di leyooto nii kamɛ. Ninkpee ma,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Nse alɛɛ afosi-akuɛnsĩ ntooloo diɛta Babel yi, kamawa ɔkyɛ lee nimabla di onukwale wɔ labuɛ latɛ ni suoto nlɛ makplesa ye n-wako ni lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Diekye n-ye disibu le nkpe nta ye nii,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “lɛlɛ disibu dile dita ye, ninanle alɛ kabla ye ni dikpile, disibu dile alɛ kata ye osuku onyu ku dii kaamaa lɛlɛ. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Ni bibalɛɛ mi, min-wa mimapɛ ɔlaa mintɛɛ, ni ami kafɔɔ kamakyɔɔ ye atoko. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Bibawolaa mi, min-nyɛɛ kafɔɔ, nse biewolaa mi ku otu lee omuu. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Bibanyɛɛ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ, “kamakplesa ye kafɔɔ nkyeko sɛlanle kamɛ nwako. Kamasiisa ye nkyeko nnle nwu mmuu ku aba ya latososa ye lakpee ni n-wako,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ, “makplesa ye kafɔɔ n-wako lɛba le latuka ye lalakpee ni di sɛlanle kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Biafuo obuɛ bilɛ, “SAATE nwu ntoodiki ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ɛɛta wo di Babel,” <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />kafɔɔ nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni ɔka wɔ ninsi ni di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto ku batii ba bamuu niebu ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ, okpoo lee batii ba nitakyɛ ni sɛlanle kamɛ ku aye. <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />Nwaako, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Kamata kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile n-wa di suoto lɛma amabla ma fɛle abuɛ ya ninanlɛ ɛɛtɛ ɛɛlalaa ni anamalɛ ni ole. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Kamatikanko ma ku kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile, nimbla ma kafɔɔ diyududusaa nta sɛkanlekɔ nwu mmuu kaasɔ suoto ku lɛkpaanisaa ku lɛyɛkɛsaa, lɛmansaa ku ninusɔsaa di nnle be mmuu kamatososa ma nkpee ni kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Diekye batakyɔɔ sɛlaa nii atoko,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “sɛlaa se labuɛ lakple labuɛ lafenko ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ suoto. Ni di aye balanle nwu bitakyɔɔ atoko nɛ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Nkpo oso, aye balanle ba bamuu latososa ladiki ni di Yerusalem lasifiko ni Babel binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ankyeko ni Kolaia obisuɔtɔbi Ahab ku Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia suoto, mba nikobuɛ ni sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa mantɛ ye ni di leyooto nii kamɛ alɛ: “Kamayɔ ma nkpee di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar nnɛɛ, anlo ma di anu lee. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Ta mma oso yi, balanle ba bamuu niekye ni Yuda bakpe ni di Babel kamakpaani lɛkpaani le mmle alɛ: ‘SAATE nwu abla fɔ fɛle Sedekia ku Ahab okle, mba di Babel ɔka lafiɛ ni di ɔtɔ kamɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Diekye baabla abuusaa di Israel; batookpee asɔnɔ ku bawo lɛma basɔfɔ, baabuɛ kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa di leyooto nii kamɛ, di ami ntakpee ma nlɛ babla nii. N-ye nwu ole, nle kafɔɔ kamaayilatɛ lɛta nwu,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Semaia Kukũ Ko Aakpana Aakyesee Ni Sefania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Tɔkɔ Semaia, Nehelami otii nwu falɛ, <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Feekyesee akũ di afɔ omu leyooto kamɛ, fɛɛta batii bamuu di Yerusalem, fɛɛta oletatɛ Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi Sefania, ku olebatatɛ bule bamuu. Faatɔkɔ Sefania falɛ, <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />‘SAATE nwu ntoodiki fɔ alɛ le oletatɛ di Yehoiada kanya alɛ faayila di SAATE nwu leyo kanya; diki fiibuotɛ lele nimbla ni fɛle ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ fapɛ lekpo ku simu-abɔɔsaa fatɛ. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Ni, obe oso fatasĩ ɔlaa faata Yeremia wɔ niakye ni Anatot, nnwɔ niabla ni fɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ di kamɛ lee? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Diekye aata wo kanya ka mmle di Babel alɛ: Bibasiɛ di sɛlanle kamɛ minklɛ. Nkpo oso bitofo ayo biesiɛ kaamɛ; bibla kɔba biele alesaa ya biekpee ni.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Nioso oletatɛ Sefania laka kukũ nwu aata ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Yɔ kanya ka mmle fakyesee balanle nwu bamuu falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Semaia, Nehelami otii nwu suoto: Ta di Semaia labuɛ ɔlaa aatɛ aata ye ni, nu nintakpee nwɔ, aata ye biafũ sɛlaa ku afunu bianu ni oso yi, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nwaako kamananfi Semaia, Nehelami otii nwu ku banantii nɔɔ kootoko. Kuonwii dilɔbabu nwɔ di batii ba mmle kamɛ, ee anya asaa biene ya kamabla nta ni batii nii, SAATE nwu niebuɛ, ta aabuɛ ni ɔtaka oyila sɛlaa di suoto nii oso.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Labuɛ Aatɛ Alɛ Abaleko Batii Nɔɔ Katũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata ni Yeremia: <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kpana sɛlaa se simuu ntoobuɛ lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni fakpee di kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Obe kɔwa,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ, ‘Kamakpaa batii nii Israel ku Yuda nkyeko ni sɛlanle kamɛ n-wako ni, nin-se ma ni kafɔɔ lese di kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lɛma nlɛ bayɔ nii,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Nnya sɛlaa se di SAATE nwu labuɛ aakyeko ni Israel ku Yuda suoto: <verse eid="JER 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“ ‘Buonu lɛyɛkɛ kudú-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">ku difu, diele atoko ɔkyɛ ole.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Bikaalɛ bienyu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">Osuɔtɔ kamafuo ɔkɔɔsĩ anlofo babi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Ni obe oso kɔnya osuɔtɔ sientɛ biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">lɛyɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ eetika di kafutu nɔɔ fɛle osanko wɔ di lɛmɛ konu ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">di anu biala lepu ni fututu?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Obeeye! Dii nwu nkpe difu lo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Dii kuninwii dilɔbate fɛle nni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Dibuo obe dibale ninta Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">kafɔɔ babadiki nwɔ ninni kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />“ ‘Di dii nwu nkpo suoto yi,’ SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">‘Kamafee simu owoso nwu ndiki di simu lɛma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">nimbubudi kafɔɔ sikũ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">bafɔɔ dilɔbasin-yɔ ma babla balanle.<verse eid="JER 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Kafɔɔ, babasumu SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">ku ɔka lɛma Dawid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">nnwɔ kamadiki nta ma nii.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />“ ‘Nioso tanyɛkɛ, Ao kpɛmblatɛ nii Yakob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">Ao Israel, tanta nnɛɛ lafee fɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 30:10">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">‘Nwaako kamadiki fɔ nkyeko lɛba kyonle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ndiki banantii lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nkyeko sɛlanle lɛma kasɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yakob kamakple an-wɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole, andiki atoko ansiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbakpee nwɔ lɛyɛkɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Nsiko fɔ, kamadiki fɔ kafɔɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">‘Kuntɛ lawɔɔsa nnle be mmuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">lasamiisa ye lakpee ni klekle yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">namawɔɔsa fɔ klekle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Kamananfi fɔ kootoko, kafɔɔ di osuku kanya lete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">namata fɔ fasifi alɛ ninanfi fɔ kootoko saa.’<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“ ‘Kakɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninkpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">kakɔ ka ninankpi ni feefũ.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Kuonwii nnaa ababuɛ ɔlaa lɛfɔ anta fɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">kɔfa nnaa kuɔta ni kakɔ lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">difiɛyɔɔ nnaa diɛta fɔ.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Babɔmbɔtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu ntooyee fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">baayɔ nwu ole kuonwii di suoto lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">ntoodieko fɔ fɛ mmle di lo mbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">lananfi fɔ kafɔɔ kootoko fɛ mmle di amumublatɛ mbla ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">diekye lɛpɔɔ lɛfɔ okpi lɛtɛ dipɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">sikpile lɛfɔ kafɔɔ lɛtɛ sipɔ kpinwu.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Obe oso foowi di kakɔ lɛfɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">di dibuo lɛfɔ le ninaa ni difiɛyɔɔ suoto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Ta lɛpɔɔ lɛfɔ okpi lemuɔ ni, di sikpile lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mpɔ ni oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">lɛbla fɔ asaa ya mmle nɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ bababɛbɛɛ batii ba bamuu niabɛbɛɛ fɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">balo lɛfɔ bamuu kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Batii ba niafũ fɔ ni kakpɛ kamɛ asaa yi, babafũ mma a-le;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">batii ba bamuu niafũ fɔ ni asaa yi, babafũ mma kafɔɔ a-le.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Kafɔɔ kamayɔɔsa fɔ ofiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">ninta nkɔ lɛfɔ nkpi,’</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 30:17">SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘Diekye bɔɔlɛɛ fɔ alɛ otii wɔ beetososa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">Sion wɔ di kuonwii diɛyɔ nwu ni ole di suoto.’<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“ ‘Kamakple n-se Yakob leyo lɛlɛ ɔyɔ ɔtɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">n-nya kafɔɔ nsiɛkɔ nɔɔ nyaami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">babase okpoo kplɛ nwu dibudi di kawɔɔkɔ nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">lɛkayo nwu kafɔɔ kamayila di kayilakɔ biene nini suoto.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Sɛfa ɔpɛ sinu kamakye ɔkyɛ lɛma sinwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sɛlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Kamata ma mampɔ̀ mankyakaa di lɛpɔ̀ lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">blɔbaklɔklɔɛ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">kamata ma dibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">blɔbatɛ ma kaasɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Babi kamate fɛ mmle baate ni di saa obe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">okpoo lɛma kamayila kpinkpĩ di anu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">Kamananfi batii ba bamuu ninyinka ma ni kootoko.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Tunletɛ lɛma kamale mma bamu onwii lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">ɔka lɛma kamataka ankye kamɛ lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Kamata antɛɛtɛɛ mi, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ abakpukuti an-wa mi ɔkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">Diekye owe ninle nnwɔ nimayɔ suoto nɔɔ anta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">alɛ ɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ mi ni?’</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 30:21">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />“ ‘Nioso bibale batii nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lee.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Nyu lo, SAATE nwu afɛɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">kamakpɛ di ɔblɔ yakayaka kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">kakitikɔ kɔkpɛ kansoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">di bakpiletɛ asintɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />SAATE nwu lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka dilɔbakple sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">ninaase di obe wɔ eeloo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">otu nɔɔ dibiesaa ɔbla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Bibanu nle mmle kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">di ayi ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔpɛokple Ɔwa Kafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />“Di obe nwu kamɛ yi,” SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kamale Israel nfaabi nwu mmuu Yaa, mma kafɔɔ babale batii nii.”<verse eid="JER 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">“Batii ba niɛwɛ ni nkpa di kapamii nwu kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">kamawɛ sibualɛ di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">kamawa mmata Israel ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ.”<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />SAATE nwu ladiki suoto aatuo wo di obe wɔ nitɔbafe ni kamɛ, aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Labɔmbɔ fɔ ku lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">lananfi fɔ ku sifutulɛ lɛbɔmbɔ.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Ao Kakpeelebitɛɛ Israel, kamakple ntakatɛ fɔ n-se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">n-se fɔ kafɔɔ letofo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Fabakple fanyɔ akasa lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">fandie fankyɛ fanatũ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ banyatɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Fabakple fankpɛ nta awoso kofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">di Samaria akpenkpe nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">afe bakpɛntɛ kamasɔ nya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">manle kafɔɔ awosobi ninya.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Dii kɔwa di banyuntɛ kamalɛɛ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">di Efraim akpenkpe suoto alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Biwa, biɛta bukata bukyɛ Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">buɔkyɛ SAATE Yaa loo nwu nfũ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Nioso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Bisa sinu ku suoto lɛyɔɔ bita Yakob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">biɛfafaa bita nnle nwu banɔɔfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Bita banu katansa lee, biɛsa bilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Oo SAATE, diki batii lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Israel batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Nyu lo, kamakpaa ma nkyeko katookasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">nsiisa ma kafɔɔ nkyeko kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Anubabiɛtɛ ku abafa kamawɛ kaamɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">bamɛlakatɛ ku basanko ba di amɛ konu ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">batii ɔlambu dibinte kamapɛmankple man-wa.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Babawa ku kaku owi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">babapɛ ɔlaa di obe wɔ kamakplesa ma n-wako nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Kamaleko ma katũ nfenko di seklenyii ntu ɔlɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">di osuku wɔ niɛkyɛkyɛ ni suoto di lɛba le manamatuula nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">diekye ami ninle Israel kote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">Efraim kafɔɔ ninle obisuɔtɔbi nii kasale.<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />“Oo nnle, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">biyie lɛkya di lekpo nsɔ be ninte ni fanfa kamɛ bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">‘Nnwɔ niasamiisa ni Israel kamasiisa ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">abanyu kafɔɔ bafoso nɔɔ fɛle bafosokpatɛ.’<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Diekye SAATE nwu kamata koto anfũ Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">andiki ma kafɔɔ ankyeko batii ba nikpe osie balenke ma ni nnɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Babawa mamayiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu di Sion akpenkpe suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">man-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE nwu dibiene suoto-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">di alesaa, nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">afosobi ku anankyuebi suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Babate fɛle kɔba ko beekpete ni ntu nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">blɔbasin-wi kafɔɔ sɛnyaami diidii.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Ni bakpeele kamatũ mannya suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">suoto n-yɔɔ kafɔɔ bakosopo ku banɔɔfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Kamamunikĩisa kaku owi lɛma mbla suoto lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">Kamakpee ma kɔnɛɛ kaafutu nta ma kafɔɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ, diele sɛnyaami owi.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Kamata olebatatɛ n-le mammiɛ ku alesaa kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">batii nii kafɔɔ kamamiɛ ku asaa nii biene,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:14">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Nyaami Ɔnya Di Israel Batii Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">“Sɛlɔ sinwii kodie di Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">sɛnyaami ku kaku owi osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Rahel kowi anta babi nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">oosĩ kafɔɔ alɛ batankpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">ta di babi nɔɔ nsinaa ni oso.”<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Diɛ kaku owi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">di anu lɛfɔ adiɛ nnumɛɛ osoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">diekye fabafũ ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ letota,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:16">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">“Babapɛmankple di balo nwu kasɔ man-wa.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Nioso osuku onyu nkpe diɛta dii kaamaa lee,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:17">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">“Babi lɛfɔ kamapɛmankple man-wa mma bamu kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Nwaako ntoonu Efraim dituuni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">‘Faananfi mi fɛle lɛnankyuebi le manananfi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">ni ntɔɔwɛ lɛnanfi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Kplesa mi fawako, ni kamapɛnkple,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">diekye afɔ ninle SAATE Yaa nii nɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Diekye di osuku nii oyu sɛmaa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">lakyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">labanu ni kasɔ sɛmaa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">lafuusa kɔnɛɛ di ntɛɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi, lanunsu kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">diekye sekosopo nii obe sinunsɔ ntika mi di suoto.’<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />Diele obisuɔtɔbi nii bɔmbɔtɛ ninle Efraim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">obi wɔ suoto ninnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Kuntɛ nkakatɛ n-yila di suoto nɔɔ obelele yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">nkple nnyuma nwɔ nwaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Nkpo oso otu nii nwolaa nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">nkpe sifutulɛ kplɛ lɛtɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:20">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />“Yɔ osuku nsũ atɛsaa fatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">faatɛ nsũ atɛsaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Tɛ osuku kplɛ nsũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">osuku wɔ suoto fankyɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Oo Kakpeelebitɛɛ Israel, pɛfakple,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">pɛfakple fawa sekpoo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Oo obisankobi wɔ ninaa ni onukwale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">ɔmɛmbe fabakyɛ fankyi fanaase?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">SAATE nwu kamabla lɛsaa fɔle kaasɔ suoto-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">ɔsanko kamakpɛ̀ di osuɔtɔ disi.”<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Batii Diikaamaa Lɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Nse lekplesa ma lekyeko sɛlanle kamɛ lɛwako yi, batii ba ninsi ni di Yuda kasɔ ku sekpoo nisĩ kamɛ makple mambuɛ sɛlaa se mmle alɛ: ‘Oo kasiɛkɔ tinini, Oo kobokote klekle, SAATE nwu awii ye lɛtɔtrɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Batii nwu kamasi mansiɛ di Yuda ku sekpoo nwu simuu kamɛ- bafekpɛntɛ ku mba ninkyɛ mankyi ni ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Kamakpee mba diobuo ni osie fɔle nta mba kafɔɔ nikokpi ni kɔka n-le mammiɛ.”<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Nle mmle kanya lataka di sɛkyɔsĩ kamɛ, lanyunyuu lafenko nɛ. Sɛkyɔsĩ nii lalɛ mi ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Nyu lo, obe kɔwa, kamata batii babi ku babɔkɛɛ abi nlɛɛsa ni di Israel batii ku Yuda batii kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Fɛ mmle okle lanyu ma baapɔ ma kaasɔ, baabɛbɛɛ ma baatɛ ni, baatakatɛ ma baayu ni, baawɔɔsa ma ninta kafɔɔ sɛlaa ntũ ma ni yi, nkpo kamanyu nintofo ma, ninta man-yila kafɔɔ nɛ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />“Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, batii dilɔbasimbuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">“ ‘Babibate niele awosobi ya niɛkplakpla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">kafɔɔ babi anyɛɛ niɛkplakpla.’<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Kafɔɔ yi, otii biala kamakpi di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ sikpile suoto; otii lele niele awosobi ya niɛkplakpla ni yi- nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ anyɛɛ nimakplakpla nɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Obe kɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">kamabla ni kanya ninii fɔle</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:31">ku Israel batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">ku Yuda batii.<verse eid="JER 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Klɔbate fɛle kanya ninii ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">labla ni ku bawa lɛma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">di obe wɔ lakpaa ma ni ku kɔnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">laleko ma katũ ladieko ni di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">ta baalalaasa ni kanya ninii nii nwu so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">nu lale kɔsa lata ma,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:32">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />“Nnya kanya ninii ka kamanii ni ku Israel batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">di obe nwu sɛmaa,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">“Kamayɔ kufiofa nii nkpee di asibu lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">nkpana nwu kafɔɔ ntika di situ lɛma suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">Kamale Yaa lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">mma kafɔɔ babale batii nii.<verse eid="JER 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Otii kuonwii dilɔbasintuo owo nɔɔ asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">ee otii atuo obilɛma-suɔtɔbi asaa, abuɛ alɛ, ‘Tofo SAATE nwu,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">diekye bamuu lɛma babatofo mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">diɛyɔ ni di obisɔ diɛlaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:34">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">“Diekye kamayɔ akpilesaa lɛma ɔbla nkyɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">nɔmasinyuma kafɔɔ sikpile lɛma.”<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">nnwɔ ninta ni kufĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">alɛ kupɛ ni di kakũ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">anta ni kɔwɛntɛ ku awɛntrɛbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">alɛ akpa ni di kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">nnwɔ ninmbakaa ni lekpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">di mmle di afɛɛfɔ nɔɔ kapɛ amunikĩi nii-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">leyooto nɔɔ ninle SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni nɛ:<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">“Diediki sɛlaa se mmle lɛyɛ di anu nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">di Israel banantii dilɔbasinle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">kale di anu nii nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">“Nse babafuo osi kaatoo ɔklapoosa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">babafuo kafɔɔ kasɔ asɔse nwu di kalɔ owolaa odiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">ni kamasĩ Israel banantii bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">ta asaa ya amuu batɔɔbla ni oso,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 31:37">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “Obe kɔwa, babase ni okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle dibudi ɔtɛɛ, diɛyɔ ni di Hananel leyo Takale nwu diɛlaadu ni di Leyokɔ Kayoko nwu kanya. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Babatika lɛklapoosaa okũ diɛyɔ ni ninfa tininini diesifi ni Gareb lekpenkpe, nimmunikĩi ninsifi Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Ɔtaata nwu omuu di lɛba le mankookaa ni bakpi man-wii ni kafɔɔ ntɔ̀, ku afe nwu amuu di Kidron Ɔtaata di kufĩkatunkɔ diɛlaadu ni Pɔnkɔ Kayoko nwu leyokɔ suoto kamaklekle ninta SAATE nwu. Blɔbasinlalaasa okpoo kplɛ nwu ee babiɛ nwu diidii.”<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Laya Kofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuawa kuata ni Yeremia di Yuda ɔka Sedekia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ fosile kamɛ, diale ni kafɔɔ Nebukadnesar sɛka ole lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, Babel ɔka bakpɛtɛ latoodieko Yerusalem kakpɛ, baasɛɛ kafɔɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia baakpee di banyuntɛ leyo di Yuda lɛkayo kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Diekye Yuda ɔka Sedekia latɛ nwɔ di leyo katenkɔ ninfa aabuɛ alɛ, “Obe oso foobuɛ ɔlaa fantɛ fɛ mmle fɔɔbla ni? Faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔmayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nkpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ, ni abafũ nwu. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Yuda ɔka Sedekia dilɔbatoso adie di Babel batii nnɛɛ, kafɔɔ nwaako babayɔ nwɔ mankpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ, ankakatɛko nwɔ anu ku anu an-nyɔɔ kafɔɔ ku nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ anu. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Abakpaa Sedekia ansifiko Babel, di lɛba le abasiɛ ni ninaase ni di obe wɔ kamablako nwɔ suoto ɔkpɛ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Nse fɛɛkpɛko Babel batii, flɔba lelenkee.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Ni di Yeremia labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />Nyu lo, teefɔ bisɔnle Salum obisuɔtɔbi Hanamel kamawa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ amabuɛ alɛ, ‘Ya kofe nii ko ninte ni di Anatot, diekye afɔ ninkpe osuku, ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ kule fɛ ɔnantii tintĩ alɛ faaya kũ nɛ.’<verse eid="JER 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />“Nioso, fɛ mmle okle di SAATE nwu ntoobuɛ ni yi, teemi bisɔnle obisuɔtɔbi Hanamel lawa ɔkyɛ nii di banyuntɛ nwu kaflɔnkɔ ni aababuɛ alɛ, ‘Fũ kofe nii nwu di Anatot di Benyami kasɔ suoto faya. Diekye afɔ ninkpe osuku fanfũ kũ kunle fɔ kafɔɔ kole, ya kũ fata suoto lɛfɔ.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">“Latofo nlɛ SAATE nwu ɔlaa kuale; <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />nioso laya kafe nwu di Anatot di teemi bisɔnle obisuɔtɔbi Hanamel ɔkyɛ, ni lakadi koto fututu lefosi-akuɛnsĩ latɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Ni lakpana lakpee di kukũ kamɛ, lakpee kɔnɛɛ kaalɔ, ni latĩi kũ kanya nɛ. Lamiɛ otii layila kũ kamaa, ni lakadi koto fututu nwu di akadiisaa suoto nɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Layɔ kofe ɔya kukũ nwu- nko baase ni lɛkpana baatĩi ni kanya di sɛlaa ku ablasaa ninwu nsi nii, diakyakaa ni di nko batatĩi ni kanya- <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />ni layɔ kukũ ko mmle lata Baruk wɔ niale ni Maaseia ɔwa, di ote niale ni Neria, di teemi bisɔnle obisuɔtɔbi Hanamel ku kamaabayilatɛ ba niakpee ni kɔnɛɛ di kukũ nwu ku Yuda batii ba bamuu niasiɛ ni di banyuntɛ nwu kaflɔnkɔ anu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />“Ni latɔkɔ Baruk sɛlaa se mmle di anu lɛma nlɛ: <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Yɔ akũ nwu, kofe ɔya akũ nwu beetĩi ni kanya ku n-ya manantĩi ni kanya akyuu nwu anyɔ, fakpee di kɔtɛ dibukii kamɛ di mmle aate anklɛ ni. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Babakple man-ya ayo, afe ku nta awosobi afe di kasɔ ka mmle suoto.’<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />“Layɔ kofe ɔya kukũ nwu lata ni Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk sɛmaa yi, lapɛ ɔlaa lata SAATE nwu nlɛ:<verse eid="JER 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Ao, SAATE Kplɛ, afɔ niabla osi ku kasɔ di osie kplɛ ku kɔnɛɛ siene lɛfɔ ko faananfi nii. Lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii ɔbla nnaa osie diɛta fɔ. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Faandiki lɛbɔmbɔ fantuo batii nkpe, kafɔɔ fan-yɔ babibate sikpile letoko-nanfi fanwako di babi lɛma ba di sɛmaa lɛma suoto. Oo Yaa kplɛ ku sientɛ, nnwɔ leyooto ninle ni SAATE wɔ Nilenke ni. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />Disibu lɛfɔ lewo, sɛsaabla lɛfɔ kafɔɔ lemuɔ. Anumbi lɛfɔ letikiti ate ɔɔnya batii bamuu sisuku; fanta otii biala letota di nkpa nɔɔ disiɛbi kanya ku mmle di sɛsaabla nɔɔ lesiɛko nii. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Faabla atuosaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ku anyasaa di Egipte, ni fakle nya fɔɔbla ɔbla diɛbase di miɛ dii le mmle, di Israel ku batii bamuu kamɛ, ni fatoofũ leyooto le niekple dile fɔ ni lele nɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Faakpaa batii lɛfɔ Israel faadieko di Egipte ku atuosaa ku asaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ, di kɔnɛɛ siene ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi ku difu kplɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Ni faayɔ kasɔ ka mmle faaka ntam falɛ fabayɔ fanta ni bawa lɛma faata ma nɛ, kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe nii. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Baawa baabayɔ kasɔ nwu kaakple ma kale, kafɔɔ batanu fɔ ɔlaa ee batikanko kufiofa lɛfɔ; batabla lɛsaa le faata ma kufiofa falɛ babla nii. Nioso faayɔ sɛlaa kpile otũ se mmle simuu faawako ma di suoto.<verse eid="JER 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />“Nyu mmle bɛɛpɛ atii bɛɛtɛ alɛ boofũ ni okpoo kplɛ nwu. Ta kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile nwu oso yi, babayɔ okpoo kplɛ nwu mankpee di Babel batii ba nikodieko nwu ni nnɛɛ. Ɔlaa wɔ faabuɛ ni ntɔɔwa kaanya, fɛ mmle fɔɔnya ni nunua. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Kuntɛ babayɔ okpoo kplɛ nwu mankpee di Babel batii nnɛɛ yi, afɔ, Oo SAATE Kplɛ, fɛɛtɔkɔ mi falɛ, ‘Ya kofe nwu ku koto fututu, faata kafɔɔ kamaabayilatɛ bawɛ di ɔsaabla nwu kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Ami ninle SAATE nwu, batii bamuu Yaa nɛ. Lɛsaa lewo nkpe mi osie ku ɔbla? <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kamayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ɔbayɔ okpee di Babel batii ku ɔka Nebukadnesar ba nimafũ nwu ni nnɛɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Babel batii ba nikodieko ni okpoo wɔ mmle kamawa mamakpee nwu ɔtɔ; babafiɛ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ. Diɛkyakaa ni di ayo ya di batii nwu lakpee mi ɔblɔ yakayaka, baafiɛ ni olufuii di akyá osi baata ni Baal ku nta kasɔ okpete ɔta bayaa bamba.<verse eid="JER 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />“Israel batii ku Yuda batii labla okpile di anu nii diɛyɔ ni di sekosopo lɛma obe; nwaako, Israel batii ditabla lɛsaa biene kafɔɔ beekpee mi ɔblɔ ku asaa ya di nnɛɛ lɛma labla nii, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Diayɔ ni di dii le baabudi nwu ni diɛbadu ni nua, okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ntɔɔta ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii lɛtaka dikpeni alɛ lediki nwu ni di anu nii. <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Israel ku Yuda batii ntookpee mi ɔblɔ di akpilesaa ya amuu batɔɔbla nii- mma, baka ku banɔɔfotii lɛma, olebatatɛ ku ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lɛma, Yuda batii ku Yerusalem batii. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Sɛmaa lɛma baamunikĩisa baatɛɛ diele anu lɛma; nu latuo ma asaa lakple latuo ma yi, batakyɔɔ atoko ee bafũ lɛnanfi. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Baayɔ afiɔ lɛma ya nikɔkpɛ ni oyududu baatɛ di leyo le manlɛɛ ni Leyooto nii baakpɔnɔfɔsa ni. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Baatofo ntakalekɔ baata Baal di Ben-Hinom Ɔtaata alɛ bɔɔyɔ babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ku babisankobi lɛma manta ole manta Molek, nu di diidii ntabuɛ, ee diwa di disibu nii, alɛ baabla diyududusaa le mmle ninta Yuda mbla okpile.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osuku Onyu Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Ɔta Israel Ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />“Biobuɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle suoto bilɛ, ‘Babayɔ nwu mankpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ di kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile kanya’; kafɔɔ nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Nwaako kamasiisa ma nkyeko nsɔ nwu mmuu suoto, di lɛba le latososa ma lakpee ni di lɛblɔfiɛ ku ɔblɔ yakayaka kplɛ nii kamɛ; kamakplesa ma n-wako lɛba le mmle, ninta ma mansiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Babale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lɛma. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Kamata ma otu ku disibu ninwii, di mmle babayɛkɛ mi ni obe lele, ninta ni mma bamu ku babi lɛma di sɛmaa lɛma dibiene. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Kamabla kanya ninii ka ninaa ni kaloo ku mma: Namadiɛ dibiene ɔbla ɔta ma diidii, kamakpee ma kafɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ alɛ baayɛkɛ mi, alɛ balaakple nkpaamaa di suoto nii diidii. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di dibiene ɔbla ɔta ma kamɛ, nwaako kamatɛ ma di kasɔ ka mmle suoto ku otu ku ɔkla nii omuu.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Fɛ mmle ntɔɔyɔ sɛlaa kpile otũ se mmle lɛwako ni di batii ba mmle suoto yi, nkpo kamata ma lɛlɛ le nimuu labuɛ latɛ lata ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Babakple man-ya afe di kasɔ ka mmle mimbuɛ ni bilɛ, ‘Kɛɛlalaa kate ni, di batii ee babɔkɛɛ diesi ka ni di suoto, diekye batɔɔyɔ ka beekpee di Babel batii nnɛɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Babaya afe ku koto fututu, mankpee kɔnɛɛ di ablasaa nwu, mantĩi kanya, man-wɛ kafɔɔ kamaabayilatɛ manta di Benyami kasɔ, di sekpoenyii se niɛmana ni Yerusalem siekyi ni, di Yuda sekpoo ku akpenkpe sekpoo nwu kamɛ, di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku kalakasɔ, diekye kamakplesa lɛlɛ lɛma nta ma, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Osuku Onyu Bamba Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Ɔta Israel Ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia lɛnyɔɔfa di obe wɔ aawɛ ni ɔwɛ di leyo kantenkɔ nwu di banyuntɛ kaflɔnkɔ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ, nnwɔ niɛbla ni kasɔ, SAATE wɔ niabla ka ni aatɛ ka ni kafɔɔ- SAATE nwu ninle nwɔ leyooto: <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />‘Lɛɛ mi, kamatũna nta fɔ kafɔɔ, nintɔkɔ fɔ sɛlaa kplɛ ku asaa ya niewofa fanan-ye ni kafɔɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, kobuɛ ankyeko ni ayo ya ninkpe ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ku Yuda akayo ya baabiɛ baatɛ ni kaasɔ alɛ bɔɔyɔ mandieko ni atii ya bɛɛpɛ ni ku kapamii <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />di Babel batii ɔkpɛko kamɛ: ‘Ayo nwu kamayii ku batii ba kamalo ni bakpi di ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii kamɛ. Kamawofasa anu nii di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle suoto ta asiensiesaa lɛma amuu ɔbla oso.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />“ ‘Akpakpa dite yi, kamayɔ suoto osie ku difiɛyɔɔ n-wako nwu; kamayɔɔsa batii nii sifiɛ nta ma kafɔɔ atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku kɔba lekpee kpinwu. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Kamakplesa Yuda ku Israel nkyeko sɛlanle kamɛ n-wako, n-se ma lese fɛ mmle baate ni saa. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Kamafoto sikpile simuu se baabla mi ni ndiki di suoto lɛma, nin-yɔ kafɔɔ otokopĩ sikpile lɛma simuu baabla ni di suoto nii nkyɛ ma. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Ni okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamawako mi leyooto biene, suoto lɛyɔɔ, katansa ku dibu di nnle mmuu anu kaasɔ suoto, nse beenu asaa biene ya amuu lɛbla lɛta nwu nii; dibabla ma ɔkpɛ mantũtũkũ kafɔɔ di lɛlɛ kpinwu ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole wɔ lɛta nwu ni oso.’<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Mimbuɛ di lɛba le mmle suoto bilɛ, “Kɛɛlalaa kate, di batii ee babɔkɛɛ diesi ka ni di suoto.” Kafɔɔ di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka ya beediɛ bɛɛtɛ ni, di batii ee babɔkɛɛ diesi ni yi, nfa babakple mannu <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ kudú, ɔkafɔɔ ku ɔkafɔɔsa sɛlɔ, ku mba nin-yɔ sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta man-wako ni SAATE nwu leyo mambuɛ ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">“ ‘ “Bipɛ SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">diekye SAATE nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Diekye kamakplesa lɛlɛ nta kasɔ nwu fɛ mmle kaate ni saa,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Alesaa kaweekɔ kamakple kan-wɛ kanta babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ ninta babɔkɛɛ lɛma ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di okpoo nwu omuu, di lɛba le mmle ninte ni kafukuti di batii ee babɔkɛɛ diesi nii. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Di akpenkpe nwu nsɔ sekpoo kamɛ, di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku kalakasɔ, di Benyamin kasɔ suoto, di sekpoenyii se niɛmana Yerusalem ku Yuda sekpoo siekyi ni yi, babɔkɛɛ kamakple manfe di otii wɔ ninka ma ni kɔnɛɛ kalɔ,’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, “ ‘Nyu lo, obe kɔwa, kamabla ni di nyaami ɔnya ntam be labla lata ni Israel batii ku Yuda batii.<verse eid="JER 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />“ ‘Di ayi nwu ku obe nwu kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">kamata Ɔla tinini ntaa kunkye Dawid kɔna kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">ababla lɛsaa le niesiɛko ni ku nle ninlɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, Yuda kamawɛ didiki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">Yerusalem kafɔɔ kamasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Nnya leyooto le babalɛɛ nwu ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">SAATE nwu Ɔsaabla Tinini Loo.’<verse eid="JER 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Dilɔbawa diidii alɛ Dawid diɛwɛ otii aasiɛ ni di Israel batii lɛkakpomii suoto, <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />ee diwa diidii alɛ, olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii diɛwɛ otii aayila ni obe biala anta ni ofiɛ asaaɔta, anfiɛ ni alesaa asaaɔta, anta ni kafɔɔ seleɔta.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nse fabafuo kanya ninii nii ka labla ni munko kakũ ofukuti, ku kanya ninii nii ka labla ni munko kakyɛ ofukuti, alɛ kakũ ku kakyɛ dilasinwa di obe ninya kamɛ yi, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />ni nse kanya ninii nii ka labla ni ku kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid- ku kanya ninii nii ka labla ni ku Lewi batii ba ninle ni olebatatɛ ba nimbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ di anu nii- kafuo ofukuti, ni Dawid dilɔbasinwɛ ɔnantii ale sɛka di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Kamabla Dawid banantii bakpɛmblatɛ nii, mbla kafɔɔ Lewi batii ba nimbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ di anu nii mampɔ fɛ kolo awɛntrɛbi ya manaafuo ni ɔka, fɛ ɔtɛnsĩa di lekpo kotoko manaafuo ni ɔklapoosa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Faditɛ nsũ fatofo falɛ batii ba mmle kobuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu ntoosĩ sɛkanlekɔ be nnyɔ aadiki ni’? Nioso mannyu batii nii nyakatãa, blosimbu ma kafɔɔ fɛ kale. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nse ntambla kanya ninii nii di kakũ ku kakyɛ, ntɛ kafɔɔ osi ku kasɔ afiofa yi, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />nse ntabasĩ Yakob banantii ku kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid, ntaadiki kafɔɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ onwii lɛma alɛ aale sɛka di Abraham, Isak ku Yakob banantii suoto. Diekye kamakplesa lɛlɛ lɛma nta ma nnya ma kafɔɔ nyaami.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ka Niawa Kaata Ni Sedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Obe wɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ku sɛkanlekɔ nwu mmuu ku batii ba suoto oole ni sɛka di kale nwu kamɛ latɔɔkpɛko ni Yerusalem ku sekpoo se simuu niɛmana nwu siekyi ni yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle lakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: Tɔɔkyɛ Yuda ɔka Sedekia nfũ faalaatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔbayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nkpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ, abafiɛ nwu antɛ kaasɔ. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Flɔbadie nwɔ ninnɛɛ, kafɔɔ nwaako babamufũ fɔ man-yɔ fɔ mankpee nwɔ ninnɛɛ. Fabanya Babel ɔka nwu ku afɔ omu lɛfɔ anumbi, ankakatɛko fɔ anu ku anu. Ni fabasifi Babel.<verse eid="JER 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />“ ‘Oo Yuda ɔka Sedekia, kafɔɔ nu ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ antɛ anta fɔ ni. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni suoto lɛfɔ alɛ: Flɔbakpi di kapamii kanya; <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />fabakpi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Fɛ mmle di batii nsafɔ ni otutuo di lɛkpaka mambla kaku manta ni bawa lɛfɔ dibu, baka ba nitosiɛ bɛɛbafe ni fiɛ di afɔ yi, nkpo babasafɔ otutuo manta fɔ dibu man-wi kaku alɛ, “Ao, Oo saate!” Ami omu nii niebuɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle letika difuɔ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia labuɛ sɛlaa se mmle simuu aatɔkɔ Yuda ɔka Sedekia, di Yerusalem nɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />di obe wɔ di Babel ɔka bakpɛtɛ latɔɔkpɛko ni Yerusalem ku Yuda sekpoo kplɛ bamba- Lakis ku Aseka. Nse mmle niale sekpoo kplɛ siene se lete niabu ni di Yuda nɛ.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakyɔnkyɔ Ablasaa Di Balanle Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Ɔlaa nwu lakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata Yeremia di obe wɔ di Ɔka Sedekia labla ni kanya ninii ku batii nwu bamuu di Yerusalem alɛ bayie lɛkya bata ni balanle suoto osiɛko sɛmaa alɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />otii biala adiɛ ni ɔlanle nɔɔ wɔ ninle ni Hebri otii, basuɔtɔ ku basanko akyuu nwu anyɔ; kuonwii atanta Yuda otii wo nɔɔ lasiɛ di ninii kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Nioso banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu ku batii ba niabla ni kanya ninii ka mmle latuna alɛ babadiɛ basuɔtɔ ku basanko balanle lɛma alɛ blasinta ma basiɛ di ninii kamɛ. Baatuna, ni baadiɛ ma nɛ. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Kafɔɔ sɛmaa yi, baamunikĩisa asibu lɛma, ni baakple baafũ balanle ba baadiɛ ni baakplesa ma baabla balanle nɛ.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: Labla kanya ninii ku bawa lee di obe wɔ lakpaa ma ladieko ni di Egipte, di sɛlanle kasɔ nwu suoto. Labuɛ nlɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />‘Dikpeni mindiɛ Hebri otii wo lee lele wɔ niasunsũ suoto nɔɔ aata ye ni di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ biala sɛmaa. Di alɛɛ akuɔ sɛmaa, atɔɔbla ɔkpɛ ɛɛta fɔ ni yi, dikpeni fandiɛ nwɔ ansifi.’ Kafɔɔ bawa lee, ditanu ee bakyɔɔ mi atoko. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Kɔsanklo ko mmle biakyisa nkpa biabla lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni di anu nii: Obiala lee layie suoto osiɛko lɛkya aata okpoo nɔɔ batii. Biabla bia kanya ninii di anu nii di leyo le manlɛɛ ni Leyooto nii. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Kafɔɔ kanunua, bitookyi biɛkpɔnɔfɔsa leyooto nii; obiala lee ntookple ɛɛkpaa basuɔtɔ ku basanko balanle ba biadiɛ bilɛ basifi ni kakɔ lele boomiɛ nii. Bitoonyinka ma bilɛ bakple bale ye balanle.<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />“Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitakyɔɔ mi atoko; bitayie lɛkya di suoto osiɛko bita okpoo lee batii. Nioso nfɛ koyie ‘suoto osiɛko’ lɛkya nta ye, SAATE nwu niebuɛ- ‘suoto osiɛko’ alɛ bianɔɔ di kapamii, ofiɛ kpile ku kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya. Kamabla ye diyududusaa nta sɛkanlekɔ nwu mmuu kaasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Batii ba niafukuti ni kanya ninii nii nwu batabla ni kafɔɔ di kanya ninii ka baabla ni di anu nii sɛlaa kanya yi, kamabla ma fɛ mmle mambudi ni lɛnankyuebi di akyuu anyɔ, mankyɛ manfe ni di nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ obo. <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />Yuda ku Yerusalem batunletɛ, kaflɔnkɔ nwu banɔɔfotii, olebatatɛ ku kasɔ nwu batii bamuu ba ninkyɛ ni di lɛnankyuebi nwu nkyɛ obo yi, <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />kamayɔ ma nkpee di balo lɛma ba nikomiɛ ni kukpi lɛma nnɛɛ. Bakpi lɛma kamakple alesaa anta bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ di kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />“Kamayɔ Yuda ɔka Sedekia ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nkpee di balo lɛma ba nikomiɛ ni kukpi lɛma, ku Babel ɔka bakpɛtɛ ba nitookple ni nkpaamaa di suoto lee nnɛɛ. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nyu lo, kɔwa kanya ɔbadiki, ninkplesa ma n-wako okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ. Babakpɛko nwu, manfũ nwu, manfiɛ mantɛ kaasɔ. Kamata kafɔɔ Yuda sekpoo nwu nlalaa sinte alɛ otii kuonwii dilaafuo osiɛ ninfa.”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ku Rekab batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ niakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata ni Yeremia di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka olebee kamɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Kyɛ faalalɛɛ Rekab leyo kamɛ batii, baawa di kayoee kanwii kamɛ di SAATE nwu leyo, faata ma nta banyi.”<verse eid="JER 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Nioso lakyɛ lalaakpaa Yeremia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeremia bamba di nnwɔ mmle nle</char></note> obisuɔtɔbi Yaasania, aale ni Habasinia obisuɔtɔbi, ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bamuu- ku Rekab leyo kamɛ batii bamuu. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Ni lakpaa ma lawako SAATE nwu leyo, lalaakpee ma di Yikdalia obisuɔtɔbi Hanan, Yaa otii nwu babisuɔtɔbi kayoee kamɛ nɛ. Diakaako banɔɔfotii nwu kayoee ka niatika ni di Salum obisuɔtɔbi Maaseia wɔ niale ni kayoko nyuntɛ leyo osi. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Ninfɛ layɔ abukii ya di nta layii ni ku sipũ sewo lase di Rekab leyo kamɛ batii nwu anu, ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Binyi nta n-wo.”<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Kafɔɔ baadiki kanya alɛ, “Munnyi nta, diekye ɔwa loo Rekab obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab lakpee wo kufiofa ko mmle alɛ: ‘Aye ee banantii lee batannyi nta diidii. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Diidii bitantofo kafɔɔ ayo, biakpee alesaa ee bikpɛ nta awosobi kofe; diidii bitan-wɛ asaa ya mmle kuninwii lɛma, kafɔɔ dikpeni biesiɛ di akpaayo kamɛ obe biala. Ni bibasiɛ nkpa minklɛ di kasɔ ka suoto bile ni bafɔɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Buɔbla di ɔlaa biala wɔ di ɔwa loo Rekab obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab lakpee wo ni kufiofa suoto. Awo ee basɔfɔ loo ee babisuɔtɔbi loo ee babisankobi loo diinyi nta diidii, <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />ee butofo ayo busiɛ kaamɛ ee bukpɛ nta awosobi afe, afe ee bukpɛ alesaa diidii. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Akpaayo kamɛ butoosiɛ, buɔbla kafɔɔ di ɔlaa biala wɔ di ɔwa loo Yonadab lakpee wo ni kufiofa suoto. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Kafɔɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ladieko ni kasɔ ka mmle kakpɛ yi, buabuɛ bulɛ, ‘Biwa, dikpeni buotoso buodie di Babel batii ku Siria batii bakpɛtɛ nnɛɛ buosifi Yerusalem.’ Nioso butɔɔka busi di Yerusalem nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Tɔɔkyɛ faalaakaalɛ Yuda batii ku Yerusalem batii falɛ, ‘Bilootekete lɛsaa, biɛkyɔɔ kafɔɔ sɛlaa nii atoko?’ SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />‘Rekab obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab lakpee batii nɔɔ kufiofa alɛ batannyi nta, beemufũ kufiofa ko mmle beeklee kafɔɔ. Diɛbadu ni di miɛ dii le mmle mannyi nta, diekye baamufũ ɔwa lɛma kufiofa nwu baaklee. Kafɔɔ ntɔɔkakatɛ lɛta ye, lekple lɛkakatɛ lɛta ye, kafɔɔ bitanu mi ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Obe kpinwu lakpee bakpɛmblatɛ nii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu ɔkyɛ lee baababuɛ alɛ, “Dikpeni obiala lee lekyi di amumu sisuku nɔɔ suoto, biese kafɔɔ sɛsaabla lee lɛbla; bitantikanko bayaa bamba biasumu ma. Ni bibasiɛ di kasɔ ka layɔ lata ye ni ku bawa lee.” Kafɔɔ bitakyɔɔ atoko ee binu mi ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Rekab obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab banantii laklee kufiofa ko di ɔwa lɛma lakpee ma nii, kafɔɔ batii ba mmle dienu mi ɔlaa.’<verse eid="JER 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />“Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Bikyɔɔ atoko! Kamayɔ sɛlaa kpile otũ se simuu labuɛ latika ma ni di suoto n-wako di Yuda ku batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Yerusalem. Lakakatɛ lata ma, kafɔɔ batakyɔɔ atoko; lalɛɛ ma, kafɔɔ batatuna.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Ni di Yeremia latɔkɔ Rekab leyo kamɛ batii alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Biɛkyɔɔ ɔwa lee Yonadab kufiofa atoko, bietikanko kafɔɔ sɛlaa nɔɔ simuu, biɛbla kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le aatɔkɔ ye nii.’ <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Dilɔbawa diidii alɛ Rekab obisuɔtɔbi Yonadab dilaawɛ otii alɛ aabla mi ɔkpɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Baruk Laka Kukũ Nwu Di Olekatakɔ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim wɔ niale ni Yosia obisuɔtɔbi sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle lakye SAATE nwu nfũ kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Yɔ kukũ faakpana sɛlaa se simuu latɔkɔ fɔ lakyeko ni Israel, Yuda ku nnle bamba mmuu suoto fakpee kaamɛ, diayɔ ni di obe wɔ lakyekasɔ latɔɔkakatɛ latɔɔta fɔ ni di Yosia sɛka olebee kamɛ diɛbadu ni di kanunua. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Loobia nse Yuda batii lenu sɛlaa kpile otũ biala latɛ nlɛ kamayɔ n-wako ni di suoto lɛma yi, obiala lɛma kamakyi di amumu osuku nɔɔ suoto; ni kamayɔ amumu lɛma ɔbla ku sikpile lɛma nwu nkyɛ ma.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Nioso Yeremia lalɛɛ Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk, di Yeremia labuɛ sɛlaa se simuu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ ni yi, ni di Baruk lakpana sĩ aakpee di kukũ nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Ni di Yeremia latɔkɔ Baruk alɛ, “Beetĩi mi osuku; namafuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Nioso, afɔ kyɛ SAATE nwu leyo di kanya onii dii suoto, faalaaka SAATE nwu sɛlaa se faakpana faakyeko ni kukũ nwu kamɛ fɛ mmle labuɛ ni fata batii nwu. Ka sɛlaa nwu fata Yuda batii ba bamuu ninkye sekpoo lɛma man-wa ni. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Loobia babayɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ lɛma manwako di SAATE nwu anu, di obiala lɛma nkyi di sisuku kpile nɔɔ suoto, diekye SAATE nwu ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka le eebuɛ ni di batii ba mmle suoto lemuɔ.”<verse eid="JER 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk labla lɛsaa biala le di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ abla nii; aaka SAATE nwu ɔlaa aakyeko kukũ nwu kamɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. <verse eid="JER 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ nɔnle di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ naasinle kamɛ yi, baayie lɛkya di kanya onii di SAATE nwu anu baata Yerusalem batii bamuu ku batii ba niakye Yuda sekpoo baawa nii. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Diayɔ ni di kukũ kpanatɛ, Safan obisuɔtɔbi Gemaria leyo le niawɛ ni di katoo lɛkyɛ kaflɔnkɔ di olekatakɔ Kayoko Fɔle kanya yi, Baruk laka Yeremia sɛlaa aakyeko kukũ nwu kamɛ aata batii nwu bamuu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baaka Kukũ Nwu Baata Banɔɔfotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Di Gemaria obisuɔtɔbi Mikaia wɔ ninle ni Safan ɔwa, lanu ni SAATE nwu sɛlaa simuu di kukũ nwu kamɛ yi, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />ni aasoo aakyɛ kukũ kpanatɛ nwu kayoee di lɛkayo, di lɛba le di banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu lasiɛ nii: Kukũ kpanatɛ Elisama, Semaia obisuɔtɔbi Delaia, Akbor obisuɔtɔbi Elnatan, Safan obisuɔtɔbi Gemaria, Hanania obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia ku banɔɔfotii nwu bamba bamuu lawɛ ninfa. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Di Mikaia latɔkɔ ma ni ɔlaa biala wɔ aanu Baruk laka aakyeko ni kukũ nwu kamɛ aata ni batii nwu aaloo ni yi, <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />ni di banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu lakpee Netania obisuɔtɔbi Yehudi, wɔ niale ni Selemia ɔwa, aale ni Kusi ɔwatɛtɛ, alɛ balaatɔkɔ Baruk alɛ, “Yɔ kukũ ko fatɔɔka fɛɛta ni batii nwu fawako.” Nioso Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk laklee kukũ nwu di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɛnko ɔkyɛ lɛma. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekoto, siɛ kaasɔ, faaka kukũ nwu fata wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Nioso Baruk laka kũ aata ma. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Obe wɔ baanu ni sɛlaa se mmle simuu yi, ni baanyu bawo di anu di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ ni baatɔkɔ Baruk alɛ, “Dikpeni buɔlaabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle simuu buɔtɔkɔ ɔka.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Ninfɛ baakaalɛ Baruk alɛ, “Tɔkɔ wo, lɛ fɛɛbla fɛɛwa fɛɛbakpana asaa ya mmle nwu amuu? Yeremia niebuɛ sĩ fɛɛkpana?”<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Ni di Baruk ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, nnwɔɔ niabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle simuu aatɔkɔ mi, ni layɔ kakpanawesee lakpana sĩ lakpee di kukũ nwu kamɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Ni di banɔɔfotii nwu latɔkɔ Baruk alɛ, “Afɔ ku Yeremia, bitɔɔkyɛ biɛlaawofa. Bitanta otii kuonwii latafo lɛba le bikpe nii.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Lakpee Kukũ Nwu Ɔtɔ Aafiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Baayɔ kukũ nwu baatɛ ni di kukũ kpanatɛ Elisama kayoee kamɛ baaloo ni yi, ni baakyɛ ɔka nfũ di leyo nwu kaflɔnkɔ baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ lɛsaa biala nɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakpee Yehudi alɛ alaayɔ kukũ nwu awako nɛ. Ni di Yehudi lasifi aalaayɔ kũ di kukũ kpanatɛ Elisama kayoee nwu kamɛ aawako aabaka aata ɔka ku banɔɔfotii ba bamuu niayila nwɔ ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Kɔwɛntɛ naasinle di Israel batii awɛntɛ kamɛ diale, ɔka kafɔɔ lasiɛ di kɔkyɛɛ obe leyo kamɛ, di ɔtɔ latɔɔkɛsɛɛ ni di ɔtɔ dibukii kamɛ di anu nɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Nse Yehudi lɛka kukũ nwu ele etiɛ ee ɛna yi, ɔka n-yɔ kukũ kpanatɛ kapamii an-kya kũ andiki ankpee di ɔtɔ dibukii nwu kamɛ, dialaase di obe wɔ di kukũ nwu kumuu lafiɛ ni di ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Ɔka nwu ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu ba nianu ni sɛlaa se mmle simuu ditatuo lɛyɛkɛ kuninwii, ee babɛbɛɛ akpeele lɛma. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Nu di Elnatan, Delaia ku Gemaria latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ atanfiɛ kukũ nwu yi, atakyɔɔ ma atoko. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Kafɔɔ, ɔka latɔkɔ, ɔka nwu obisuɔtɔbi Yerahmeel, Asriel obisuɔtɔbi Seraia ku Abdeel obisuɔtɔbi Selemia alɛ bamufũ kukũ kpanatɛ nwu Baruk ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia bawako. Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lawofasa ma.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lakpana Kukũ Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Di ɔka nwu lafiɛ ni kukũ ko di Baruk lakpana ni di Yeremia ɔlaa kanya aaloo ni yi, ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Yɔ kukũ bamba faakpana sɛlaa se simuu niasiɛ ni di kukũ kasale kamɛ fakpee ninkũ kamɛ, nko di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim lafiɛ nii. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Tɔkɔ Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim kafɔɔ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Faakpee kukũ nwu ɔtɔ faafiɛ, ni faabuɛ falɛ, “Obe oso fɛɛkpana feekpee ninkũ kamɛ falɛ nwaako Babel ɔka kamawa aamawɔɔsa kasɔ ka mmle, an-wɔɔsa kafɔɔ batii ku babɔkɛɛ andiki ninka suoto?” <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim suoto alɛ: Ɔlɔbawɛ otii kuonwii asiɛ di Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto; Babayɔ kpi nɔɔ manfuki man-yu, kufĩ kamapɛ nwɔ di kakũ, oblokyi kafɔɔ kamakpete nwɔ di kakyɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Kamananfi nnwɔɔ ku babi nɔɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ kootoko di amumu lɛma ablasaa nwu suoto; kamayɔ sɛlaa kpile otũ biala labuɛ ni di suoto lɛma n-wako di batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem ku Yuda suoto, ta batakyɔɔ ni atoko oso.’ ”<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Nioso Yeremia layɔ kukũ bamba aata kukũ kpanatɛ Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk. Nioso fɛ mmle di Yeremia latoobuɛ ni yi, Baruk lakpana di kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa se simuu di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakim lafiɛ ni di ɔtɔ kamɛ aakpee di kukũ nwu kamɛ. Ni aakple aabuɛ sɛlaa nwu nkpo okle kpinwu aakyakaa di nsinkpo suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Sedekia Lakaalɛ Lɛkyakaako Aakyeko Yeremia Nfũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar layɔ Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia aase Yuda ɔka; aale sɛka di Yehoiakim obisuɔtɔbi Konia kanya. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Nnwɔɔ ee bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ee kasɔ nwu batii kuonwii lɛma ditakyɔɔ sɛlaa se di SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia suoto.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Kafɔɔ, ɔka Sedekia, lakpee Selemia obisuɔtɔbi Yehukal ku Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi oletatɛ Sefania alɛ bakyɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia nfũ ku ɔlaa wɔ mmle alɛ: “Lekoto pɛ ɔlaa fata SAATE Yaa loo nwu fata wo.”<verse eid="JER 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Yeremia nfɛ lawɛ osuku aakyɛ, aatookple di batii nwu kamɛ, diekye di obe nwu kamɛ baditɛ nwɔ di leyo katenkɔ. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Farao bakpɛtɛ ladie di Egipte, ni di Babel batii ba niamana Yerusalem baakyi ni lanu ni lɛkpanko lɛma, ni baatoso baadie di Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛYeremia alɛ: <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: Tɔkɔ Yuda ɔka, nnwɔ niekpee fɔ alɛ bawolaa ni asaa kamɛ di ɔkyɛ nii falɛ, ‘Farao bakpɛtɛ ba niedie bɛɛwa alɛ bɔɔbakyakaako fɔ ni kamapɛmankple mansifi kasɔ lɛma kamu di Egipte. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />N-se Babel batii ntɔɔpɛbeekple bɛɛbadieko okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle; babafũ nwu, manfiɛ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ.’<verse eid="JER 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitankyɔnkyɔ suoto lee, biabla disibu bilɛ, ‘Nwaako Babel batii nwu kɔwa wo ɔbadiɛ.’ Blɔbadiɛ wo! <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Nse bia biefuo Babel batii bakpɛtɛ bamuu ba nikodieko ye ni olenkee, di batii ba niefũ ni nkɔ lete niebu di akpaayo lɛma kamɛ yi, babadie man-wa mamakpee okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle ɔtɔ manfiɛ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ.”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baamufũ Yeremia Baatɛ Di Leyo Katenkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Di obe wɔ di Babel batii bakpɛtɛ lapɛbaakple ni di Yerusalem sɛmaa, ta Farao bakpɛtɛ oso yi, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Yeremia ladie di okpoo kplɛ nwu alɛ ɔɔkyɛ Benyamin kasɔ anaafũ kalekɔ nɔɔ di batii nwu kamɛ ninfa. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Kafɔɔ aadu ni Benyamin Kayoko yi, banyuntɛ nwu ɔnɔɔfo wɔ leyooto niale ni Yiria, aale ni Selemia obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni kafɔɔ Hanania ɔwa lamufũ nwɔ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Footoso fansifi Babel batii nfũ!”<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Ni di Yeremia labuɛ alɛ, “Kuote nkpo! Nootoso nsifi Babel batii nfũ.” Kafɔɔ Yiria ditakyɔɔ nwɔ atoko; kafɔɔ, aamufũ Yeremia, ni aakpaa nwɔ aawako banɔɔfotii nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Ɔblɔ lafiɛ ma di Yeremia suoto, ni baata baapɛ nwɔ baayɔ nwɔ baalatɛ di leyo katenkɔ di kukũ kpanatɛ Yonatan leyo le baayɔ baabla ni leyo katenkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Baakpee Yeremia di leyo katenkɔ di kutuɛ kunwii kamɛ, aawɛ ninfa diaklɛ. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Ni di Ɔka Sedekia lakpee baalaakpaa nwɔ baawako lekayo nɛ, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ di lewofa kamɛ alɛ, “Ɔlaa owo lekye SAATE nwu nfũ kuɔwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Ni di Yeremia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, babayɔ fɔ mankpee di Babel ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia latɔkɔ Ɔka Sedekia alɛ, “Obe okpile lɛbla di afɔ ee banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ee batii ba mmle suoto, oso fɛɛtɛ mi di leyo katenkɔ? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Ɔfɛ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lɛfɔ ba niabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ baata fɔ ni alɛ, ‘Babel ɔka dilɔbadieko ni afɔ ee kasɔ ka mmle’ nkpe? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Kafɔɔ nunua yi, saate nii ɔka, lekoto kyɔɔ atoko. Tɛɛ n-yɔ ɔlaa nii ntɛ fɔ di anu: Tankplesa mi faasifiko kukũ kpanatɛ Yonatan leyo, nse diele nkpo kamakpi ninfa.”<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Ni di Ɔka Sedekia lata osuku alɛ bayɔ Yeremia balaakpee di banyuntɛ nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ, baatɔɔtɔɔ kafɔɔ bloblo wɔ baakyeko ni bloblo bafiɛtɛ lɛkpaka, dii biala dilaase di obe wɔ di bloblo kamaloo ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. Nioso Yeremia lawɛ di banyuntɛ nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Baamufũ Yeremia Baakpee Di Ditubiɔ Le Di Ntu Diesi Ni Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Matan obisuɔtɔbi Sefatia, Pasur obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia, Selemia obisuɔtɔbi Yukal ku Malkiya obisuɔtɔbi Pasur lanu ɔlaa wɔ di Yeremia latɔɔtɔkɔ ni batii nwu bamuu di obe wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ, <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Otii lele niesiɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ kamakpi di kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ee ofiɛ kpile kanya, kafɔɔ otii lele niedie eesifi Babel batii nfũ kamasiɛ nkpa. Abatoso ku nkpa nɔɔ; abasiɛ nkpa.’ <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nwaako kamayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nkpee di Babel ɔka bakpɛtɛ nnɛɛ, manfũ nwu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Ninfɛ di banɔɔfotii nwu latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Dikaatɛ alɛ manlo osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle. Ofeesa bakpɛtɛ ba niebu basi ni di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nnɛɛ, diɛkyakaa ni di batii nwu bamuu, di sɛlaa se ɔɔtɔkɔ ma ni kanya. Osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle diloomiɛ batii ba mmle dibiene, kafɔɔ kawɔɔ lɛma.”<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Ni di Ɔka Sedekia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Asi di nnɛɛ lee, diekye ɔka dilɔbafuo lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii ɔbla oyila ye di suoto.”<verse eid="JER 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Nioso baakpaa Yeremia baalaakpee di ɔka obisuɔtɔbi Malkiya ditubiɔ le niate ni di banyuntɛ leyo kaflɔnkɔ kamɛ. Sikũ baayɔ baasoosa Yeremia baakpee di ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ; ntu ditasiɛ di ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ, apatapata lete niasiɛ, ni di Yeremia lamɛɛ di apatapata nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Kafɔɔ Etiopia otii onwii, Ebed-melek, wɔ niale ni ɔnɔɔfotii di lɛkayo kamɛ lanu alɛ batɔɔyɔ Yeremia beekpee di ditubiɔ kamɛ. Di obe wɔ di ɔka nwu lasiɛ ni di Benyamin Kayoko kanya yi, <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ebed-melek ladie di lɛkayo aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Saate nii ɔka, batii ba mmle lediki kɔkpaa dikpile kanya di asaa ya amuu bɛɛbla ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia suoto. Batoofuki nwɔ beekpee di ditubiɔ kamɛ, di lɛba le di kɔka kamalo nwɔ ankpi nii, di obe wɔ di bloblo kuonwii nsinnaa ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Etiopia otii nwu, Ebed-melek alɛ, “Kpaa basuɔtɔ afosi-atiɛ fakyeko nfũ fakyakaa di suoto lɛfɔ biɛlaadiki ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia di ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ, di mmle anamakpi ni.”<verse eid="JER 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Nioso Ebed-melek lakpaa basuɔtɔ nwu aakyakaa di suoto, ni baakyɛ leyo le ninsi ni di asaakatɛ kalɔ di lɛkayo nwu kamɛ nɛ. Ni aayɔ sikpilakpi kofole ku abula bɛbɛɛle awo ninfa, ni aasoosa nya ku sikũ aata Yeremia di ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Ninfɛ di Etiopia otii nwu, Ebed-melek latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “Yɔ sikpilakpi kofole ku abula bɛbɛɛle ya mmle fakpee di sɛfankyi lɛfɔ kalɔ di sikũ nwu sisiɛ sĩ kaalɔ.” Nioso Yeremia labla nkpo, <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />ni baananfi nwɔ ku sikũ nwu baatakatɛsa nwɔ baadiki di ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ. Ni di Yeremia lasiɛ di banyuntɛ nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekia Latɔkɔ Yeremia Alɛ Atɔɔ Disibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Sedekia lata baakpaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia baawako SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kayoko tiɛfa nɛ. Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “Kamakaalɛ fɔ lɛsaa ninwii, tan-yɔ lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii faawofasa mi.”<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia lakaalɛ Sedekia alɛ, “Nse lediki fɔ kanya, flɔbalo mi? Nse bia lɛkà fɔ yi, flɔbakyɔɔ mi atoko.”<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Kafɔɔ Ɔka Sedekia laka ntam be mmle di lewofa kamɛ aata Yeremia alɛ: “Nwaako di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niɛta wo ni ninwuna, namalo fɔ ee n-yɔ fɔ nkpee di batii ba nikomiɛ alɛ balo fɔ ni nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Ni di Yeremia latɔkɔ Sedekia alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nse fɛɛyɔ suoto lɛfɔ fɛɛta Babel ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu yi, babata fɔ fansiɛ nkpa, afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ batii kamasiɛ nkpa; ni blɔbafiɛ kafɔɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle batɛ kaasɔ. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Kafɔɔ nse flɔbayɔ suoto fata Babel ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu yi, ni babayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle mankpee di Babel batii nnɛɛ, manfiɛ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ; afɔ omu lɛfɔ flɔbatoso fadie di nnɛɛ lɛma.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Ni di Ɔka Sedekia latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “Kɔyɛkɛ Yuda batii ba nitoodie beesifi ni Babel batii nfũ, diekye Babel batii kamafuo mi ɔyɔ okpee di nnɛɛ lɛma, mambla mi amumu.”<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Ni di Yeremia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Blɔbayɔ fɔ bakpee ma ninnɛɛ, kyɔɔ SAATE nwu kotoko, faabla lɛsaa le lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni. Ni dibalɛ ɔkyɛ ninta fɔ, manta fɔ fansiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Kafɔɔ nse feesĩ suoto ɔyɔ ɔta yi, nnya lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu lediki eetuo mi ni alɛ: <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Babadiki basanko ba bamuu niebu ni di Yuda ɔka lɛkayo kamɛ manwako Babel ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu. Basanko nwu kamatɔkɔ fɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“ ‘Basiɛwo lɛfɔ ba feefũ feenu nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">lakyɔnkyɔ fɔ, ni baalenkee fɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Nkpaa lɛfɔ ntɔmɛɛ di apatapata kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">basiɛwo lɛfɔ ntootoso beediɛ fɔ.’<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />“Babakpaa basɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku babi lɛfɔ bamuu manwako Babel batii nfũ. Afɔ omu lɛfɔ flɔbatoso fadie di nnɛɛ lɛma, kafɔɔ Babel ɔka batii kamamufũ fɔ; manfiɛ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle mantɛ kaasɔ.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Ninfɛ di Sedekia latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “Tanta otii kuonwii lanu lɛkakatɛ le mmle, nse diele nkpo fabakpi. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Nse banɔɔfotii nwu lenu alɛ lɛkakatɛko fɔ, bɛɛwa fɔ ɔkyɛ bɛɛbabuɛ alɛ, ‘Tɔkɔ wo ɔlaa wɔ feebuɛ fɛɛtɔkɔ ni ɔka ku ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka lebuɛ ɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni; tan-yɔ nwu faawofasa wo, se diele nkpo bubalo fɔ,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Lekoto latootikiti ɔka nlɛ atankplesa mi aasifiko Yonatan leyo alɛ kaakpi ninfa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Ninfɛ di banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu lawa Yeremia nfũ baabakaalɛ nwɔ sɛlaa nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ma ɔlaa biala wɔ di ɔka latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ abuɛ ni nɛ. Nioso batasimbuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii baatɔkɔ nwɔ, diekye otii kuonwii ditanu lɛkakatɛ nɔɔ ku ɔka.<verse eid="JER 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Ni di Yeremia lasiɛ di banyuntɛ nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ dialaadu di dii le baafũ ni Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Okpoo Obiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">Nnya mmle baafũ ni Yerusalem:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Di Yuda ɔka Sedekia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naasinle kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ yi, Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ladie baakyɛ baalaamana Yerusalem baakyi. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Di Sedekia lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ naafa dii naasinle kamɛ, baabiɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu oyoyiɛ baabuo. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Ninfɛ di Babel ɔka banɔɔfotii lawa baabafũ nsiɛkɔ di Ntɛɛntɛɛ Kayoko nwu nɛ: Nergal-Sareser niakye ni Samger, Nebo-Sarsekim ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔfo, Nergal-Sareser ɔnɔɔfotii kplɛ ku Babel banɔɔfotii bamba bamuu. <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Obe wɔ di Yuda ɔka Sedekia ku bakpɛtɛ bamuu lanya ma ni yi, baatoso; baafe di ɔka kɔba osuku ku kakyɛ baadie di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ, baafe di eyoyiɛ nwu ɛnyɔ obo, ni baatũ disi diofe ni Araba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nfa ninle ni Yordan Ɔtaata nɛ</char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="JER 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Kafɔɔ Babel batii bakpɛtɛ latikanko ma baalaatũ Sedekia di Yeriko kasɔ lɛtaata suoto. Baamufũ nwɔ ni baakpaa nwɔ baakyɛnko Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar di Ribla di Hamat kasɔ suoto nɛ, nfa aakanko nwɔ aalo nwɔ lɛpɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Di Ribla ninfa di Babel ɔka lalo Sedekia babisuɔtɔbi di anu nɔɔ, aalo kafɔɔ Yuda batii finle bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Ninfɛ aabɔkɔtɛ Sedekia anumbi, aanii nwɔ ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle sɛkpɛnkyɛ, aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko Babel nɛ.<verse eid="JER 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Ni di Babel batii lakpee lɛkayo nwu ku batii nwu ayo ɔtɔ, baabibiɛ kafɔɔ Yerusalem seyoyiɛ baatɛ kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Ninfɛ di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan lakpaa batii ba niabu ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu, diakyakaa ni di batii ba niasifi ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ku batii bule aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel nɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Kafɔɔ banyuntɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan ladiɛ bapiitɛ ba bawo ninaa ni lɛsalɛsaa di Yuda kasɔ suoto; ni aata ma nta afe ku afe di obe nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiɛ Yeremia Aasifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Ninfɛ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lata afiofa ya mmle di Yeremia suoto diafe ni di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan suoto alɛ: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Kpaa nwɔ fasifiko faalaanyu nwɔ disi; tambla nwɔ amumu kafɔɔ bla lɛsaa lele ɛɛkaalɛ fatɔɔ.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Nioso banyuntɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan, ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔfo Nebusasban, ɔnɔɔfotii kplɛ Nergal-Sareser ku Babel ɔka banɔɔfotii bamba bamuu <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />lakpee baalaadiki Yeremia di banyuntɛ nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ baawako. Ni baayɔ nwɔ baakpee di Safan ɔwa wɔ niale ni Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia nnɛɛ, alɛ akpaa nwɔ asifiko okpoo nɔɔ nɛ. Nioso aasiɛ di batii nɔɔ bamu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osuku Onyu Kuɔta Ni Ebed-Melek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Obe wɔ di Yeremia lawɛ ni di leyo katenkɔ di banyuntɛ nwu kafɔlɔnkɔ yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɔɔ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Tɔɔkyɛ faalaatɔkɔ Etiopia otii nwu Ebed-Melek falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔɔwa ɔbabla di sɛlaa nii kanya di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle suoto, diefe ni di sɛlaa kpile otũ, ninanle ni lɛlɛ. Sibawa kaanya di obe nwu kamɛ di anu lee. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Kafɔɔ kamadiki fɔ di dii nwu nkpo suoto, SAATE nwu niebuɛ; blɔbayɔ fɔ bakpee di batii ba fan-yɛkɛ ni nnɛɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Kamadiki fɔ; flɔbakpi di kapamii kanya, kafɔɔ fabatoso ku nkpa lɛfɔ, ta feetika mi ni disi oso, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Lasiɛ Di Gedalia Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia di obe wɔ di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan ladiɛ nwɔ ni sɛɛmaa di Rama nɛ. Aanya Yeremia wɔ baakpee ni sɛkpɛnkyɛ di balanle ba bamuu baamufũ baakyeko ni Yerusalem ku Yuda kamɛ, mba baakpaa baasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Di banyuntɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ lanya ni Yeremia yi, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu niabuɛ ɔlaa kpile otũ wɔ mmle aatɛ di lɛba le mmle suoto nɛ. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Ninfɛ di kanunua SAATE nwu ntɔɔta diɛwa kaanya nɛ; atɔɔbla fɛ mmle aatɛ aabuɛ alɛ ababla nii. Asaa ya mmle amuu lɛwa ta aye biabla ni okpile di SAATE nwu suoto ku ɔlaa nɔɔ ɔtanu ni oso. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Kafɔɔ miɛ kodiki sɛkpɛnkyɛ se mmle di nnɛɛtũ lɛfɔ. Nse dilɛ fɔ yi, tikankoe buosifi Babel, ni kamanyu fɔ disi; kafɔɔ nse flomiɛ yi, ni tan-wa. Nyu lo, kasɔ nwu kamuu nte di anu lɛfɔ; tɔɔkyɛ kakɔ lele ninlɛ fɔ.” <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Kafɔɔ, fiɛ di Yeremia lamunikĩi alɛ oosifi nii, Nebusaradan labuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Pɛfakple fasifi Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia wɔ ninle ni Safan ɔwa nfũ, nnwɔ di Babel ɔka ladiki alɛ ayila ni di Yuda sekpoo kanya, faalaasiɛ nwɔ di ɔkyɛ di batii nwu kamɛ, ee tɔɔkyɛ kakɔ lele ninlɛ fɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Ninfɛ di kanyayilatɛ nwu latɔɔ alesaa asaa ku atasaa, ni aatɔɔ aasifi nɛ. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Nioso Yeremia lasifi Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia nfũ di Mispa, ni aasiɛ nwɔ di ɔkyɛ di batii ba baabu baatɛ ni sɛɛmaa kamɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedalia Labale Abaa Kanyayilatɛ Di Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma bamuu ba niawɛ ni di kakpɛkɔ lanu alɛ Babel ɔka ntoodiki Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia eese ni fɛ abaa kanyayilatɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto, ni atɔɔyɔ nwɔ eese ni di basuɔtɔ, basanko ku babisɔ ba niale ni bapiitɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto batakpaa baasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel kanya yi, <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />ni baawa Gedalia nfũ di Mispa nɛ- Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael, Karea babisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku Yonatan, Tanhumet obisuɔtɔbi Seraia, Efai Netofat otii nwu babisuɔtɔbi, ku Maakat otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Yaasania, ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia wɔ niale ni Safan ɔwa, laka ntam aakple aatika difuɔ aata ma ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bitanyɛkɛ Babel batii osumu. Bisiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto biesumu Babel ɔka nwu, ni dibalɛ ɔkyɛ ninta ye. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Ami omu nii kamasiɛ di Mispa alɛ kayila ye kaanya di Babel batii ba nimawa wo ni ɔkyɛ anu. Kafɔɔ bisiisa nta, kabiene awosobi ku nnɔnyi, biɛyɔ nya bikpee di ataase lee kamɛ, biesiɛ di sekpoo se biafũ ni kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Obe wɔ di Yuda batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di Moab, Amon, Edom ku nsɔ bamba mmuu lanu alɛ Babel ɔka ladiɛ batii bawo aatɛ ni di Yuda, aadiki ni kafɔɔ Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia wɔ ninle ni Safan ɔwa, aase ni fɛ abaa kanyayilatɛ di suoto lɛma yi, <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />bamuu lɛma baapɛbaakple baawa Yuda, baawa Gedalia nfũ di Mispa, baakye nsɔ be mmuu kamɛ baasamiisa ma baakpee ni baawa. Ni baasiisa nta ku kabiene awosobi kpinwu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalo Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Ninfɛ di Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii bamuu ba niawɛ ni ɔwɛ di kakpɛkɔ kamɛ lawa Gedalia nfũ di Mispa <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />baabakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ: “Faaye falɛ Amon batii ɔka Baalis ntookpee Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael alɛ abalo fɔ?” Kafɔɔ Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia ditafũ ma anu.<verse eid="JER 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Ninfɛ di Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan layu aakpee di Gedalia kotoko di Mispa alɛ, “Tɛɛ nkyɛ ninalo Netania obisuɔtɔbi nwu, kuonwii dilɔbatofo nwu ole. Obe oso di nnwɔɔ aawa aamalo fɔ ninta alɛ Yuda batii ba bamuu niɛmana fɔ beekyi ni nsamii ninta kafɔɔ Yuda batii ba niebu ni n-wɔɔ?”<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Kafɔɔ Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia latɔkɔ Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan alɛ, “Tambla lɛsaa le mmle okle! Ɔlaa wɔ foobuɛ ni di Ismael suoto diele onukwale.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ yi, Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael wɔ niale ni Elisama ɔwa wɔ niakye ni baka leyo kamɛ, aale ni kafɔɔ ɔka ɔnɔɔfotii onwii lɛma, lawa Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia nfũ ku basuɔtɔ lefosi di Mispa. Obe wɔ baasi baatoole ni alesaa ninfa yi, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />ni di Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael ku basuɔtɔ lefosi ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lataka baalo Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia wɔ niale ni Safan ɔwa. Baalo otii wɔ di Babel ɔka ladiki alɛ ale ni abaa kanyayilatɛ ku kapamii di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Ismael lalo kafɔɔ Yuda batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku Gedalia di Mispa, diakyakaa ni di Babel bakpɛtɛ ba niawɛ ni ninfa.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Baalo Gedalia baaloo ni kaleesɛ, fiɛ di otii owo latofo ni yi, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />batii afosi-anɛ lakye Sekem, Silo ku Samaria baawa, baakpaasu sikusu lɛma, baabɛbɛɛ akpeele, baakyankya kafɔɔ suoto lɛma, diato alɛ basi ni kaku, laklee alesaa asaaɔta ku olufui baawako SAATE nwu leyo. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Ninfɛ di Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael ladie di Mispa aalaakyakako ma nɛ, oofe nii, aatoowi kaku. Aakyakako ma nii, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Biwa buosifi Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia nfũ.” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Di obe wɔ baabuo ni okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ, Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael ku basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lalo ma, ni baafuki ma baakpee di ditubiɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ lefosi di batii nwu kamɛ latɔkɔ Ismael alɛ, “Tanlo wo! Bukpe kamɔɔ ku akpaa, nnɔnyi ku bablɔ, buokookaa ni di kofe kunwii kamɛ.” Nioso aadiɛ ma, ni atalo ma ku babule nɛ. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Ditubiɔ le kamɛ aafuki basuɔtɔ ba bamuu aalo ni ku Gedalia bakpi aakpee ni niale Ɔka Asa dibiɔ le aakutu aayɔ aasɛɛ ni Israel ɔka, Baasa osuku nɛ. Ni di Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael layɔ bakpi aayiisa dibiɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ninfɛ di Ismael lamufũ batii bule ba bamuu niawɛ ni di Mispa-ɔka babisankobi ku batii bamba ba bamuu niabu ni ninfa aabla balanle nɛ. Mba di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan ladiki ni Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia aase ni kaanya. Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael lamufũ ma selanle, ni aataalɛko ma aasifiko Amon batii nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ di Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lanu ni akpilesaa ya amuu di Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael labla ni yi, <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />ni bakpaa bakpɛtɛ lɛma bamuu baakyɛ baalaakpɛko Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael nɛ. Baalaatũ nwɔ di lɛpanta kplɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ di Gibeon. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Obe wɔ di batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku Ismael lanya ni Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ yi, suoto layɔɔ ma. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Batii ba bamuu di Ismael lamufũ ni balanle di Mispa lakple baasifi Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan nfũ. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Kafɔɔ Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael ku basuɔtɔ nɔɔ banɛ lafe Yohanan, ni baatoso baasifi Amon batii nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otoso Osifi Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Ninfɛ di Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lakpaa batii ba bamuu niabu baawɛ ni nkpa, mba aafũ ni di Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael nfũ di obe wɔ aalo ni Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia aaloo ni sɛmaa. Ni aakpaa ma aadieko di Mispa nɛ: bakpɛtɛ, basanko, babisɔ ku kaflɔnkɔ nwu banɔɔfotii ba aakpaa akyeko ni Gibeon. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Ni baayefe osuku, baalaayila di Gart Kimham di Betlehem ɔlɔɔkɔ di osuku boofe ni Egipte <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />alɛ baatoso ni Babel batii. Baatɔɔyɛkɛ ma diekye Netania obisuɔtɔbi Ismael lalo Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi wɔ di Babel ɔka ladiki ni fɛ abaa kanyayilatɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Nwu LatɔkɔYeremia Alɛ Apɛ Ɔlaa Ata Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Ninfɛ di bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu, diɛkyakaa ni di Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku Hosaia obisuɔtɔbi Yesania, ku batii ba bamuu diayɔ ni di obisɔ dialaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo lakyɛ <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia nfũ baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekoto nu lekoto loo otikiti, faapɛ ɔlaa fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu, fata batii ba mmle bamuu niebu basi ni nkpa. Fɛ mmle fɔɔnya ni kanunua, nu di obe nwu buapɔ yi, nunua basɛɛ loo lete niebu. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Pɛ ɔlaa falɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu katɔkɔ wo lɛba le buafe ni ku lɛsaa le buabla nii.”<verse eid="JER 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ntoonu ɔlaa lee. Nwaako kamapɛ ɔlaa nta SAATE Yaa lee nwu fɛ mmle biɛkaalɛ nii; kamatɔkɔ ye ɔlaa biala di SAATE nwu kamabuɛ nii, namayɔ kafɔɔ lɛsalɛsaa n-wofasa ye.<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Ni baatɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “SAATE nwu ale onukwale kamaayilatɛ di suoto loo, nse buɔɔbla di ɔlaa biala wɔ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu lekpee fɔ alɛ tɔkɔ wo ni kanya. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Obiene oo, okpile oo, bubakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa loo nwu atoko, nnwɔ nfũ buokpee fɔ ni, alɛ dialɛ ɔkyɛ ninta wo. Diekye bubakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa loo nwu kotoko.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Ladiki Kanya Aata Yeremia Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Di ayi lefosi sɛmaa, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Nioso aalɛɛ Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ, ku batii nwu bamuu diayɔ ni di obisɔ dialaadu ni di ɔnɔɔfo aasiisa. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ nfũ biakpee mi layɔ sɛlaa lee lakyɛnko ni, kobuɛ ni alɛ: <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Nse biesiɛ di kasɔ ka mmle suoto yi, kamata ye minkpɛ, namabiɛ ye ntɛ kaasɔ; kamase ye sidu, namasifi ye, diekye sɛlaa kpile otũ se lɛyɔ lɛwako ni di suoto lee lɛtɛɛ lebuo sɛnyaami. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Bitanyɛkɛ Babel ɔka nwu, nnwɔ biɔyɛkɛ ni nunua. Bitanyɛkɛ nwɔ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ, diekye nsiko ye kamafũ ye, nindiki ye kafɔɔ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Kamanya ye nyaami alɛ nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aanya ye nyaami anta ye minsiɛ di kasɔ lee suoto.’<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />“Kafɔɔ, nse biebuɛ bilɛ, ‘Bulɔbasiɛ di kasɔ ka mmle,’ biesĩ kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee nwu kotoko ɔkyɔɔ, <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />ni nse biebuɛ kafɔɔ bilɛ, ‘Oowo, bubakyɛ munaasiɛ di Egipte, lɛba le munamanya ni kakpɛ ee bunu ni dikyukyoo ee alesaa kɔka dilaaklee wo ni,’ yi <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />ni Oo Yuda batii ba niebu ni, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nse biomiɛ bilɛ biosifi Egipte, biɛkyɛ bilasiɛ ninfa yi, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />ni kapamii ka biɔyɛkɛ ni kamatũ ye ninfa, kɔka-ɔkpɛ wɔ kafɔɔ nikokpee ye ni difu kamatikanko ye kunwa di Egipte kasɔ suoto, nfa kafɔɔ bibakpi nɛ. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Nwaako, batii ba bamuu nikomiɛ alɛ boosifi Egipte maanasiɛ ni ninfa kamakpi di kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile kanya; kuonwii lɛma dilɔbawɛ nkpa ee atoso ɔlaa kpile otũ wɔ kamayɔ n-wako ma ni di suoto.’ <verse eid="JER 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Fɛ mmle lanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii lakpete ni batii ba niasiɛ ni di Yerusalem yi, nkpo kamanyɛɛnɛ lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii nkpete ye di suoto nse biesifi Egipte nɛ. Bibale lɛkpaanisaa ku lɛyɛkɛsaa, kawɔɔ ku ditufasaa; bilɔbasinya lɛba le mmle diidii.’<verse eid="JER 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />“Oo Yuda batii ba niebu bisi ni, SAATE nwu ntɔɔtɔkɔ ye alɛ, ‘Bitansifi Egipte.’ Bitofo nle mmle bilɛ: Lesĩ ɔlaa lɛta ye miɛ <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />nlɛ biabla ɔtanlolaa ɔbla dibinte di obe wɔ biakpee mi ni SAATE Yaa lee nwu nfũ biabuɛ ni bilɛ, ‘Pɛ ɔlaa fata SAATE Yaa loo nwu fata wo; tɔkɔ wo ɔlaa biala eebuɛ ni, bubabla ninwu suoto.’ <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Ntɔɔtɔkɔ ye miɛ, kafɔɔ biɛɛkyɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee nwu kotoko di sɛlaa se simuu aakpee mi alɛ ntɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Nioso kanunua yi, bitofo nle mmle bilɛ: Bibakpi di kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile kanya di lɛba le biomiɛ bilɛ biɔkyɛ minaasiɛ nii.”<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s1">Baakpaa Yeremia Baasifiko Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Di Yeremia latɔkɔ batii nwu sɛlaa se simuu di SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu lakpee nwɔ alɛ atɔkɔ ma nii, aaloo ma ni ɔlaa biala ɔtɔkɔ yi, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />ni di Hosaia obisuɔtɔbi Asaria ku Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku basuɔtɔ ba bamuu nintakatɛ ni suoto katoo latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, “Fɔɔlaa! SAATE Yaa loo nwu diekpee fɔ alɛ babuɛ falɛ, ‘Bitankyɛ Egipte bialaasiɛ ninfa.’ <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Kafɔɔ Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk nikoyiensa fɔ ɔtɔ di suoto loo alɛ faayɔ wo fankpee di Babel batii nnɛɛ, alɛ baalo wo ee baakpaa wo mansifiko sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel.”<verse eid="JER 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Nioso Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu ku batii nwu bamuu ditakyɔɔ atoko di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ basiɛ ni di Yuda kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Kafɔɔ, Karea obisuɔtɔbi Yohanan ku bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu lakpaa batii nwu bamuu niabu ni di Yuda, mba niapɛbaakple baawa baabasiɛ ni di Yuda kasɔ suoto, baakye ni nnle be mmuu baasamiisa ma baakpee ni kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Baakpaa kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ, basanko ku babisɔ ku ɔka babisankobi bamuu ba di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan ladiɛko ni, Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi Gedalia wɔ niale ni Safan ɔwa, ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia ku Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk baasifiko. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Nioso baabuo Egipte kasɔ, diekye batakyɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaa atoko, ni baalaabuo bia Tahpanhes okpoo nɛ.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yeremia di Tahpanhes alɛ: <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Yɔ afuɔ kplɛ awo fakookaa di atɛnkudi ya bɛɛtɛ ni di Farao lɛkayo kayokontũ di Tahpanhes, di obe wɔ di Yuda batii konyu ni. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Ni faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamakpee manlɛɛ kpɛmblatɛ nii Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar manwako, nin-yɔ lɛkakpomii nɔɔ nse di afuɔ ya mmle lekookaa ni ninfũ suoto; abafuti sɛka nɔɔ kalekɔ akpanta di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Abawa aamadieko Egipte, an-yɔ kukpi anwako mba beediki bɛɛta ni kukpi, an-ta mba beediki bɛɛta ni sɛlanle ole nsifi sɛlanle kamɛ, kapamii kafɔɔ anta mba beediki bɛɛta ni kapamii. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Abakpee ɔtɔ di Egipte bayaa selentakɔ; an-fiɛ selentakɔ lɛma nwu, an-yɔ kafɔɔ bayaa lɛma ansifiko sɛlanle kamɛ. Fɛ mmle di fosokpatɛ n-yɔ akpeele wua nɔɔ am-minisa ni di suoto yi, nkpo abayɔ Egipte am-minisa di suoto nɔɔ andie ninfa ansifi di lelenkee kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Di kufĩ olekatakɔ nwu di Egipte ninfa, ababibiɛ afuɔ akpaka klekle nwu, an-fiɛ kafɔɔ Egipte bayaa selentakɔ nwu antɛ kaasɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Wɔ Di SAATE Nwu Lata Ni Israel Batii Di Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Ɔlaa wɔ mmle lawa kuata Yeremia di Yuda batii ba bamuu niasiɛ ni di Egipte Kala lɛkyɛ suoto- di Migdol, Tahpanhes ku Memfis- ku Egipte Katoo lɛkyɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bianya sɛlaa kpile otũ kplɛ se layɔ lawako ni di Yerusalem ku Yuda sekpoo simuu suoto. Miɛ nfɛ site sifukuti ku kalalaa kamɛ <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />ta akpilesaa ya baabla ni oso. Baafiɛ olufui, baasumu kafɔɔ bayaa bamba di mma ee bate lee ditatofo ni diidii baayɔ baakpee mi ɔblɔ. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Obe lele lakpee bakpɛmblatɛ nii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu baababuɛ alɛ, ‘Bitambla ayududusaa ya mmle lekyidi nii!’ <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Kafɔɔ batanu ee bakyɔɔ atoko. Batakyi di akpilesaa lɛma ɔbla suoto ee badiɛ olufui ofiɛ ɔta bayaa bamba. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Nkpo oso lanyɛɛnɛ lɛblɔfiɛ nii nwu; ni kuafiɛ Yuda sekpoo ku Yerusalem akpaká, ni kuabla sĩ kawɔɔ ka sile ni miɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />“Nunua, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Obe oso biɛyɔ ɔlaa kpile otũ kplɛ wɔ mmle okle biɛwako di suoto lee, biɛwɔɔsa basuɔtɔ ku basanko, babi ku babifɔɔle biediki di Yuda, diɛta alɛ otii kuonwii diebu asiɛ ata ye? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Obe oso biɔyɔ asaa ya di nnɛɛ lee lɛbla ni minkpee mi ɔblɔ, biofiɛ olufui minta bayaa bamba di Egipte, di lɛba le biɛwa biɛbasiɛ ni? Bibawɔɔsa suoto lee mimbla kafɔɔ suoto lee lɛkpaanisaa ku lɛmansaa di nnle nwu mmuu kamɛ kaasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Bitooyee asiensiesaa ya di bate lee ku Yuda baka ku baka-sanko labla ni, ku asiensiesaa ya biabla ni ku basɔfɔ lee di Yuda kasɔ suoto ku Yerusalem akpaká? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Badiwakosa suoto lɛma kasɔ diɛbase di miɛ dii le mmle ee bayɛkɛ mi, ee batikanko kufiofa nii ku sɛsaabla se latɛ ni di aye ku bate lee anu.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />“Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛtɛ nlɛ kamayɔ sɛlaa kpile otũ n-wako ye di suoto, nin-wɔɔsa kafɔɔ Yuda omuu. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Kamawɔɔsa Yuda batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa, baatɛ alɛ boosifi maanasiɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto. Bamuu kamawɔɔ di Egipte; babanɔɔ di kapamii kanya ee mankpi di kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya. Diɛyɔ ni di obisɔ diɛlaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo, babakpi di kapamii ee kɔka-ɔkpɛ kanya. Babakple lɛkpaanisaa ku lɛyɛkɛsaa, kawɔɔ ku lɛmansaa. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Kamananfi mba ninsi ni di Egipte kootoko ku kapamii, kɔka-ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ kpile fɛ mmle lananfi ni Yerusalem kootoko. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Yuda batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa bɛɛkyɛ basi ni di Egipte kuonwii lɛma dilɔbatoso ee awɛ nkpa aapɛankple an-wa ni Yuda kasɔ suoto, nka boomiɛ alɛ baapɛmankple man-wa maamasiɛ nii; kuonwii dilɔbapɛakple, diediki kakpɛ kamɛ batosotɛ basɛɛ lete.”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niatofo alɛ basɔfɔ lɛma latoofiɛ ni olufui baatɔɔta ni bayaa bamba, diakyakaa ni di basanko ba bamuu niawɛ ni ninfa- lale ni dikudi kplɛ ninwii- ku batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Egipte Kala lɛkyɛ ku Katoo lɛkyɛ latɔkɔ Yeremia alɛ, <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Bulɔbakyɔɔ atoko di ɔlaa wɔ fatɔɔtɔkɔ wo ni di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ! <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Nwaako bubabla lɛsaa biala le buabuɛ bulɛ bubabla nii: Bubafiɛ olufui munta Osi Ɔkasanko nwu, munkpete nta kasɔ muntɔɔ fɛ mmle okle di awo ku bate loo, baka loo ku banɔɔfotii loo labla ni di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka. Diekye di obe nwu kamɛ yi, buawɛ alesaa kpinwu, lɛlɛ kafɔɔ lalɛ wo, okpile kuonwii kafɔɔ ditatũ wo. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Kafɔɔ diayɔ ni di obe wɔ buadiɛ ni olufui ofiɛ ɔta ni Osi Ɔkasanko nwu ku nta okpete kaasɔ ɔtɔɔ ni yi, butawɛ lɛsalɛsaa, ni buatɔɔwɔɔ kafɔɔ di kapamii ku kɔka kanya nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Ni di basanko nwu labuɛ baakyakaa alɛ, “Nse buafiɛ olufui buata Osi Ɔkasanko nwu, buakpete nta kasɔ buatɔɔ, ni basa loo ditatofo alɛ buatɔɔpɛ ayomboo fɛle letembi nɔɔ buatookpete nta kaasɔ kafɔɔ buatɔɔtɔɔ?”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu, basuɔtɔ ku basanko akyuu nwu anyɔ ba niatoodiki ni sɛlaa kanya baatɔɔtɔɔ ni alɛ, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“SAATE nwu ditanyuma, abu nwu disi kafɔɔ di olufui wɔ di aye ku bate lee, baka lee ku banɔɔfotii lee ku kasɔ nwu batii lafiɛ ni di Yuda sekpoo nwu kamɛ ku Yerusalem akpaka? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu dilaasinfuo ni otu okpee di amumu sɛsaabla lee ku ayududusaa asaa ya biabla ni suoto yi, kasɔ lee labakple lɛkpaanisaa, kaate kafɔɔ kafukuti di otii kuonwii ditasiɛ ka ni di suoto, fɛ mmle dite ni mmiɛ. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Ta biafiɛ olufui biabla ni okpile di SAATE nwu suoto, bitakyɔɔ nwɔ ni atoko ee bitikanko ni kufiofa nɔɔ ee sɛsaabla nɔɔ ee sɛlaa nɔɔ oso di sɛlaa kpile otũ se mmle lɛwa ye di suoto fɛ mmle biɔnya ni kanunua nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Ninfɛ di Yeremia latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu, diakyakaa ni di basanko nwu alɛ, “Aye Yuda batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: Aye ku basɔfɔ lee ntodiki bietuo di kɔkpaa didikibi lee le kanya biabuɛ biatɛ bilɛ, ‘Nwaako bubabla di ntam be buaka bulɛ bubafiɛ ni olufui, munkpete ni nta kasɔ kafɔɔ munta ni Osi Ɔkasanko nwu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">“Binwini, biɛbla nkpo, bibla di nle biabuɛ biatɛ ni kanya! Biklee ntam lee nwu! <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Kafɔɔ binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa, aye Yuda batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto: SAATE nwu kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Lɛka di leyooto kplɛ nii suoto nlɛ, otii kuonwii niekye ni Yuda, asi ni di kakɔ lele di Egipte kasɔ suoto dilabasinkple alɛɛ ee aka ntam di leyooto nii diidii, “Nwaako di SAATE Kplɛ nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa.” <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Diekye onyu konyu ma nta dikpile, diele dibiene; Yuda batii ba ninsi ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto kamawɔɔ di kapamii ku kɔka ɔkpɛ kanya ninaase di obe wɔ di bamuu lɛma bɛɛwɔɔ nii. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Mba nimatoso ni di kapamii kanya mandie ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto man-wa ni Yuda kasɔ suoto kamale batii basɛɛ. Ni di Yuda batii ba bamuu niebu basi ni nkpa, mba niakyɛ baalaasiɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto kamatofo otii wɔ ɔlaa nimabla ni ɔkpɛ nɛ- ole mi ee ole ma.<verse eid="JER 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />“SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ‘Nle mmle nimale dituosaa ninta ye alɛ kamananfi ye kootoko di lɛba le mmle nɛ, ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ nwaako dikpile nii ɔbla afunaa di suoto lee kamawa kaanya nɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamayɔ Farao Hofra nkpee di balo nɔɔ ba nikomiɛ nwɔ ni kukpi nnɛɛ, fɛ mmle okle layɔ Yuda ɔka Sedekia lakpee ni di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar nnɛɛ, lo wɔ niatoomiɛ nwɔ ni kukpi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Labuɛ Ɔlaa Aatɛ Aata Baruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia latɔkɔ ni Neria obisuɔtɔbi Baruk di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ, di Baruk lakpana ni sɛlaa se di Yeremia latoobuɛ ni di kukũ kamɛ aaloo ni sɛmaa: <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni afɔ, Baruk alɛ: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />Faabuɛ falɛ, ‘N-yɔɔsa! SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ sikududu owi ɛɛkyakaa di dibuo nii suoto; ditoobuo mi ku otuuni, nɔɔwɛ kafɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />SAATE nwu alɛ, “Buɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle fatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamatukusa lɛsaa le latofo ni n-yu, nin-sifi kafɔɔ lɛsaa le lasɔ ni di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Ni mɔ, foomiɛ asaa kplɛ fanta suoto lɛfɔ? Tammiɛ nya. Diekye kamayɔ ɔlaa kpile otũ n-wako di batii bamuu suoto, SAATE nwu niebuɛ, kafɔɔ kakɔ lele fɛɛkyɛ, kamata fɔ fantosoko nkpa lɛfɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s">Baalenkee Egipte Di Karkemis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ niawa kuata ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia kuakyeko ni nnle nwu suoto:<verse eid="JER 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Ɔlaa wɔ niekye ni Egipte suoto:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 46:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 46:2">Nnya ɔlaa di Egipte ɔka Farao Neko suoto, nnwɔ di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lalenkee ni di Karkemis di Eufrate Okle kotoko, di Yuda ɔka Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiakim sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ:<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Bilolaa kubiafunsaa lee, akplɛ ku abiibii akyuu nwu anyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">biedie bikyɛ kakpɛ!<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Binii bapɔnkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">bieyie bisiɛ ma di suoto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Bitukũ abɔɔsaa akoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">bieyila di nyilakɔ lee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Bilɔɔfɔ akplɔ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">biɛyɔ akpɛsaa lee bikpakũ!<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Obe kɔnya nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Lɛyɛkɛ ntɔɔpɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">nfɛ bookple sɛmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">batoolenkee bakpɛtɛ lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Bootoso ku nkye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">mɔnɔɔnyu ni sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">difu kafɔɔ nkpe di ɔfankyi biala,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 46:5">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />“Otii wɔ ninkpe ni sɛwa dilɔbafuo otoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">ee sientɛ atoso asifi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Baatuula baanɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">di katookasɔ di Eufrate Okle kotoko.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />“Owe ninle nnwɔ mmle nintaka ni fɛle Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">fɛle sekle se ntu nieyii ni?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Egipte ntaka fɛle Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">fɛle sekle se nieyii siɛwaalɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Ambuɛ alɛ, ‘Kamataka ntĩi kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">kamawɔɔsa sekpoo kplɛ ku batii ninwu bamuu.’<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Aye bapɔnkɔ, bikpee osie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Aye bakeke bakatɛ, bika ninunsɛɛ kanya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Aye bakpɛtɛ, bikyɛ sitũ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Etiopia ku Put batii ba ninkle ni kubiafunsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Ludi batii ba nintaa ni kɔtaa.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Kafɔɔ dii nwu nkpo ninle SAATE nwu lele, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">ɔbla-okyisa dii, diɛta ni ɔbla-okyisa di balo nɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Kapamii nwu kamabɛbɛɛ asaa ninaase di obe wɔ kabamiɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">ninaase di obe wɔ dibanɔɔ ka ni ɔkɔnsɔ ku ntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Diekye SAATE nwu, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kamata oleɔta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">di katookasɔ kasɔ suoto di Eufrate Okle kotoko.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />“Afɔ Kakpeelebitɛ Egipte Obisankobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">kata fakyɛ Gilead falaafũ kɔfa fifiale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Kafɔɔ kasakasa fɔɔkpɔɔtɔɔsa afatasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">flɔbawɛ difiɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Nnle nwu kamanu sinunsɔ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">kaku lɛfɔ owi kamayii kasɔ kamuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Kpɛtɛ onwii kamatuula di ɔbamba suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ kamannɔɔ.”<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnesar Kɔwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia aakyeko ni Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar di lɛwa le ɔɔwa ni Egipte ɔbadieko ni suoto alɛ:<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Buɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle di Egipte, faayie nwu lɛkya di Migdol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">yie nwu lɛkya kafɔɔ di Memfis ku Tahpanhes falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Bilolaa suoto biyila di n-yilakɔ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">diekye kapamii kɔmabɛbɛɛ batii ba niɛmana ye beekyi nii.’<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Lɛ oso babawakosa bakpɛtɛ lee kasɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Blɔbafuo oyila, diekye SAATE nwu kamatukusa ma antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Babatuula mankple mantuula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">man-nɔɔ mantika di bawo suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Bababuɛ alɛ, ‘Bitaka biɛta bupɛbukple busifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">awo bamu batii nfũ ku awo bamu katefa nsɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">buotoso banyinkatɛ loo kapamii nwu.’<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Nfa babafafaa alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">‘Kudu yiisatɛ lete di Egipte ɔka Farao nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">atooyu osuku onyu nɔɔ.’<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />“Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa,” Ɔka nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">nnwɔ leyooto ninle ni SAATE wɔ Ninlenke nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Otii onwii kamawa ate ni fɛle Tabor di abokote kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">fɛle Karmel wɔ di lekpo kotoko.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Aye ba ninsi ni di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">bisiisa asaa lee bita sɛlanle kamɛ osifi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">diekye Memfis kamabiɛ kuntɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">kunwɔɔ kunte kafɔɔ di batii dilɔbasiɛ ni ninwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />“Egipte nle lɛnankyuebi sanko le ninlɛ ni sekpeele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">kafɔɔ kabɔkɔbi ka nintaa ni lekye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">katookasɔ kɔɔwa di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Bakpɛtɛ ba eefũ bɔɔbla nwɔ ni ɔkpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">nte fɛle anankyuebi ya ninsi ni lɛla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Mma kafɔɔ babamunikĩi mantoso mansifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">blɔbayila kpinkpĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">diekye ɔlaa kpile otũ dii nfɛ kɔwa di suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">obe wɔ babananfi ma ni kootoko.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Egipte kamablɛlɛɛ fɛle kɔsanwu ko nikotoso nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">fɛ mmle di lo ntaka ni osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">babataka nwɔ di suoto ku nfɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">fɛle awoso babuditɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Babakpɛ lepoo nɔɔ nwu mantɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">nu dikpe opĩ.”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 46:23">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">“Bapɔ balenke atroee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">blɔbafuo ma ɔka.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Babakpee Egipte Obisankobi nwu sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">man-yɔ nwɔ mankpee di katookasɔ batii nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />SAATE, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ alɛ: “Nfɛ kɔbayɔ letokonanfi n-wako di Tebes yaa Amon suoto, Farao suoto, Egipte ku bayaa nɔɔ ku baka nɔɔ suoto, ku batii ba nietika ni disi di Farao suoto. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Kamayɔ ma nkpee di batii ba nikomiɛ ma ni olo nnɛɛ, nta Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ. Sɛmaa, akpakpa dite yi, batii kamawɛ di Egipte fɛ mmle diate ni saa,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kamadiki Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />“Oo kpɛmblatɛ nii Yakob, tanyɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">Oo Israel, tanta nnɛɛ lafee fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Nwaako kamadiki fɔ nkyeko kakyonkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">banantii lɛfɔ nkyeko sɛlanle lɛma kasɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yakob kamakple anwɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku kɔba lekpee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbayɛkɛsɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Oo kpɛmblatɛ nii Yakob, tanyɛkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">diekye nsiko fɔ,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“Kuntɛ lawɔɔsa nnle nwu mmuu fɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">di mbe kamɛ lasamiisa ye lakpete ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">nɔmawɔɔsa fɔ fɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Kamananfi fɔ kootoko, kafɔɔ di mmle diesiɛko ni kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">nɔmata fɔ fasifi nkpo alɛ ninanfi fɔ kootoko.”<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Ɔlaa Di Filisti Batii Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ niawa kuata ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia kuakye ni Filisti batii suoto fiɛ di Farao ladieko ni Gasa:<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Nyu mmle di ntu kobiɛ ninkye ni katookasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">dibakple atukɛ kplɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Ntu nwu kamabiɛ ninfe di kasɔ nwu ku lɛsaa biala ninsi ka kaamɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">sekpoo ku batii ba ninsi sĩ ni kaamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Batii nwu kamafaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">mba bamuu ninsi ni di kasɔ nwu suoto kamawi kaku,<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />nse bapɔnkɔ akpɔbi ya nikoyefe ni kaasɔ sɛlɔ kodie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">di balo nwu bakeke kudu kanya didie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ku nkpaa lɛma diwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Babi bate dilɔbamunikĩi bakyakaako babi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">nnɛɛ lɛma kamakpɔnɔɔ ninsaka.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Diekye dii nwu ntoowo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">alɛ baawɔɔsa Filisti batii bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">manwɔɔsa kafɔɔ mba niebu basi ni nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">baafuo ni Tiro ku Sidon ɔkyakaako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">SAATE nwu nfɛ kamawɔɔsa Filisti batii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">mba niebu basi ni nkpa, beekye ni Kaftor sekle kotoko.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Gasa kamakpaasu disi nɔɔ ansiɛ kaku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">Askelon kamalo kanana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Ao mba niebu basi ni di kasɔ lakataa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">ɔmɛmbe bibakyankya suoto lee minaase?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />“Fabafaa falɛ, ‘Ao, SAATE nwu kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">ɔmɛmbe dibadu fiɛ fabatɛ ɔnyɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Pɛfakple fasifi kotofo lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">diɛ, faate kloklo.’<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Kafɔɔ lɛ kabatɛ ɔnyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu niediki ka ni kanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">di obe wɔ eekpee ka ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">alɛ kadieko ni Askelon ku okle kotoko?”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Moab Ɔwɔɔsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Ɔlaa di Moab suoto:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:1">Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Nebo Yɔɔsa, diekye babawɔɔsa nwu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Babakpee Kiriataim sinunsɔ, mam-mufũ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">babakpee kawofakɔ nwu sinunsɔ, mantukusa ka mantɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Blɔbasintansa Moab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">batii kamakũ kanwumbe mantɔɔ ampɛ kaasɔ di Hesbon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">‘Biwa, biɛta buta kale nwu kawa kalookɔ.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Oo Madmen, aye kafɔɔ babata minlo kanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">kapamii kamatikanko ye.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Bikyɔɔ atoko bienu kaku ka nikodie kankye ni Horoniam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">asaa ɔlalaasa kaku kplɛ ku kawɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Bababibiɛ Moab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">babisɔ nɔɔ kamawi kaku.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Bɔɔkata manfe Luhit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">boowi kaku osie kanya bɔɔkata mankyɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">di osuku wɔ niesoo kuosifi ni Horonaim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">boonu ninyinyii kaku di kawɔɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Bitoso! Bitoso biefũ nkpa lee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">bibla fɛle lepoo di ɔfaafuu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Di obe wɔ bietika ni disi di sɛsaabla ku lɛsaawɛ lee suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">aye kafɔɔ babamufũ ye mansifiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Kemos kafɔɔ kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">diɛkyakaa ni di olebatatɛ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Asaawɔɔsatɛ nwu kamataka di okpoo biala suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">okpoo kuonwii batii kafɔɔ dilɔbatoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Babalalaasa ɔtaata nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">manwɔɔsa kafɔɔ abokote nwu nsintɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">diekye SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Biyɔ mmba bikpete di Moab suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">diekye abalalaa ante;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">sekpoo nɔɔ kamate sifukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">di otii kuonwii dilɔbabu aasiɛ sĩ ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />“Lɛkpaani ditika di otii wɔ nimbla ni nkyɔkɔ di Yaa ɔkpɛ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">Lɛkpaani ditika di otii wɔ ninanta kapamii nɔɔ lawii ni ntɔ kaasɔ suoto!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baawɔɔsa Moab Sekpoo Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />“Moab nte kloklo diɛyɔ ni di sibisɔ nɔɔ obe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">fɛle nta be beediɛ ni di dibukii nini kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">mananyɛɛnɛ mi ni di lɛkyafi ninwii kamɛ bakpete ni di lɛbamba kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">anadikyɛ ni sɛlanle kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Nkpo oso ɔmɛnɛfɛ nɔɔ nte fɛ mmle aate nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">ɔkɔnɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ diekyi.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Kafɔɔ obe kɔwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">“Kamakpee ni batii ba nimanyɛɛnɛ ni nta di akyafi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">maamanyɛɛnɛ nwɔ ni kafɔɔ manwii nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">babanyɛɛnɛ ninloo klekle di akyafi nɔɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">mambibiɛ kafɔɔ dikuuku nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Ni sinunsɔ kamakpɛ Moab di Kemos suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">fɛ mmle di sinunsɔ lakpɛ ni Israel batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">di obe wɔ baatika ni disi di Betel suoto.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />“Lɛ oso biobuɛ bilɛ, ‘Bakpɛtɛ bule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">batii ba niɛyakaya ni di kakpɛ kamɛ bule’?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Babawɔɔsa Moab manfũ kafɔɔ sekpoo nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">babakpaa bakosopo biene nwaa nɔɔ manaalo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">Ɔka wɔ leyooto ninle ni SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />“Moab kasɔ ɔpɛ ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">sɛlaa kpile otũ nɔɔ kamawa wla.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Biwi bitɔɔ, aye ba bamuu ninsi biekyi nwɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">aye ba bamuu nin-ye mmle eefũ ni leyooto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">bibuɛ bilɛ, ‘Lɛ nfɛ di kayofo nɔɔ siene nwu lefee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">lɛ nfɛ di ɔkyɛnwoso biene nɔɔ lefee!’<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />“Ao Dibon Okpeele kamɛ basiɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">soo di dibu kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ faawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">fabasiɛ di kasɔ fukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">diekye nnwɔ ninwɔɔsa ni Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">kamataka fɔ di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">anwɔɔsa kafɔɔ sekpoo kplɛ lɛfɔ siene nwu.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Yila di osuku kotoko faanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di Aroer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Kaalɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ nikotoso ni ku osanko nwu nikokusa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">kaalɛ ma falɛ, ‘Obe niɛwa?’<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Batookpee Moab sinunsɔ, diekye batoobibiɛ nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">Biwi kaku, biɛfafaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Biyie lɛkya di Arnon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">bilɛ batɔɔwɔɔsa Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />Lɛkanko ntɔɔwa di kobokote nsintɛɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:21">diɛta Holon, Yahsa ku Mefaat,<verse eid="JER 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />diɛta Dibon, Nebo ku Bet-Diblataim,<verse eid="JER 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />diɛta Kiriataim, Bet-Damul ku Bet-Meon,<verse eid="JER 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />diɛta Keriot ku Bosra-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:24">diɛta Moab sekpoo simuu, nse niekyo ni ku n-se niɛtɛɛtɛɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Batoobudi Moab lɛkyà beeyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">beefee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:25">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babawakosa Moab Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Bitɔɔ asiɛ nta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">diekye atɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa SAATE nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Bita Moab apɛamunu di alaa nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">bitɔɔ ale lɛmansaa.<verse eid="JER 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Diele Israel niale ye lɛmansaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">Bayu kamɛ baamufũ nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">oso fantukũnsa disi lɛfɔ di ditufa kanya di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">obe lele fɔɔkakatɛ di suoto nɔɔ?<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Diɛ okpoo lɛfɔ fatɛ faalaasiɛ di afuɔnkpaa kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di Moab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Te fɛle ablonima ya nimbla ni leyo nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">di ofuɔntuu kanya.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />“Butoonu Moab lɛkanta nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">suoto katoo ɔtakatɛ ku suoto otuo leyii nwɔ kamɛ pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">lɛkanta ku suoto katoo ɔtakatɛ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ku otu nɔɔ kamɛ suoto otuo nwu.<verse eid="JER 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />N-ye lɛsaatambu nɔɔ nwu kafɔɔ kakyɔnkyɔ dile,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:30">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">“lɛkanta nɔɔ nwu kafɔɔ diɛbla lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Nkpo oso kowi kaku nta Moab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">kowi nta Moab omuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">kowi sɛnyaami nta Kir-Heres basuɔtɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Kowi nta fɔ, fɛ mmle di Yaser n-wi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">Ao Sibma awosobi awoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Sɛla lɛfɔ lefukuti siɛlaadu bia lekpo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">siɛlaadu bia Yaser lekpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Asaalalaasatɛ nwu ntɔɔnɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">eetika di awosobi sɛɛle ku awosobi lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ́ nsinnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">di kɔba ku Moab afe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Ntɔɔta nta lebudi di nta n-wankɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">kuonwii dilosin-wa nta ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kudú.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Kuntɛ kudú nkpe yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">diele suoto lɛyɔɔ kudú kule.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />“Kaku lɛma owi kudú kodie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">kunkye Hesbon kun-wa Eleale ku Yahas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">kunkye Soar kunaadu bia Horonaim ku Eglat-Selisiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">diekye bia Nimrim sekle ntɔɔsɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Kamata kunloo Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">di mba ninta ni asaaɔta di ntakalekɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">manfiɛ ni kafɔɔ olufui manta ni bayaa lɛma,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:35">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />“Nioso otu nii n-wi sɛnyaami kunta Moab fɛle kakyukyoe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">kuowi sɛnyaami fɛle kakyukyoe kunta Kir-Hareset batii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">Lɛsaawɛ le baawɛ ni nsinnaa.<verse eid="JER 48:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Bɛɛkpaasu disi biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">beenwiɛ kafɔɔ okusu biala;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">bɛɛkyankya kɔnɛɛ biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">beenyukunsa ɔtɔ̀ biala kafɔɔ leboko.<verse eid="JER 48:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Di leyo lɛkyà biala osi di Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ku okpoo akpaka yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii nnaa dilenkee kaku owi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">diekye ntoobibiɛ Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">fɛle dibukii le di otii kuonwii diloomiɛ nii,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:38">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />“Nyu mmle atoobibiɛ nwɔ ni! Mmle boowi ni kaku!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">Nyu mmle di Moab lemunikĩisa ni kamaa nɔɔ ku sinunsɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Moab ntookple lɛmansaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">eekple ni lɛyɛkɛsaa ɛɛta ni batii ba ninsi beekyi nwɔ ni.”<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moab Dilɔbafuo Otoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">“Nyu lo! Klikpo onwii kosoo an-wa kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">oofukuti afoko nɔɔ antĩi Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Babamufũ Keriot mansifiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">manfũ kafɔɔ nwofakɔ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Di dii nwu nkpo kale Moab bakpɛtɛ situ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">kamate fɛle osanko wɔ di kolofo konu ni otu.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Babawɔɔsa Moab fɛ kale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">diekye aakpɔnɔfɔsa SAATE nwu.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Ao Moab batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">difu, dibiɔ ku dikyĩ nte ata fɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:43">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />“Otii lele nimatoso difu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">kamakpa ambuo di dibiɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">otii lele niɛkata eedie di dibiɔ nwu kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">dikyĩ kamamufũ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">diekye kamayɔ Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">lɛlɛɛ nɔɔ letokonanfi n-wako nwɔ di suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:44">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />“Batii ba nietoso ni kakpɛ banaa ni lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">nsi di Hesbon kunyii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">diekye ɔtɔ ntoodie kuokye Hesbon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ɔtɔ wɔ niekye ni Sihon kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">kunfiɛ Moab amɛ ku abokote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">bakantatɛ ba ninyiisa ni kudú disi akufi.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Ao afɔ Moab, yɔɔsa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Batɔɔwɔɔsa Kemos batii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">batɔɔkpaa babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ beesifiko sɛlanle kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">beemufũ kafɔɔ babisankobi lɛfɔ beesifiko.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />“Kafɔɔ kamakplesa Moab lɛlɛ ntɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">di ayi ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 48:47">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Nfũ di Moab lɛkanko lese nɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Letokonanfi Di Amon Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Ɔlaa di Amon batii suoto:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:1">Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Israel nnaa babisuɔtɔbi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Anaa atesaa baletɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Ni obe oso di Molek ntoofũ Gad ɛɛbla ole nwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Obe oso di batii nɔɔ nsi di sekpoo nɔɔ kamɛ?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Kafɔɔ obe kɔwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">“kamata ni kakpɛ kudú ndie ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">di Amon batii Raba suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">dibakple ni kawɔɔ ditii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">babakpee ni kafɔɔ sekpoenyii se niɛmana nwɔ siekyi ni ɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Nse Israel ntootososa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">batii ba niatososa nwɔ nii,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:2">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />“Ao Hesbon, biwi kaku, diekye batɔɔwɔɔsa Ai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Ao Raba batii, biyiisa kudu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Bi-nyukũ aboko biesiɛ kaku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">biekusa bife katoo ku kala di seyoyiɛ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">diekye Molek kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">diɛkyakaa ni di olebatatɛ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Obe oso biɔkanta di sɛtaata lee suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">biɔkanta di sɛtaata lee lɛlɛ suoto nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Oo onukwale ɔtanletɛ obisankobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">feetika disi di lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ suoto foobuɛ falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Owe nimadieko mi?’<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Kamata difu mpɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">dibakye ni batii ba bamuu niɛmana fɔ beekyi ni nfũ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:5">SAATE nwu, SAATE wɔ Nilenke ni niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">“Babatososa obiala lee minsifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbasiisa mba nietoso nii.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />“Kafɔɔ sɛmaa yi, kamakple n-se Amon batii lɛlɛ ɔyɔ ɔta ma,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:6">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Edom Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Ɔlaa di Edom suoto:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:7">Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Nilenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Ninumbe nsinnaa di Teman?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Banumbentɛ kɔkà ntɔɔwɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Ninumbe lɛma nwu ntooyu?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Aye ba ninsi ni di Dedan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">bimunikĩi bietoso bilaawofa di sifuɔntuu se niekyofo ni kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">diekye kamata ɔlaa kpile ntũ Esau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">di obe wɔ kamananfi nwɔ ni kootoko.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Nse awosobi basɛsɛɛtɛ lɛwa ɔkyɛ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">blɔbadiɛ awosobi kafui batɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Nse bayu lɛwa kayukɔ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">diele asaa ya boomiɛ ni di lɛpɔ kanya lete babayu?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Kafɔɔ kamadiki Esau lɛkyɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">kamatikiti nwofakɔ nɔɔ ntɛ kaayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">di mmle anaafuo ni suoto nɔɔ owofasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Babi nɔɔ, banantii nɔɔ ku mba ninsi bakaako nwɔ ni kamawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ ɔlɔbasinwɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Bidiɛ bakuɛbi lee bitɛ; kamanyu ma man-wɛ nkpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">Bakpisɔfɔ lee kafɔɔ kafuo mi disi otika.”<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “Nse mba ninankaatɛ alɛ baanyi ni di opũ nwu kamɛ lenyi mi, ni obe oso baadiɛ ma alɛ baananfi ma kootoko? Flɔbasifi alɛ baananfi fɔ kootoko. Kafɔɔ dikpeni feenyi mi. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Lɛka di suoto nii,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ, “alɛ Bosra kamakple kawɔɔ ku lɛyɛkɛsaa, lɛmansaa ku lɛkpaani; sekpoo ninwu simuu kafɔɔ kamawɔɔ sinte dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Ntoonu ɔlaa lekyeko SAATE nwu nfũ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Beediki otii beekpee nnle nwu alɛ baalaabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">“Bisiisa bawo biɛladieko nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Bitaka biɛkyɛ kakpɛ!”<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />“Nunua yi, kamabla fɔ fante bibii di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">babanyu fɔ nyakatãa di batii kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Difu le foonyu falɛ dikpe fɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ku otu lɛfɔ lɛkanta ntɔɔkyɔnkyɔ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">afɔ wɔ ninsi ni di afuɔnkpaa sebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">feediki ni kasiɛ di lekpenkpe takale osi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Nu fɛɛbla leyo lɛfɔ diɛtaka fɛ klikpo lele yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">kamakpakatɛ fɔ nkyeko nfa n-wako kasɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:16">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />“Edom kamakple lɛyɛkɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">dibabla mba bamuu ninwaalɛ manfe ni ninfa ɔkpɛ mantũkunsa asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">ta nkɔ ninwu mmuu oso.<verse eid="JER 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Fɛ mmle baawɔɔsa ni Sodom ku Gomora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">ku mba niasiɛ baakaako ma nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">nkpo di otii kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninfa nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">otii kuonwii dilɔbawɛ ninwu kamɛ.”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:18">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />“Fɛle mmle di kyata wɔ niekye Yordan lepookuu kamɛ ɔɔwa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">sɛfakaweekɔ ka ninsi ni lɛla yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">nkpo kamatososa Edom ndiki di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto di onumpoo lɛpɛ kamɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Owe ninle nnwɔ beediki ni alɛ kadiki nta ni nle mmle?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Owe ninte fɛle ami, abafuo mi ni kafɔɔ ɔwaaniiko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Ɔmɛ fosokpatɛ kafɔɔ nimafuo ɔtaka oyila mi di suoto?”<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Nkpo oso, binu lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu ntɔɔtɛ ni ɔbla di Edom suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">disibu le atɔɔbla ni di mba ninsi ni di Teman suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Babawududusa bafoso mbitɛ mansifiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">abawɔɔsa sɛfakaweekɔ lɛma nwu klekle ta mma oso.<verse eid="JER 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Lɛnɔɔ lɛma nwu kudú kamata kasɔ ntũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:21">kaku owi lɛma kamadie ninaadu Lekpo Sɛɛle.<verse eid="JER 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Binyu lo! Klikpo onwii kamasoo an-wa kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">anfukuti afoko nɔɔ antĩi Bosra suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">Di dii nwu nkpo kale, Edom bakpɛtɛ situ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">kamate fɛle osanko wɔ di kolofo konu ni otu.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Damasko Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Ɔlaa di Damasko suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Nnɛɛ ntoofee Hamat ku Arpad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">diekye batoonu ɔlaa kpile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Otu ntɔɔkpà ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">diokpee ma ni kubuɛ fɛle lekpo le ninantɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Damasko ntɔɔbla kpiɛkpiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">atoomunikĩi alɛ ootoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">lɛyɛkɛ kafɔɔ ntoomufũ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">ninyinyii ku dibuo ntoolenkee nwɔ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">diobuo nwɔ fɛle osanko wɔ di kolofo konu nii.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Batosĩ okpoo kplɛ nwu niefũ ni leyooto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">okpoo wɔ suoto nin-nya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Nwaako, babalo bakosopo nɔɔ mantɛ di akpaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ kamalo kanana di dii nwu nkpo suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:26">SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />“Kamakpee Damasko seyoyiɛ ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">kubafiɛ Ben-Hadad lɛsaawɛ nwu.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Kedar Kɔna Ku Hasor Okpoo Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Ɔlaa di Kedar ku Hasor sɛka nlekɔ suoto, mbe di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ladieko nii:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Bitaka, biedieko Kedar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">biɛwɔɔsa kufĩkantunkɔ batii nwu.<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Babafũ akpanta ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">babatuka akpaayo lɛma mansifiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">diɛkyakaa ni di atoo lɛma ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Batii kamayiisa kudú mantɔkɔ ma alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">Difu nkpe di ɔfankyi biala!’<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />“Bitoso wala bisifi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">Aye ba ninsi ni di Hasor, bisiɛ di afuɔntuu kyofole kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:30">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">“Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ntookũ kanwumbe di suoto lee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">atɔɔbla disibu kpile di suoto lee.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />“Bitaka biedieko kale ka ninte ni buɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">nka niediki suoto atoko kasi ni,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:31">SAATE nwu niebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">“kale ka ninaa ni n-yoko ee abɔɔsaa sewoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">batii nɔɔ lete ninsi.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo kamakple kakpɛ kamɛ asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">banankyue ɔlambu lɛma kamakple ayusaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Kamasamiisa mba ninkpe ni di nkyonkɔ nkpete di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">ninta kafɔɔ ɔlaa kpile ntũ ma di ɔfankyi biala,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:32">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />“Hasor kamakple lepoo kamɛ baweewee kasiɛkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">lɛba le di batii dilɔbasinwɛ ni dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">otii kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Elam Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Nnya SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ niawa kuata ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia aakyeko ni Elam suoto, di Yuda ɔka Sedekia sɛka ole kasɔkayekɔ kamɛ:<verse eid="JER 49:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">“Nyu lo, kamafee Elam kɔtaa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:35">kɔtaa ko niɛta ma bakpe ni osie.<verse eid="JER 49:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Kamayɔ afɛɛfɔ ana ya niekye ni osi nsiɛkɔ nna nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">n-wako di Elam suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">kamasamiisa ma nkpete di afɛɛfɔ nwu ana kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">ni kale kukanwii dilɔbawɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">di Elam balanle dilɔbakyɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 49:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Kamakpee Elam lɛyɛkɛ di balo nɔɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">di batii ba nintikanko alɛ boolo ma ni anu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">kamata ɔlaa kpile ntũ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">bia lɛblɔfiɛ nii yakayaka,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:37">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">“Kamatikanko ma ku kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">ninaase di obe wɔ kamata kunloo ma nii.<verse eid="JER 49:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Kamase lɛkakpomii nii di Elam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">nin-wɔɔsa ɔka ku banɔɔfotii,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:38">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />“Kafɔɔ di obe owo nikɔwa ni kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">kamakplesa Elam lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ ntɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 49:39">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Baafũ Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia suoto aakyeko ni Babel ku Babel batii kasɔ suoto alɛ:<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Bibuɛ, bieyie lɛkya di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">bitakatɛ flankaa katoo bieyie nwu lɛkya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">bitanwofasa lɛsalɛsaa, kafɔɔ bibuɛ bilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">‘Babafũ Babel;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">babakpee Bel sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">difu kamapɛ Marduk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Babakpee asaa atembi nɔɔ nwu sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">difu kafɔɔ kamapɛ afiɔtii nɔɔ nwu.’<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Kale kawo ka niekye ni katookasɔ kamadieko nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">kamalalaasa kasɔ nɔɔ antɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninka suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">batii ku babɔkɛɛ, akyuu nwu anyɔ kamatoso mansifi.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Okple Ɔwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />“Di ayi nwu kamɛ, di obe nwu kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">“Israel batii ku Yuda batii kamasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">mankyɛ ku nnumɛɛ manaawolaa SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu.<verse eid="JER 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Babakaalɛ osuku wɔ manfe mansifi ni Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">mammunikĩisa anu lɛma mankyɔɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Babawa mamanii mankaa di SAATE nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">di kanya ninii ka ninaa ni kaloo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">ka manamayee ni diidii.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />“Batii nii lale bafoso ba niayu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">bafoso bakpatɛ lɛma laleko ma katũ baakyu osuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">ni baata ma baakyɛ baakyikyii di abokote nwu suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Baalalaa baakyi abokote ku akpenkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">ni baayee mma bamu ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Otii lele niɛnya ma mbɛbɛɛ ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">balo lɛma labuɛ alɛ, ‘Buole lɛpɔɔ bakpitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">diekye baabla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto, nwaako sɛfakaweekɔ lɛma nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">SAATE nwu, bate lɛma osuku onyu nwu.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />“Bitoso bidie di Babel;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">bidie di Babel batii kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">biɛbla fɛle batie ba ninleko ni bafoso katũ.<verse eid="JER 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Diekye kamasɛnkɛsa nnle siene akudi kplɛ awo nkyeko katookasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">n-wako di Babel suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Babayɔ akpɛsaa lɛma di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">katookasɔ kafɔɔ babakye mamamufũ nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Akplɔ lɛma kamate fɛle bakpɛtɛ ba ninkpe ni lɛsaatofo di akplɔ ɔtaa kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">manampɛbaakple ni ku nnɛɛ fukuti.<verse eid="JER 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Nioso babafũ Babel batii kakpɛ kamɛ asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">mba bamuu nimafũ nwɔ ni kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kamamiɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 50:10">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babel Okpoo Obiɛ</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />“Ta biɔpɔ̀, minnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">aye ba nikoyu ni atesaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">ta biokpee kɔkyɔ minkyi ni fɛle nankyue-sanko wɔ nikowee ni kamɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">biɔfafaa ni kafɔɔ fɛle bapɔnkɔ-suɔtɔ oso yi,<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />sinunsɔ kamakpɛ yaaye osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">mankpee nnwɔ nielofo ye ni sinunsɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Abale ɔyɛntɛle di nnle kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">lepookuu, kasɔ kosole ku ɔfaafuu.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Ta SAATE nwu ɔblɔ oso yi, otii kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ nwɔ kaamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">kafɔɔ bababla nwɔ ante ofukuti diesifi nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Lɛyɛkɛ kamapɛ batii ba bamuu ninfe ni di Babel mankpa sinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">ta nkɔ nɔɔ nwu mmuu oso.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />“Aye ba bamuu nintaa ni kɔtaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">biyila bikyi Babel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Bitaa nwɔ! Bitantaa akplɔ kuanwii biayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">diekye aabla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Biyiisa kudu bikpee nwɔ di ɔfankyi biala!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">Atɔɔta disi, ayo takale nɔɔ nwu ntɔɔnɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">seyoyiɛ nɔɔ ntoobiɛ site kaasɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Di nle mmle nle ni SAATE nwu ɔbla okyisa oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">bibla nwɔ bikyisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">biblɔɔ fɛ mmle aabla ni bawo nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Biwɔɔsa alesaa-kpeetɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">ku asaafiɛlɛtɛ ku kasaka nɔɔ bidiki di Babel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Ta nyinkatɛ nwu kapamii oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">otii biala apɛakple asifi nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ batii nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">di otii biala atoso asifi nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔpɛokple Osifi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />“Israel nle bafoso ba bɛɛsamiisa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">di bakyata latososa baasifiko nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Nnwɔ niakasa nwɔ ni ɔbɛbɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">niale Asiria ɔka nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">nnwɔ niayɛntɛ nwɔ ni akufi obibiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">niale Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar nɛ.”<verse eid="JER 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Kamananfi Babel ɔka ku kasɔ nɔɔ kootoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:18">fɛ mmle lananfi ni Asiria ɔka kootoko.<verse eid="JER 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Kafɔɔ kamakplesa Israel n-wako alesaa nɔɔ kalekɔ kamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">amale asaa di Karmel ku Basan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:19">abawɛ anle ammiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">di Efraim ku Gilead akpenkpe suoto.<verse eid="JER 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Di ayi nwu kamɛ, di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">“bababuo di Israel lɛpɔɔ okpi kamɛ mannyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">kafɔɔ kuonwii dilɔbawɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">bababuo kafɔɔ di Yuda sikpile kamɛ mannyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">kafɔɔ blɔbanya kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">diekye kamayɔ nkyɛ mba lediɛ bɛɛwɛ ni nkpa.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lɛkanko Di Babel Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />“Bidieko Merataim kasɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">ku mba ninsi ni di Pekod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Bitikanko, bielo, biɛwɔɔsa ma fɛɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 50:21">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">Bibla lɛsaa biala lɛtɔkɔ ye ni.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Kakpɛ kudú nkpe di kasɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">kawɔɔ kplɛ kudú kule!<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Nyu mmle di kasɔ kamuu ntɔɔlalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">keebibiɛ, kɛɛkpakpaa ni lo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Nyu mmle di Babel nte ni ofukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">di nnle nwu kamɛ lo!<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Oo Babel, lɛkyɔɔ fɔ okũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">ni kuamufũ fɔ fiɛ faatofo nwu ole nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">ni baanya fɔ baamufũ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">ta faakyidi ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa oso.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />SAATE nwu ntɔɔsɛkɛtɛ akpɛsaa nɔɔ katɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">eedieko ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ akpɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">diekye SAATE Kplɛ wɔ Ninlenke ni nkpe ɔkpɛ ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">di Babel batii kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Bikye kakyonkɔ biwa nwɔ di suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Bibiɛ bibio di alesaa nɔɔ ntɛkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">bikyankyii nwɔ bitɛ fɛle alesaa ya beesiisa bɛɛtɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Biwɔɔsa nwɔ fɛɛ, bitandiɛ otii kuonwii kafɔɔ aawɛ nkpa atɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Bilo banankyue-suɔtɔ nɔɔ bamuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">bita ma basoo basifi babɔkɛɛ kalokɔ nwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Bayɔɔsa! Diekye dii lɛma nwu ntoowo ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">obe wɔ dikaatɛ alɛ baananfi ma ni kootoko.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Bikyɔɔ batosotɛ ku batanikotɛ ba niekye ni Babel atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">boobuɛ ni di Sion</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">mmle di SAATE Yaa loo nwu ntɔɔbla ni ɔbla okyisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">ɔbla okyisa kuɔta ni olekatakɔ nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />“Bilɛɛ akplɔ bataatɛ di Babel suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">aye ba bamuu nintaa ni kɔtaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Bimana nwɔ omuu bikyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">bitanta kuonwii latoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Bitɔɔ letota di sɛsaabla nɔɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">biblɔɔ fɛ mmle atɔɔbla ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Diekye atɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa SAATE nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">Israel Klekletɛ nwu.<verse eid="JER 50:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Nkpo oso, bakosopo nɔɔ kamakpi mante di akpaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ kamalo kanana di dii nwu nkpo suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 50:30">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Oo afɔ wɔ nintakatɛ ni suoto katoo, nyu lo, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">SAATE nwu, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“diekye dii lɛfɔ nwu ntoowo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">obe wɔ dikaatɛ alɛ baananfi fɔ ni kootoko.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Otii wɔ nintakatɛ ni suoto katoo kamatuula annɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbakyakaako nwɔ ataka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">kamakɛsɛɛsa ɔtɔ di sekpoo nɔɔ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">nnwɔ nimafiɛ batii ba bamuu niɛmana nwɔ beekyi nii.”<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“Beenyinka Israel batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">ku Yuda batii kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Bamufũtɛ lɛma lemufũ ma osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">beesĩ alɛ bloodiɛ ma basifi.<verse eid="JER 50:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Kafɔɔ dikitɛ lɛma nkpe osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">Leyooto nɔɔ ninle SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Nnwɔɔ nimakpɛ osie kanya anta ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">alɛ aayɔ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ anwako di kasɔ lɛma suoto nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">kafɔɔ ɔlɔbata batii ba ninsi ni di Babel ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Kapamii di Babel batii suoto!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">SAATE nwu niebuɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">“di mba ninsi ni di Babel suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">ku banɔɔfotii ku banumbentɛ nɔɔ suoto!<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Kapamii di balaatɛ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Babakple babuutɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Kapamii di bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Difu kamayii ma kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Kapamii di bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke nɔɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">ku bafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ ba bamuu ninsi ni di kamɛ nɔɔ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Bɔɔwa basanko ɔbakple.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Kapamii di lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Babayɔ asaa lɛma fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Koleele kudie di ntu nɔɔ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Sekle nɔɔ kamasɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Diekye afiɔ kasɔ kale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">afiɔ ya nimabuo ni afĩi ku difu.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />“Nioso ɔfaafuu kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ku lepoo kamɛ baweewee kamasiɛ ninfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">nfa kafɔɔ di asukusuku kamasiɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Batii dilɔbasinsiɛ ninwu kamɛ diidii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">ee basiɛ ninwu kamɛ diɛyɔ ni di kɔna diesifi ni kɔna.<verse eid="JER 50:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Fɛ mmle di Yaa lawɔɔsa ni Sodom ku Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">diɛkyakaa ni di sekpoo se niakaako ma ni,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 50:40">SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">“nkpo di otii kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninfa nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">otii kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Nyu lo! Bakpɛtɛ banwii lekye katookasɔ bɔɔwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">kale kplɛ ku baka kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">kodie mankye kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ man-wa.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Bakpakũ kɔtaa ku akplɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">bakpe amumu, mananya ni kafɔɔ nyaami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Kudú lɛma kodie fɛle lekpo le nikɔpɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">nse basi di bapɔnkɔ lɛma suoto bɔɔwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">bɔɔwa fɛ basuɔtɔ ba nikpe ni di kakpɛ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">alɛ bɔɔbadieko fɔ nii, Oo Babel Obisankobi.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Babel ɔka ntonu sɛlaa eekyeko suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ni di nnɛɛ lefee nwɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Lɛyɛkɛ lɛpɛ nwɔ osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">oonu dibuo fɛle osanko wɔ di kolofo koonu nii.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />Fɛle kyata wɔ nikoedie ankye ni Yordan lepookuu kamɛ an-wa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">sɛfakaweekɔ ka ninsi ni lɛla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Kamatososa Babel di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto di ninumpoo lɛpɛ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Owe ninle nnwɔ beediki ni alɛ kadiki nwɔ nta ni nle mmle?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Owe ninte fɛle ami, owe kafɔɔ nimafuo mi oyilako?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Ɔmɛ fosokpatɛ kafɔɔ nimafuo mi oyila di suoto?”<verse eid="JER 50:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Nkpo oso, binu disibu le di SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla ni di Babel suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">lɛsaa le atɔɔtɛ ni ɔbla di Babel batii kasɔ suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Babawududusa bafoso mbitɛ mansifiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">abawɔɔsa sɛfakaweekɔ lɛma nwu klekle ta mma oso.<verse eid="JER 50:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Kasɔ kamatukũ ta Babel omufũ kudú didie oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:46">kaku nɔɔ owi kamadie kanaadu nnle nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lakple Aananfi Babel Kootoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Nyu lo, kamadieko asaawɔɔsatɛ ninwuna nwu nkpee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">di Babel ku Kaldea batii suoto.<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Kamakpee bafɔɔ manaafɛɛlɛ Babel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">manwɔɔsa kafɔɔ kasɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">babadieko nwɔ di ɔfankyi biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">di ɔlaa kpile otũ nɔɔ dii suoto.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Bitanta kɔtaa taatɛ nwu lataa kɔtaa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">ee biatɔɔ aanĩi akpakyaa nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Bitandiɛ bakosopo nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">biwɔɔsa bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ nwu klekle.<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Babanɔɔ kakpɛ mante di Babel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">babafũ nkɔ osie kanya di akpaka nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Diekye Yaa lɛma, SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">diesĩ Israel ku Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">nu di kasɔ lɛma leyii ku lɛpɔɔ okpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">di Israel Klekletɛ nwu anu.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />“Bitoso bidie di Babel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Bitoso biefũ nkpa lee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Bitanta baawɔɔsa ye ta sikpile nɔɔ oso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">SAATE nwu ɔbla okyisa obe ntoowo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">abatɔɔ letota di lɛsaa le niesiɛko nwɔ nii.<verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babel lale koto sɛɛle opũ di SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">aata kasɔ nwu kamuu lanyi baasiɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Nnle lanyi nta nɔɔ nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">nkpo oso batoobuo afĩi nɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babel kamanɔɔ ambibiɛ di obe kakui kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">Biwi kaku osie kanya di suoto nɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Bimiɛ kɔfa fifiale bififia nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">loobia dibayɔɔ nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />“ ‘Nse butabayɔɔsa Babel ofiɛ fiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">kafɔɔ ofiɛ dilɔbafuo nwɔ ɔyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">bita budiɛ nwɔ di obiala asifi nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">diekye lɛkanko nɔɔ ntoodu kolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">diɛtaka katoo fɛ alokonkyɛ.’<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />“ ‘SAATE nwu ntɔɔta wo lɛbɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">biwa, biɛta bubuɛ di Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">lɛsaa le di SAATE Yaa loo ntɔɔbla ni.’<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />“Bilɔɔfɔ akplɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">biyɔ kubiafunsaa nwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">SAATE nwu ntootũkunsa Media batii baka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">diekye disitikasaa nɔɔ ninle alɛ aawɔɔsa Babel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">SAATE nwu kamabla ankyisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">ɔbla okyisa diɛta ni olekatakɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Bitakatɛ flankaa katoo di Babel seyoyiɛ suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Bikpee banyuntɛ nwu osie bikyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">biɛyɔ banyuntɛ nwu bisesee di nyilakɔ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">bielolaa suoto bita kalà ɔte!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">SAATE nwu kamabla di disitikasaa nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">ɔsaabla nɔɔ di Babel batii suoto.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Aye ba ninsi ni di sekle kpinwu kotoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">dilɛ ye ni di lɛsaawɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">kalookɔ lee ntoowo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">obe wɔ bababudi ye man-yu nii.<verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni ntɔɔka di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">Nwaako kamayɔ batii kpinwu mmayiisa ye kamɛ fɛ atroe ɔlambu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">mamayiisa lelenkee kudú di suoto lee.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu Kuɔta Ni Yaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />“Osie nɔɔ aayɔ aabla kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">ninumbe nɔɔ aayɔ aabla kayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">ni aayɔ lɛsɔnu nɔɔ aablɛfɛsa osi nɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Nse eekpududuu, ntu be di osi nkumii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">anta alokonkyɛ ntaka ankye kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Anta ɔplalaa mmunaa ku kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">andieko afɛɛfɔ kafɔɔ ankyeko asaantɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />“Otii biala dieye lɛsaa, banaa ni kafɔɔ lɛsaatofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">kotosɛɛle asaatukatɛ biala afiɔ nkpee nwɔ sinunsɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Kakyɔnkyɔ lete ninle atembi nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">ninwuna kuninwii diesi nya.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Anaa ɔnyɛɛ, amansaa ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">babawɔɔ, nse lɛkanko lɛma lewo.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Nnwɔ ninle ni Yakob Ole diete fɛle mba mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">diekye nnwɔɔ ninle asaa amuu Blatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">di atesaa kɔna nɔɔ nwu nkyakaa nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni ninle nwɔ leyooto.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Ɔmankyi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />“Afɔ ninle mi kakpɛ kawosokuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">lɛkpɛsaa nii diɛta ni kakpɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ nnle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">afɔ nin-yɔ nwɔɔsa sɛkanlekɔ,<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ pɔnkɔ ku siɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ keke ku katɛ,<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ osuɔtɔ ku osanko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ ɔnɔɔfo ku obisɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ okosopo ku okpeele,<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ fosokpatɛ ku bafoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ fekpɛntɛ ku banankyue-suɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">afɔ nin-yɔ mbibiɛ abaa ku banɔɔfotii.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babel Letokonanfi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />“Kamata Babel letota di anu lee ku mba bamuu ninsi ni di Babel kamɛ di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla wɔ omuu baabla ni di Sion,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />“N-yɛ fɔ di suoto, Oo afɔ asaawɔɔsatɛ kobokote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">afɔ wɔ niɛwɔɔsa ni kasɔ kamuu,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 51:25">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">“Kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">nimmunusa fɔ nkpakatɛ di lɛkyɛlɛlɛɛ suoto fampɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">mbla fɔ kobokote ko niefiɛ nii.<verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Blɔbayɔ difuɔ lɛfɔ kuninwii babla leyokɔdifuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">ee bayɔ difuɔ kuninwii babla lɛsɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">diekye fabate ofukuti dinaa ni kaloo,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 51:26">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />“Bitakatɛsa flankaa katoo di kasɔ nwu suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Bifɛ dikyikyoo di nnle nwu kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Bilolaa nnle nwu bita kakpɛ di suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">bilɛɛ Ararat, Mini ku Askenas:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">sɛkanlekɔ be mmle baataka di suoto nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Bidiki kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ di suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">bidiki bapɔnkɔ fɛle atroe ɔlambu bikpee nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Bilolaa nnle nwu bita kakpɛ di suoto nɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">Medes baka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">abaa kanyabayilatɛ lɛma ku banɔɔfotii lɛma bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">ku nnle be mmuu suoto boole ni sɛka.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Kasɔ nwu kotũkũ kannu kafɔɔ dibuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">diekye SAATE nwu disibu le ɛɛbla ni di Babel batii suoto lɛbla kpinkpĩ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">alɛ aalalaasa Babel kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">alɛ otii kuonwii dilaasiɛ ni ninfa.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Babel bakpɛtɛ ntoodiɛ ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">bɛɛka basi di nwofakɔ lɛma nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Osie lɛma ntooloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">nfɛ bate fɛle basanko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Batookpee nsiɛkɔ lɛma nwu ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">n-yoko nɔɔ abɔɔsaa sewoso ntoofefee.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Tosotɛ onwii ntoso anaakyakako ɔbamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">tɔkyɛntɛ onwii kafɔɔ ntikanko tɔkyɛntɛ bamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">manaatɔkɔ Babel ɔka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">alɛ batoofũ okpoo kplɛ nɔɔ omuu.<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Batoofũ sekle ntaalɛkɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">bekpee kafɔɔ afɔ-nsɔ mmuu ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">difu kafɔɔ ntɔɔpɛ bakpɛtɛ nwu.”<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Babel Obisankobi nwu nte fɛle kakpaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">di obe wɔ baananafu ka nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">dilɔbaklɛ di obe wɔ babafiɛlɛ nwɔ ni kamawo.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />“Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ntɔɔbɛbɛɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">atookpee wo di kakpɔkpɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">atɔɔbla wo lebo fukuti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Atɔɔmɛ wo fɛ kɔsanwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">ninfɛ atɔɔlɛ alesaa mɛnɛmɛnɛ loo eeyiisa kafutu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">ni atootufa wo eeyu nɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Amumu ya bɛɛbla ni suoto loo sina ditika di Babel suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">batii ba ninsi ni di Sion niebuɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Ntɔ loo ditika di batii ba ninsi ni di Babel suoto,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">Yerusalem niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kamakyakaako Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Nyu lo, kamafũ ɔlaa lee nta ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">nimbla ɔbla nkyisa nta ye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">kamata lekpo nɔɔ nsɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">ninta kafɔɔ ntu ntaakɔ nɔɔ nsɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babel kamakple kawɔɔ lefleku ante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">lepoo kamɛ baweewee kasiɛkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">lɛyɛkɛsaa ku lɛmansaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">lɛba le di otii kuonwii diesi nii.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Batii nɔɔ bamuu kokumii fɛle bakyata bisɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">bɔɔfafaa fɛle bakyata abi.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Kafɔɔ nse alesaa nkle ma ɔkɔnsɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">kamatũ opunu nta ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ninta mannyi man-siɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">alɛ baayiisa kudu ku sɛma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">n-se batoote bɛɛkyɔsĩi dinaa ni kaloo, manamasintaka ni kafɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 51:39">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />“Kamasooko ma nwako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">fɛle afosobi ya boofe ni olo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">fɛle akunumuu ku batie.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛsaa Le Nimawa Ni Di Babel Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />“Binyu mmle babamufũ ni Sesak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">kasɔ nwu kamuu lɛkanta nwu kamanii!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Binyu mmle di Babel kamakple ni lɛyɛksaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">di nnle nwu kamɛ!<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Lekpo kamataka di Babel suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">afuuta nini kamatĩi nwɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Sekpoo nɔɔ kamate sifukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">ɔfaafuu ku kasɔ kosole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">kasɔ ka di otii kuonwii diesi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">kasɔ ka suoto di otii kuonwii ninfe akyɛ ni osuku.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Kamananfi Bel kootoko di Babel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">kamatɔɔ kafɔɔ antufa lɛsaa le aamɛ ni andiki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">nnle nwu kafɔɔ dilɔbasintu bakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Babel seyoyiɛ nwu kafɔɔ kamabiɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />“Batii nii, bidie di kamɛ nɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Bitoso biefũ nkpa lee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Bitoso di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ yakayaka nfũ.<verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Bitanta otu lakpa ye ee biayɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">nse bienu sɛlaa se ninante ni nkpo di kasɔ nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">ɔlaa wɔ ninante ni nkpo n-wa lɛlɛɛ le mmle, ɔbamba lɛlɛɛ bamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">amumu sɛlaa se ninante ni nkpo di kasɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">ɔka kafɔɔ ntaka di ɔka suoto.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Diekye nwaako obe nwu kamawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">kamananfi ni Babel afiɔ kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">babakpee kasɔ nɔɔ kamuu sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">batii nɔɔ ba beelo ni kafɔɔ kamate di kamɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Ni osi ku kasɔ ku asaa ya amuu ninsi nya ni kaamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">kamayiisa kudu man-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Babel suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">diekye asaa bawɔɔsatɛ kamakye katookasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">man-wa mamadieko nwɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 51:48">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />“Dikpeni Babel lebiɛ ta Israel batii ba baalo ni oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">fɛ mmle okle baalo ni batii di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">baanɔɔ ni kakpɛ ta Babel oso.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaa Wɔ Aata Ni Israel Batii Ba Niawɛ Ni Di Babel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Aye ba niatoso ni kapamii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">bidie bisifi, batanyila kafɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Binyuma SAATE nwu di kasɔ fanfa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">biebu disi di Yerusalem suoto.”<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />“Beekpee wo sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">diekye batootufa wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">sinunsɔ kafɔɔ letĩi wo anu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">diekye bafɔɔ ntoobuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">SAATE nwu leyo kakleklekɔ nwu.”<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />“Kafɔɔ obe kɔwa,” SAATE nwu niebuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">“kamananfi ni afiɔ nɔɔ nwu kootoko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">di kasɔ nɔɔ kamuu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">mba niefũ ni nkɔ kafɔɔ kamatuni.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Nse Babel lekple katoo eedu bia kolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">eeta nwofakɔ takale nɔɔ nwu lɛwɛ osie yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">kamakpee asaabawɔɔsatɛ di suoto nɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="JER 51:53">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babel Ɔwɔɔsa Ɔkyakaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />“Kaku owi kudú kodie kunkye Babel kun-wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">kawɔɔ kplɛ kudú</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">niekye ni Babel batii kasɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />SAATE nwu kamawɔɔsa Babel;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">abalosa kudú oyiisa nɔɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Balo afɛɛfɔ ɔkpɛ kamataka fɛle okle kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">sɛlɔ lɛma dikumii kamadie osie kanya.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Asaawɔɔsatɛ kamawa di Babel suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">babamufũ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">manfefee kafɔɔ kɔtaa lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Diekye SAATE nwu ninle Yaa wɔ nimbla ankyisa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">abata letota di nimu kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Kamata banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku banumbentɛ nɔɔ nnyi mansiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">diɛkyakaa ni di abaa kanyabayilatɛ, banɔɔfotii ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">babakyɔsĩi dinaa ni kaloo manamasinsɛnkɛ ni kafɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">Ɔka nwu niebuɛ, nnwɔ leyooto ninle ni SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Bababiɛ Babel oyoyiɛ nwu ninkpe ni opĩ mantɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">mankpee kafɔɔ n-yoko takale nɔɔ nwu ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">batii nwu kokpee suoto lɛma dibuo kasakasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">kale nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla nle ntɔɔni diɛta ɔtɔ ofiɛ.”<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Yeremia Ɔlaa Baakyesee Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Yeremia lata ni kpɛmblatɛ Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi Neria wɔ niale ni Seria obisuɔtɔbi, di obe wɔ aakyɛ ni Babel ku Yuda ɔka Sedekia di sɛka olebee nɔɔ lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Yeremia lakpana sɛlaa kpile otũ se simuu nimawa ni di Babel suoto aakpee di kukũ kamɛ- asaa ya amuu baatɛ ni nsũ di Babel suoto. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Ni aatɔkɔ Seraia alɛ, “Nse feebuo Babel yi, nyu falɛ fɛɛka sɛlaa se mmle simuu osie kanya. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Ni faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Oo SAATE, faabuɛ falɛ fabawɔɔsa lɛba le mmle, alɛ otii ee bɔkɛɛ kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ nini kamɛ; dibate difukuti dinaa ni kaloo.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Nse fɛɛka kukũ ko mmle feeloo yi, faanĩi difuɔ fakaasa ninkũ suoto faafuki kũ fakpee di Eufrate okle kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nkpo di Babel kamamɛɛ alɛ alaasintaka diidii ta sɛlaa kpile otũ se kamayɔ nwako nwɔ ni di suoto oso. Batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamanɔɔ.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Yeremia sɛlaa lese ninfũ.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Ɔnɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Afosi-anyɔ lɛlɛɛ ninwii di Sedekia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Hamutal wɔ niale ni Yeremia obisankobi; ɔsanko nwu lakye Libna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Ni di ɔka Sedekia labla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle okle di Yehoiakim labla ni nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Ta SAATE nwu ɔblɔ oso di asaa ya mmle amuu lawa di Yerusalem ku Yuda suoto, ni di kayɛntɛkɔ yi, aatososa ma di anu nɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Ninfɛ di Sedekia lataka di Babel ɔka suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JER 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Nioso, di Sedekia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ naasinle, dii fosile suoto, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ yi, Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lataka di Yerusalem suoto ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu. Baabla kasiɛkɔ di okpoo kplɛ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ, ni baabla oyoyiɛ abiɛsaa baakyisa nwu omuu nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Baamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi dialaase di Ɔka Sedekia lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ.<verse eid="JER 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Di dii naasinle suoto di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ naafa kamɛ yi, kɔka ɔkpɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie alɛ alesaa ditawɛ di batii kale nii. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Ninfɛ baabiɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu oyoyiɛ baabuo, ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu latoso baasifi nɛ. Kakyɛ baadie di okpoo kplɛ nwu baafe di kayoko ka di eyoyiɛ ɛnyɔ be niakaako ni ɔka kɔba obo baasifi, nu di Babel batii lamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi. Baatoso baakyɔɔ anu Araba lɛkyɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Kafɔɔ Babel batii bakpɛtɛ lati Ɔka Sedekia ni baalaatũ nwɔ di Yeriko kasɔ lɛtaata nɛ. Bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu labla di suoto nɔɔ, baasamii, <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />ni baamufũ nwɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:9">Baakpaa nwɔ baakyɛnko Babel ɔka di Ribla di Hamat kasɔ suoto, di lɛba le aalo nwɔ ni lɛpɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Ni di Babel ɔka lalo Sedekia babisuɔtɔbi di anu nɔɔ ninfa di Ribla nɛ; aalo kafɔɔ Yuda banɔɔfotii bamuu. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Ninfɛ aabɔkɔtɛ Sedekia anumbi, aaninii nwɔ ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle sɛkpɛnkyɛ, aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko Babel, di lɛba le aatɛ nwɔ ni di leyokatenkɔ dialaase ni di dikpiyi nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Ɔwɔɔsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Di Israel Batii kɔwɛntɛ nɔnle dii fosile suoto, di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lefosi lɛlɛɛ naasinle kamɛ yi, ni di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan, wɔ niale ni Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar kpɛmblatɛ lawa Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Aabakpee ɔtɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, lɛkayo ku Yerusalem ayo amuu. Aafiɛ leyo finle biala aatɛ kaasɔ. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Babel batii bakpɛtɛ bamuu ba niasiɛ ni di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu kalɔ labibiɛ seyoyiɛ se simuu niamana Yerusalem siakyi nii. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Ninfɛ di ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan lakpaa bapiitɛ nwaa bawo ku mba niabu baasiɛ ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ, diɛkyakaa ni di kɔnɛɛ kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ ku mba niadie baasifi ni Babel ɔka ɔkyɛ aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Kafɔɔ Nebusaradan ladiɛ kasɔ nwu bapiitɛ bule aatɛ alɛ batɔɔkpɛ nta awosobi afe ku afe.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Babel batii nwu labibiɛ abɔɔsaa sɛɛle akpaka nwu, atikasaa ya mankyisa ni ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle Lekpo babɛɛsi ba niayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, ni baatuka abɔɔsaa sɛɛle nwu amuu baasifiko Babel nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Baayɔ kafɔɔ abukii, basoofi, kandiɛ sikũ, babɛɛsi ba man-yɔ manwanwanyi ni ntɔ, abɛɛsibii ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle anwansaa ya amuu mamblako ni ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ baasifiko. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu layɔ babɛɛsi, olufui afiɛsaa, babɛɛsi ba manwanwanyi ni ntɔ, abukii, kandiɛ atikasaa, nkɔkɔɛ ku sipũ se man-yɔ mamblako ni asaaɔta nta ɔkpɛ- asaa ya amuu baayɔ koto sɛɛle ee koto fututu nwaa baabla ni baasifiko.<verse eid="JER 52:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Abɔɔsaa sɛɛle ya baadiki baakyeko ni akpaka nwu anyɔ kamɛ, Lekpo bɛɛsi ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle banakyue-suɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ ba niasiɛ ni niini kalɔ, atikasaa ya mankyisa ni, n-ya di Ɔka Solomon labla aata ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, lapɔ aalenkee n-ya baakadi nii. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Lɛkpaka biala lɛtaka labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ ku nkpaa lefosi-anɛ diakyɛka. Dibiala opĩ labla anɛɛbi ana, di otuu late ni kaamɛ kafɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle ditikasaa le niatika ni di lɛkpaka ninwii nsintɛɛ lɛtaka labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ ku ɔfã, ni baabla abɔɔsaa sɛɛle awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa aalososaa baatika baakyisa nimuu nɛ. Lɛkpaka nyɔɔfa nwu, awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa late fɛ nninkpo okle. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa niatika ni di sɛlɔɔkɔ labla afosi-anaasĩ-akuɔ; nioso awosobi ya niatika aakyi ni nsintɛɛ lɛpɔ labla kɔlafa.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakpaa Yuda Batii Baasifiko Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu lakpaa oletatɛ nɔɔfo Seraia, Sefania wɔ niatikanko ni di sɛnɔɔfo kanya ku n-yoko banyuntɛ batiɛ nwu aasifiko leyo katenkɔ. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Di mba kafɔɔ niabu baasiɛ ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ yi, aakpaa ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ niayila ni di basuɔtɔ ba ninkpɛ ni kanya, ku ɔka disibubatatɛ bakuɛnsĩ aasifiko. Aakpaa kafɔɔ kukũkpanatɛ wɔ niale ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo wɔ niayila ni di kasɔ nwu batii ayooto nsũɔtɛ kanya ku batii nɔɔ afosi-akuɔ ba aanya ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ aasifiko. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Ni di kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan nwu lakpaa bamuu lɛma aawako Babel ɔka nfũ di Ribla nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu lata baalo ma di Ribla, di Hamat kasɔ suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Nioso Yuda ladie di kasɔ nɔɔ aasifi sɛlanle kamɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Nnya batii ba di Nebukadnesar lakpaa aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ lɛpɔ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:28" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 52:28">di lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ yi, Yuda batii nkpe ntiɛ-afosi-anyɔ-batiɛ;<verse eid="JER 52:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />di Nebukadnesar lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:29">Yerusalem batii alafa anɛ-afosi-atiɛ-banyɔ;<verse eid="JER 52:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />di alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-ditiɛfa nɔɔ kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">ɔka banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan lakpaa Yuda batii alafa akuɛnsĩ-afosi-ana-banɔɔ aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">batii nwu bamuu labla nkpe nna-alafa akuɔ.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Yehoiakin Di Leyo Katenkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakin sɛlanle kamɛ osiɛ lɛlɛɛ afosi-atiɛ dikuɛnsinle kamɛ, di lɛlɛɛ le kamɛ di Ewil-Merodak labale ni ɔka di Babel yi, ni aadiki Yuda ɔka Yehoiakin, di leyo katenkɔ, aatɔɔ suoto osiɛko di afosi-anyɔ dii nɔnle suoto di Israel batii lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Aakakatɛ aatɔɔ ku sɛlɔ biene, aatɔɔ kafɔɔ dibu kasiɛkɔ ka niataka katoo kaalenkee ni baka bamba ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ di Babel n-le. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Nioso Yehoiakin ladiki leyo katenkɔ akpeele nɔɔ aatɛ, ni atoole alesaa obe lele kafɔɔ di ɔka opunu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Babel ɔka nwu latɔɔta Yehoiakin suoto onyu koto dii biala di obe kanya, di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni nkpa dialaase ni di dikpiyi nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>